<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="EZK" style="id">Ezekiel</book>
  <para style="h">Ezekiel</para>
  <para style="toc1">Ezekiel</para>
  <para style="toc2">Ezekiel</para>
  <para style="mt">Ezekiel</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />A kum sawm thumna, a hla lina, a ni nga ni-in Chebar gun gei-a saltangte lahah ka op laitahin vante ang kihongin Pasien’ kilahnate ka mu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tua hla a ni ngana (tua ni pen Kumpi Jehoiachin saltan a kum ngana ahi hi),
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Chaldea gam Chebar gun gei-a om Buzi’ tapa siempu Ezekiel tungah Topa’ thu tung hi; tuale ama tungah Topa’ khut khumtahah a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ka khuodah leh leilu lam panin huipi khat ang lang hi: meiilumpi khat ang kai-in a kimvel teng vah pempom a, khawl loin tun phe zing a, tuale meikuong laikim pen sumngo tang pimpem tawh kibang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tua meikuong laikim ah ganhing tawh a kibang li a om hi. Amate melpuoh zie tam bang dan ahi hi: amate in mihing mel puo uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Maitang li le hla li ciet nei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A kengte uh zang zitzet a, a ketawte uh bawngno’ ketaw bangin sumngo kinawtvam bangin te lihleh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Amate in hla a nei vua, a pang lite tungah mihing khut tawh a kibang a nei uhi. Tua lite in maitang le hlate tam bangin a nei uhi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />A hlate uh khatlekhat kimat dimdiem hi; a pei uh ciengin a mailam ciet a manaw vua, a kituomhei om lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />A maisuo dan uh tam bang ahi hi: tua lite in mihing maitang a nei vua, zietlam pangah humpinelkai’ mai, veilam pangah bawngtang’ mai, le mu vanlai’ mai a nei ciet uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />A hlate uh a tunglamah a zahto uhi; ganhingte in hla ni ciet a nei vua, a hlate uh khatlekhat kimatin a hla nite in a pumpi uh a tuom hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A mailam ciet manaw-in tangtahin a pei uhi; hlagau puina mun munah a mailam uh nawhin kihei loin a pei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tua ganhingte laikim ah meihol kuonglai tawh a kibang khat om a, tua ganhingte lahah meikuong kide bangin pei kawikawi hi; tua mei taang mama a, tua in tun a phesah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tua ganhingte tunphe bangin suhpei topei kawikawi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tua ganhingte ka en leh amate panga lei lahah lengkang khat ka mu a, a li-un lengkang khat ciet a nei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tua lengkangte’ lim le mel le a kibawl dan tam bang ahi hi: a hoi dan pen suongmanpha bangin val lihleh hi; a li-in a mel uh kibang ciet a, a kibawl dan ahile lengpei khat sunga lengpei khat kibul tawh kibang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />A pei uh ciengin kihei tawm loin a ngatna lite uh mun khat popo-ah a pei thei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />A lengkang kuolte uh pen sangin cizat a huoi hi, azieh pen tua lengkang kuol lite a unpi-un mittang vive tawh a kidim hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ganhing lite a pia uh ciengin a panga lengkangte zong kilia pai hi; tuale lei lah panin tua ganhingte a kato ciengin tua lengkangte zong kato pai uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Hlagau peina popo ah amate zong pei a, tuale tuate tawh a lengkangte a kikhinton valiai uhi; azieh pen tua lengkangte sungah ganhingte’ hlagau a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tua ganhingte a pia uh ciengin amate zong pia pai uhi; tua ganhingte a khawl uh ciengin tuate zong khawl pai uhi; tuale lei lah panin ganhingte a kikhanto nah po leh a lengkangte zong amate tawh kikhangto pai lien hi; azieh pen tua lengkangte sungah ganhingte’ hlagau a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tua ganhingte’ lutungah limlang banga a te lihleh le a kuoh kimkiam bang khat om a, amau’ luvumah kizahto suoh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tua a kuoh kimkiam nei-ah a hlate khatlekhat kizomin tangtahin a zah vua, ganhing khat in hla ni ciet nei-in tua pen a pumpi uh tuomna-in a nei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Ganhingte a pia uh ciengin a hlaging uh pen tui tampi husa ging, Vanglienpa in van a thinna ging, le galkap honpi’ husa ging tawh a kibang hi; a khawl ciengun amate in a hla a khup uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tuale a lutung son vua om a kuoh kimkiam tung panin aw khat ang ging hi; a khawl ciengun amate in a hla a khup uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Amau’ lutung son taha a om a kuoh kimkiam tungah sapphire suongmanpha tawh a melpuoh a kisun kumpi topha bang khat a om hi; tua kumpi topha tawh a kisun tungah mihing lim tawh a kibang khat a to hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />A kawng tungsie tawh a kibang teng pen sumngo mei-a kihal a san pimpem bangin ka mu a, meikuong tawh kibang khat in a kimvelah a tuom hi; a kawng neilam tawh a kibang teng pen meikuong bangin ka mu a, a kimvel teng tang pimpem hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Guo a zuh ni ciengin meiilum lahah ang kai sakhi-guihlung mel bang puo-in a kimvelah tang piehpuah hi. Tam pen Topa’ minthanna vang tawh a kisun mel kilahna khat ahi hi. Khum khu ka mu ciengin khupbawhin ka kunsuh a, tuale mi khat’ thugen ka za hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ama in keima kungah, “Mihing aw, na keng tawh dingto inlen, na kungah thu kang gen ding hi,” ei ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tuale ama in keima kungah thu ang gen ciengin ka sungah hlagau khat ang lutin ka keng tawh ei dingtosah hi; tuale ama’ ei hopina ka za hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ama in ka kungah, “Mihing aw, keima in a ledo minam, kei ei langpangin ei ledo Israel mite kunga pei dingin nang kang sawl hi; amate le a pu a pate un tuni cieng dongin keima ei langpangin a gamta khiel uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A suonlehlahte uh zum mel thei loin a lung khau uhi. Amate kungah kang sawl a, nangma in amate kungah, “ Topa in tam bangin gen hi,” na ci ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Amate in a ngai vua a ngai sih zongun, (azieh pen amate mi ledo innkuon ahi uhi) amate in note lahah kamsang khat a op zo lamtah a thei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuale nang, mihing aw, ling le khau in hing kimkotin mom-ai lahah teng nan lacin amate giing sinlen a thugente ziehun zau malmal sin; amau’ thugente ziehin zau sinlen, ang dugaw-et vangun zong lungkie beh sin, azieh pen amate pen a ledo innkuon ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Amate in a ngai vua, a ngai sih zongun ka thugente amate tungah na gen ding hi, azieh pen amate pen a ledo innkuon ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ahi vangin nang, mihing aw, nang tunga kang gen thu khu ngai in; tua a ledo innkuonte bangin ledo sin; na kam kah inlen kang pieh khu ne in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuaci’n ka en leh, ka kungah khut ang zamphei khat ka mu a, tua khut sungah laiziel khat a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ka mai-ah ama in ang zah a, kaa le mau, thum le tau thu vive a nua le a mai-ah kigiel hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ama in ka kungah mihing aw, nang kang pieh khu ne in; tami laiziel ne inlen pei-in Israel innkuonte kungah va gen in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tuaci’n ka kam ka kah a, ama in ka neh dingin tua laiziel ei pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ama in ka kungah, “Mihing aw, nang kang pieh tami laiziel ne inlen na gil vasah in. Tua ciengin ka ne hi; tua pen ka kamah khuoizu bangin a hlum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ama in ka kungah, “Mihing aw, Israel innkuonte kungah pei inlen, amate kungah ka thute va gen ta’n.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Azieh pen a ham a kitel lo le ham hahsa a zang mite kunga ang kisawl ahi sih a, Israel innkuonte kunga ang kisawl ahi bo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />A ham na tel thei lo, ham kitel lo le ham hahsa a zang mi tampite kunga ang kisawl hi lo hi. Amate kunga ang sawl hi leng, amate in na thugen ang ngai tahtah ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ahi vangin Israel innkuonte in ka thugen a ngai nuom lo ziehun nang thugen zong a ngai nuom tuom sih ding uhi; bangzieh ahei cile Israel innkuon zosie in a sah talpang le a khau lungtang a nei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />En in, amate mai langkhatah na mai ka khausah zo ta a, na talpang zong ka khausah zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Keima in na talpang suongsah khu meituh suong sanga a sahzaw-in ka bawlzo hi; amate a ledo innkuon ahi ziehun amate giing sinlen lungkiehna-in zong nei sin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ama in ka kungah a gen hi: Mihing aw, keima in na kunga kang thugen ding zosie na lungsimin sang inlen na bilin za in;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />tua ciengin saltang na mite kungah pei inlen amate kungah va gen in. Amate in a ngai a, a ngai nuom sih zongvun a kung vuah, “ Topa in tam bangin gen hi,” va ci tan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tua ciengin hlagau in kei ei domto a, ama’ opna mun panin Topa’ minthanna vang ang kato laitahin, a nualamah a ging ngai mama khat ka za hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />tua pen ganhingte’ hla khatlekhat a kizapkhah gin le a panga lengkangte’ gin a na hi a, tuate a gin ngai mama hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Hlagau in keima ei domsangin ei puomang hi; keima tungah Topa’ khut a hat seng ziehin lungthah le hlasie-in ka pei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Chebar gunpi gei Telabib-a teng saltang mite kungah ka tung a, amate lahah ni sagi sung amkham gawpin ka om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ni sagi a cin ciengin ka tungah Topa’ thu tam bangin ang tung hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Mihing aw, Israel innkuonte’ galvil pa dingin nang kang koi zo hi; ka kam sung panin thu na zah sielin amate tungah ka thuhilkholnate na gensawn ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Keima in migilote kungah, “Na si valon ding uhi,” ka ci-a, tuale nang in amate na hilkhol sih a, ahi sihle a hinna uh a kihumbih thei nadingin a gitlona lampi panun amate a kikhel thei nadingin thu na hilkhol sih leh, amau’ khielna ziehin tua migilote si ding uhi; hinanle keima in amau’ sisan nang kungah kang phul ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Nang in migilote hilkhol napi a gitlona uh khawl tuom loin, ahi sihle amau’ gitlona lampi panin a kihei nop kan sih uleh, amau’ khielna tawh amate si ding hi; hizongle nang in na hinna na hundam ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tua banah mi thudihte, amau’ dihna panin kihei-in khielna a bawl vua, keima in amate mai-ah kipalpuana ding ka koi-a ahile, amate a si ding uhi; azieh pen nang in amate na sam sih a, amau’ mawna tawh amate a si ding vua, amau’ a dih gamtatnate kiphawh kha nawn lo ding a, keima in nang tungah amau’ sisan kang phul ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ahi vangin mi dihte a maw lo nadingun na hilkhol a, mawna a bawl sih uleh, na thusapna a sansiem ziehun a hing valon ding uhi. Tuale nang in na nuntahna na hundam ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tua ciengin khum munah Topa’ khut ka tungah ang om hi; tuale ama in ka kungah, “ Tho inlen kuom sungah va pei ta’n. Khum sungah kang hopi ding hi,” ei ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tuaci’n kei zong tho-in kuom sungah ka pei hi; keima in Chebar gun gei-ah a minthanna vang ka mu ma bangin khum munah zong Topa’ minthanna vang a na ding hi; tuale kei zong lei lahah ka bawhsuh pai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Ka sungah hlagau ang lutin ka keng tawh ei dingsah hi; tuale ama in kei ei hopi-in ka kungah, “Pei inlen na inn sungah kot kikhalu in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Mihing aw, na tungah khauhuol ang kikoi ding a, na mite lahah na pei thei lo nadingin tua khauhuolte tawh ang kikanbawm ding hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />tuale amate na phawsiet thei lo nadingin na dangtawngah na lei kang behsah ding a, a ham thei loin kang koi ding hi; azieh pen amate, a ledo innkuonte ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Hizongle nang kang hopi ciengin na kam ka hong ding a, amate kungah, “ Topa in tam bangin ci hi,” na ci ding hi; a za nuomte in za hinlen, a za nuom lote in zah da uheh; azieh pen amate a ledo innkuon ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuale nang, “Mihing aw, tehlei khat la-in na mai-ah koi in. A tungah Jerusalem khuopi lim suoi in;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />tuale a sim nadingin kui-imnate koi inlen, tuami sim nadingin gal nanna kul bawlin leicien cieng in; tua khuopi do nadingin galphuolte bawl inlen, a kimvelah kulpi suhkhap nading phawhbulte phut in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tua ciengin sia pheng khat la inlen nang le khuopi kikalah sia kulpi bangin tung in; na mai tua lam ngat inlen, tua khuopi a ki-imtawm danin omsah inlen sawn citahin sawn in. Tam pen Israel innkuonte dinga lim khat ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tua ciengin na veilam netpha-in lum inlen, tua tungah Israel innkuon dan kipiehna koi in; khum sunga na lup ni tantan amate dan kipiehna teng na puo ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Azieh pen nang tungah amate dan kipiehna ding kum phaza tawh a kikim, ni zathum le ni sawmkuo kang pie hi. Tuaci’n nang in Israel innkuonte dan kipiehna na puo ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tam teng na man zaw ciengin a ni veina na zietlam netpha-in na lumkia ding a, Judah innkuonte’ dan kipiehna na puo ding hi. Ni sawmli sung kang sepieh a, ni khat pen kum khat tang bang ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A ki-imtawm Jerusalem lam na mai ngat ding a, na puonah ban zielin tua khuopi in a tuo ding thu mavang na gen ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />En in, na khuopi imtawmna hun a man masangsie langkhat panin langkhatah na kihei thei lo nadingin khauhuol tawh kang kanbawm ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuale mangbu, mangbuham, belawi le besan, tang le tangman la in; kuong sung khatah tuate koi inlen, nangma adingin moh bawl in. Na sih lup hun ahi ni zathum le ni sawmkuo sung tua moh na ne ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Na neh ding an pen ni khatin shekel sawmni gih hi ding hi; a kise hunin tua an na ne ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuale na tui dawn ding zong kite ding a, hin khat’ seguh-suo-sekhat hi ding hi; a kise hunin na dawn ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Nang in mihing’ eh tunga a ki-em moh pen a muna vuah mangbuham-moh bangin na ne ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Topa in, “Israel mite in amate ka delmang nading minamte lahah tam bangin a sieng lo moh a ne ding uhi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tua ciengin keima in, “Ah Topa Pasien! Bangma cihin kei le kei ka kibuasah ngai sih hi; ka neu lai panin tu dongin ama thu-a a si ahi a, gamsate in a tha sa ahi zongin ka ne ngai sih a, ka kam sungah sa uithante zong tum kha ngai nai lo hi,” ka ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tua ciengin ama in ka kungah, “En in, mihing-eh tangin bawng-eh kang hisah ding a, tua tungah na moh na em ding hi,” ei ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tua ciengin ama in ka kungah, “Mihing aw, Jerusalem ah an le tui ka tawpsah ding hi; amate in a zau kawmun a kitesa an le tui a ne ding uhi; amate in a lunggim kawmun a kitesa tui a dawn ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />An le tui a kitasap ziehin a lunggim kawmun amate khatlekhat ki-enin, gimna dan a thuoh ziehun a gawngtam ding uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuale nang, “Mihing aw, namsau hiem mama khat la in; na sam le na khamul heu nadingin samheute’ samheuna nam bangin zang in; tua ciengin a te nading tawikhaina la inlen, na sam a lomlomin khen in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Imtawmna hun a cin ciengin tua na sam sethum-suo-sekhat khuopi sungah na hal ding hi; nangma in sethum-suo-sekhat na la ding a, khuopi kimkot ah namsau tawh na sattan ding hi; tuale sethum-suo-sekhat pen hui lahah na thethang ding a, tuale keima in namsau a pai panin dawhin tuate ka del ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tua ciengin tamte lah panin themkhat na la ding a, na puontuol mong ah na khi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tuate lah panin kimkhat na lakia ding a, mei sungah tuate pai-in na haltum ding hi; khum sung panin Israel innkuonte do nading mei a kuong ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Topa Pasien in tam bangin gen hi: Tami khu Jerusalem ahi hi; minamte laikimah ama ka koi zo a, a kimvel zosie-ah gamte in ka kimkotsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ahi vangin ama in ka thukhamte le ka ngaina kipte ledo-in a kimvela om minamte le gam zosie sangin a gilozaw suoh a, ka ngaina kipte nielin ka thukhamte a zui sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin Topa Pasien in tam bangin gen hi: Na kimvela om minam zosie sangin na buoihuoi zaw vua, tuale ka thukhamte zui loin, ahi sihle ka ngaina kipte na kemcing sih vua, note kimvela a om minamte’ ngaina tawh kituohin na gamta zawsop uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />tua ahi ziehin Topa Pasien in tam bangin gen hi: Kei mama nang langkhatah kang pang ding a, note lahah a om minamte muna-ah thu ka khen ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuale na kidahhuoinate ziehin ka bawl ngai nai vawt lo, zong ka nuabawl kia ngai nawn lo ding thu na tungah ka bawl ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Note lahah pate in tate’ sa ne-in, tate in zong pate’ sa a ne tahtah ding uhi; keima in na tungah thu kang khen ding a, note lahah a suohta sunte muncin tengah kang thethang ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin Topa Pasien in a genna-ah, keima a hing ka hi ma bangin, a huothuoi nate le a kidahhuoi zosie tawh ka biehinn na buasah ziehun note kang suhmang sih tah ma leh, ci-in ka kiciem hi, tua ahi ziehin keima in note kang sumaimang ding hi; ka mit in mu loin ang koi sih ding a, zong kang khuotuo sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Note lahah pulnatna le kielin sethum-suo-sekhat na si ding uhi; na kimvel vuah sethum-suo- sekhat pen namsau tawh na si ding uhi; tuale sethum- suo-sekhat pen mun cintengah ka thethang ding a, namsau a pai pana dawsa-in amate ka nuadel ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ka lungthahna ka tungsah ding a, amate tungah ka lunghanna buosuhin kei le kei ka kilungkimsah ding hi; amate tungah ka lunghanna ka tunsah ciengin keima, Topa in ka thangsietna tawh thugen ka hi lam amate in ei thei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tua banah noma kunga ang suohkha zosiete muna-ah na kimvel vua minamte lahah a hawmkieu le simmaw etsatin kang bawl ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Note tungah lunghamna le lungthahna tawh a nasie mama gimna dante kang pieh a, thu kang khen ciengin na kimvel vua minamte adingin note pen simmawna le nuizatnopna, galgihna le zauhuoina-in na om ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Note suhsiet nadingin keima’ suhsietna thaltang le kielna thaltang kang kap ciengin note kang khasah ding a, note tungah kiel hing tunsahbe-in na an na tui ngana uh kang khahtanpieh ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Note ang do dingin kielpi le gamsate kang sawl ding a, amate in na tate uh kang guhpiehsah ding hi; pulnatna le sisan luonna in note ang nawh kha ding uhi; tuale keima in note tungah namsau kang tusah ding hi. Keima, Topa in kang gen zo hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa’ thu ka kungah ang tung hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Mihing aw, Israel muolte lam na maingatin amau langah thu phuong inlen,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />tuale gen in. No Israel muolte aw, Topa Pasien thugen ngai un! Topa Pasien in muol le tangte, kuomte le guomte tungah tam bangin a gen hi: Kei mama in na tung vuah namsau kang tusah ding a, na munsangte uh ka susie ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Na maitamte uh hawmsuoh ding a, na gimnamtui halna taute uh kitawkeh ding hi; tuale keima in na milimte uh mai-ah a kithat mite ka sepsuh ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Keima in a milimte uh mai-ah Israel misi luongte ka siel ding hi; tuale na maitam kimvel vuah na gu na tang teng uh ka thezah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Na tenna mun popo vuah na khuopite uh hawmsuohin na munsangte uzong kisusie ding a, na maitamte uh hawmsuohin kisusie-in, na milimte uh kitawkehin kisusie ding a, na gimnamtui halna taute uh kisattawngin nasepna teng uh maimang ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Na laikim vuah a kithatte a pua ding uhi; tua ciengin note in keima Topa ka hi lam nei thei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ahi vangin keima in mi kimkhat ka suohtasah ding hi. Minamte lahah kimkhat namsau panin suohta-in gamcin tengah na kithethang ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Saltang dinga a kipeipina munah a om minamte lah panin a suohta sunte in a kideh zo lo a lungsim ziehun keima kung panin vahmang nan ule a kideh zo lo a mit ziehun a milimte uh’ nua a zuina uh ziehin, ka lungsim a kitapzan lamtah amate in thei siemin keima ei phawh ding uhi. Tua ciengin a kidahhuoi gitlona a bawlte zosie uh ziehin amahaw mama a huothuoi-in kimu ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuale amate in kei pen amate tungah tami gimna a tungsah dinga a mawh galgih Topa ka hi lo lam ei thei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Topa Pasien in tam bangin gen hi: Israel innkuonte’ gitlona le a kidahhuoi a gamtatnate uh ziehin na khut bengin na kengin tuol sia inlen, “Aw kadei,” ci-in! Bangzieh ahei cile amahaw, namsau, kielpi, le pulnatna tawh a si ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Gamlapi-a omte pul natna tawh a si ding uhi; a nai-a omte namsau tawh a si ding uhi; tuale a kihingkhawi a kinuasiete zong kielin a si ding uhi. Tam bangin amate tungah ka lungthahna ka tungsah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tuale a maitam kimvel vua a milimte lah uh, muolsang tung zosie, muoldawn tung zosie, singna dum nei zosie, a na pha gangpi sing nei zosie, le muncin tenga a milimte uh mai, le gimnamtui biehna a luina uh mun tengah a mi kithatte uh’ luong a kisiel ciengin note in keima Topa ka hi lam nei thei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Amate langkhatah ka khut ka zah ding a, amau’ tenna mun zosie, senel gam pan Riblah khuo dong gamkhing le a hawmsuohin ka bawl ding hi. Tua ciengin amate in keima Topa ka hi lam ei thei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa’ thu ka kungah ang tung hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Nang mihing aw, Israel gam adingin Topa Pasien in tam bangin a gen hi: A tawpna! Gam ningli ah a tawpna ang tung ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tu-in nang tungah a tawpna ang tung a, keima in nang tungah ka lungthahna kang hla ding hi; na gamtatna dung zui-in thu kang khen ding a, na kidahhuoina zosie ziehin dan kang pie ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ka mit in mu loin kang koi sih ding a, zong kang khuotuo sih ding hi. Note lahah kidahhuoi nate a op laitahin, na gamtatna utawh kizui-in dan kang pie ding hi. Tua ciengin note in keima Topa ka hi lam nei thei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Topa Pasien in tam bangin gen hi: Gimna khat zaw gimna khat! En in, ang tung zo ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />A tawpna khat ang tung a, a tawpna ang tung ta hi. Nang tawh kido dingin ang khanglo ta hi; en in, ang tung ta!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Gam sunga teng mite aw, na manthai hun ding uh ang tung ta hi. A ni ang nai a, a hun ang tung ta hi, muol tung guolnopna hi loin, kisuhbuoina ni ang nai ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tu-in a sawt loin na tungah ka lungthahna kang buosuh ding hi; nang langkhatah ka lungthahna ka zang ding hi. Na gamtatna zui-in na tungah thu ka khen ding a, na kidahhuoina zosie ziehin dan kang pie ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ka mit in ang mu loin na om sih ding hi; zong kang khuotuo sih ding hi. Kidahhuoina tawh na op laitahin, na gamtatna dung zui-in dan kang pie ding hi. Tua ciengin note in keima pen mi a vuo Topa ka hi lam nei thei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />En vawi, a ni khu! En vawi, ang tung ta! Na manthaina ang tung ta hi. Paape bangin ciengpum paa a, paape bangin kiphatsahna a meng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ngongtatna pen gitlona ciengpum suohin khanglien hi. Amau’ kicinna, amau’ hauna, amau’ thupinate, khat zong a kip sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A hun ang tung ta a, a ni ang nai ta hi; van leite kipah sih uh hinlen, vanzuate lungdam sih heh. Mihonpite tungah lungthahna a tun ziehin, a leite kipah da uh hinlen, a zuate zong da tuon sih heh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile a neisa zuate in a hin sungun amate kungah a zuasa uh vante ang kinuale lo ding hi. Azieh pen tami mangmuna pen mihonpi tawh kisai ahi hi; tua pen kidawhkia thei nawn lo ding hi. Amau’ khielna ziehin amau’ hinna a humbih zo sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Amate in pengkul mutin na zosie a baisa-in omsah zo uhi; hinanle gal do dingin koima kuon lo hi, azieh pen mipi zosie tungah a lungthahna a tung hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />A pulamah namsau, a sunglamah pulnatna le kielpi; gam sunga omte namsau-in a si vua, khuopi sunga omte ahile kielpi le pul natna in a nawmval hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />A hinga suohta khatpo a op leh, a mawna uh ziehin muol dawnah a om ding vua, kuom sunga vakhu omte bangin amate kap le mau-in a om ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Khut zosie zaw ding a, khup zosie tui suoh ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Amate in la-ip puon a sil ding vua, zauna in amate tuomcip ding hi. Maitang zosie in zummai puo ding a, a lu uh kimettol ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Lam dungah a ngunte uh a paithang ding vua, a khamte uh zong a sieng loin kingaisun ding hi. Topa’ lungthah ni ciengin a ngun ule a khamte un amate a hundam thei sih hi. Amate in tuate tawh a gilkiel uh phasah thei loin, a gil uzong a vasah thei sih uhi. Bangzieh ahei cile tua pen a khielna uh zieha a kipalna uh ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />A kiphatsahpi uh ahi a etlawm a kizepnate uh panin amate in a mudahuoi le a kidahhuoi milimte a bawl uhi; tua ahi ziehin keima in amate adingin tuate a niehin ka bawl ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Gamdang mite’ khut sungah tuate galvanlahin ka pie ding a, migilote tungah vanlah-in ka pie ding hi; amate in tua khu a buasah ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Amate in ka munsieng a buasah thei nadingun keima in ka mai ka lengat ding hi; a sungah mi bulute lutin a buasah ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Hatkilih khat kibawl un! Azieh pen gam sungah sisansuo mawna dim hi; khuopi sungah tatsietna a dim hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Amau’ innte suon dingin nam gilo pente kang peipi ding hi. Mi thahatte kilietsahna ka tawpsah ding a, amau’ mun siengthote ka buasah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Amate in lungkhamna ang tun ciengin hlamuonna a sui ding vua, ahi vangin a mu sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Gimna khat zaw gimna khat tungin, kam baleng khat zaw khat kiza hi; kamsangte tung panin mangmuna a suisui ding uhi; siempute tung panin thuhilna mangthai ding a, upate kung panin thumopna mangthai ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Kumpipa da-in kap ding a, uliente in lunggimna puon silin, gam mite’ khut kiling ding hi. Amau’ gamtat dan dung zui-in amate tungah ka sem ding a, amau’ thukhen dan dung zui-in amate tungah ka khen ding hi. Tuaci’n amate in keima Topa ka hi lam ei thei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />A kum guhna kum, a hla guhna, a ni nga ni-in ka inn sungah ka to laitahin ka mai-ah Judah uliente ang to vua, tuale khum mun ka tungah Topa Pasien’ khut ang tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Keima in ka en a, mihing’ lim tawh a kibang dan khat a om hi; a kawng neisie mei tawh kibang a, a kawng tungsie sumngo tang pimpem tawh kibang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ama in khut tawh a kibang khat ang zahsuh a, tuale ka humsam ah ei man hi; tuale hlagau in lei le van kikalah ei khaito a, Pasien’ mangmunate sungah ama in Jerusalem leilu lam biehinn tuol sungnung lutna tunkot-a thangsietna a piengsah milim kitunna mun ei tun hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tuale khum tahah Israel Pasien’ minthanna na om a, tua pen kuom sunga ka musa mangmuna tawh kibang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tua ciengin Pasien in ka kungah, “Mihing aw, leilu lam nga-in dahto in,” ei ci hi. Tuaci’n leilu lam nga-in ka dahto leh khumtah maitam tunkot leilu lam lutna munah tami thangsietna milim na om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ama in keima kungah, “Mihing aw, amate in keima’ munsiengtho panin a gamlapi ah ei nawmang thei nadingun tam munah Israel innkuonte in a kidahhuoi gamtatnate a bawl uh na mu ei mah? ei ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuale ama in inntuol lutna-ah ei peipi hi; keima in ka en leh kulvang mun khat na om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tua ciengin ama in ka kungah, “Mihing aw, tua kul to vawi,” ei ci hi; ka to pai leh khum munah kot khat ka mu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ama in kei kungah, “A sungah tum inlen, a mudahuoi a gamtatnate uh va en ta’n,” ei ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuaci’n kei zong pei-in ka va en ta hi; khumtah kawm tung tengah a bawhva ganhing namcin’ lim, a kidahhuoi gamsa lim, le Israel innkuonte’ bieh ganhing namcin lim na kisuoi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Amate mai-ah Israel innkuon’ upa sawmsagite a na ding a, tuate lahah Shaphan’ tapa Jaazaniah zong na ding hi. Amate in gimnamtui kuong khat ciet a tawi vua, tuale van lamah gimnamtui halna meikhu a kato valuh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tua ciengin ama in ka kungah, “Mihing aw, miel lahah Israel innkuon upate in a milim inndan sung ciet vua a bawl uh na mu zo tai mah? Azieh pen amate in, ‘ Topa in eite ei mu lo hi, Topa in tam gam nuasie ta hi,’ ci uhi,” ei ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ama in keima kungah, “Tam teng sanga a mudahuoi zaw a bawlte uh na mu lai ding hi,” zong ei ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tua ciengin ama in Topa’ biehinn sung lutna leilu lam tunkot ah ei tut a, khumnah Tammuz a kici pasien kaa-in numeite a to uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tua ciengin ama in ka kungah, “Mihing aw, tami na mu tai mah? Tam teng sanga a mudahuoi zaw na mu lai ding hi,” ei ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tuale ama in Topa’ leituol sungnungah ei peipi hi; khumtah, Topa’ biehinnpi lutna innhlap le maitam kikalah mi sawmni le nga tang ding khat na om a, Topa’ biehinn nua ngatin nisuona lam a nga vua, nisuona lam nga-in ni bie-in a na khupbawh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tua ciengin ama in ka kungah, “Mihing aw, tami na mu zo tai mah? Tami sunga Judah innkuonte in a bawl uh a mudahuoi a gamtatnate uh a siehuoi seng sih amah? Amate in tatsietna tawh gamsung kidimsahin, ka lungthah zawh lai nadingin ei phin ding uh a kul ma amah? En in, a nahkuo vuah singba a siet uh khula!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin lungthahna tawh amate tungah ka gamta ding hi; ka mit in amate mu loin ka koi sih ding a, zong ka khuotuo sih ding hi; tuale keima’ zahna ah awging tahin ang kiko vangun a thungetna uh ka ngaipieh sih ding hi,” ei ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tua ciengin keima’ zahin nahpi tahin ama ang kiko a, “No khuopi a that mite aw, ei nai unlen, na khut vuah suhsiet nading na hiem uh hing tawi ciet un,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tuale leilu lam kinga kotpi tungnung lam panin mi guh hing pei-in a khut vuah mi thana hiem khat ciet a tawi uhi; amate lahah pasal puonkang sil khat om a, a pangah laitui bung khat a tawi hi. Amate ang tumin sumngo maitam gei-ah ang ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Khum laitahin a om ngaina Cherub panin Israel Pasien’ minthanna vang ang peito a, biehinn kotbieng ah ang khawl hi. Topa in puonkang a sil, a panga laitui bung nei pa ang hlan hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />tuale ama kungah, “Jerusalem khuopi sung zosie ah vah kawikawi inlen, tua sunga sil mudahuoi kibawl zosie ziehin khuisa-in a tau mite’ talpangah melicina va bawl ta’n,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ama in midangte kungah, “Khuopi sung zosie-ah ama nua zui unlen mi va that ta un; na mit un mu lo a nei sih ding a, koima zong na khuotuo sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Puteh, tangval, ngahnu, numei, naupangte that sieng unlen, ahi vangin ciemtena nei poma khoikha sih un. Tuale ka biehinn ah pan pai un,” a ci hi. Tuaci’n amate in biehinn mai-a om upate lahah a pan pai uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tua ciengin ama in a kung vuah, “Biehinn buasah unlen, a leituol tengah misi luong dimsah un. Kuon ta un!” a ci hi. Tuaci’n amate kuonin khuopi sungah mi a thatgam uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Amate in mi a tha laitahun kei guoh ei nuasie vua, tuale kei zong tuol kunin ka bawhsuh a, “Kadei Topa Pasien! Jerusalem tunga na lungthahna na sunhlah ziehin Israel a omsun teng zong na thagam sieng ding ahi ta amah?” ci-in ka kiko hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ama in keima kungah, “Israel innkuonte le Judah innkuonte’ khielna nah gol seng luo hi; gam sung teng sisan tawh kidim a, khuo sung teng letatna tawh kidim hi; azieh pen amate in, ‘Gam sung, Topa in taisan zo a, Topa in mu nawn lo hi,’ ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Kei ka hi leh ka mit in mu lo nei loin khuotuona zong ka nei sih ding a, a gamtatnate uh amate tungah ka tusah ding hi,” ei ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tua ciengin puonkang a sil, a panga laitui bung tawi pa in thu ang nua tutkia a, “Nei sawl bangin ka sem zo hi,” ei ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tua ciengin ka en leh, cherub-te lu tungson a kuoh kimkiam tungah sapphire tawh a kibawl kumpi topha bang pien khat ang kilang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ama in puonkang silpa kungah, “Cherub-te nei-a a om lengkang kipeite kawmah lut in; cherub-te lahah mei-am na khutdim ham inlen khuopi tungah thezah in,” a ci hi. Keima in ka en leh a sungah ama a lut hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tu-in mipa ang lut ciengin cherub-te biehinn leitaw lam pangah na ding uhi; tuale meiilum khat in biehinn tuol sungnung teng ang khu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tua ciengin cherub tung panin Topa’ minthanna vang ang kato-in biehinn sangkil ah ang om hi. Biehinnpi meiilum tawh kidimin a tuol teng Topa’ minthanna vang in a tanvah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Vanglienpa a ham ciengin a awging bangin biehinn inntuol pulam dongah Cherub-te’ hlazap ging kiza hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ama in puonkang silpa kungah, “Cherub-te lahah a om lengkang kipeite lah panin mei la in,” ci-in a sawl ciengin ama lutin lengkang gei khatah a ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuale cherub khat in cherub-te lah panin cherub-te lahah a om mei-am lamah a khut zahin mei-am pawlkhat la a, puonkang silpa’ khut sungah tua mei-am a koi hi. Tua pa in zong mei la-in a pei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tua cherub-te in a hla nei vuah mihing khut tawh a kibang a nei ciet uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Keima in ka en leh, cherub-te gei-ah lengkang li om a, cherub khat’ pangah lengkang khat ciet om hi; tuale lengkangte beryl suong bangin a tee dimdiem hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuate’ melpuoh dan ahile a li-un a kibang ciet vua, lengkang khat sunga lengkang dang khat a om a bang uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Amate a pei cieng ule kihei tawm loin amau’ ngatna lite khat popo ah a pei thei uhi; a pei masa pen kingatna lam lamah a zui vua, a kihei vateh sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tua lengkang lite in-a vielkuolte le a kamnate, a hlate le a lengkangte ah- amau’ pumpi zosie teng dimin mit a nei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />A lengkangte pen ka zahna-ah “lengkang kipeite” kici hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Amate in maitang li ciet nei uhi: a masa pen cherub maitang, a nina mihing maitang, a thumna humpi maitang, le a lina muvanlai maitang ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Cherub-te ang kato uhi. Tamte pen Chebar gun gei-a ka mu ganhing lite ma ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Cherub-te a kin ciengun a lengkangte zong amate tawh a kinton hi; tuale cherub-te in lei panin a lengto dinga a hla uh a zah ciengin amate lampang pana a om lengkangte a piel sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />A khawl uh ciengin adangte zong khawl a, a kato uh ciengin a dangte zong amate tawh kato hi; azieh pen amate sungah ganhingte’ hlagau a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tua ciengin biehinn sangkil panin Topa ang pusuohin cherub-te tungson ah ang khawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Cherub-te in ka muna-ah a hla uh ang zahto vua, lei panin a kung vua om lengkangte tawh a kato uhi. Topa’ biehinn lutna nisuona lam tunkot ah amate a khawl uhi; tuale amate tungah Israel Pasien’ minthanna vang a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tam teng pen keima in Chebar gun gei-a Israel Pasien nei sontahah ka na musa ganhingte ahi uhi; amate pen cherub-te ahi lam zong ka thei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Amate in maitang li ciet, hla li ciet le a hla nei vuah mihing khut bang a nei ciet uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Amau’ maitang pen Chebar gun gei-a ka musa maitangte ma bang a, a pei ciengun a mailam ciet ma-ah tangtahin a pei uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hlagau in keima ei domto a, nisuona lam a kinga Topa’ biehinn nisuona lam tunkot ah ei peipi hi. Khum mun tunkot lutna ah mihing sawmni le nga a om hi; khumte lahah mipi makai Azzur’ tapa Jaazaniah, Benaiah’ tapa Petlatiah-te na om uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ama in ka kungah, “Mihing aw, tam pasal teng pen khuopi sunga sietna a bawlsawmte le thu gilo a mopte ahi uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />amate in, ‘Inn lam nading hun nai lo hi; tam khuopi pen beel ahi a, eite pen sa i hi uhi,’ a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin amate langkhatah thu va gen ta’n; mihing aw, thu va gen ta’n,” ei ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tua ciengin ka tungah Topa’ hlagau ang tu a, ama in keima kungah, “ Topa in tam bangin gen hi, ci-in gen in: Israel innkuonte aw, na ngaisutna uh tami ahi hi; na lungsim sung vua na ngaisutnate uh ka thei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tami khuopi sungah mi tampi na that zo ta vua, na mithasate utawh a lampi teng na dimsah uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin Topa in tam bangin gen hi: khuopi sunga na thasa uh misite pen sa ahi vua, tami khuopi pen a huonna beel ahi hi; ahi vangin tua khuopi sung panin note ang kiladawh ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Note pen namsau giingte na hi uhi; na tung vuah namsau kang tusah ding hi, Topa Pasien in ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Keima in tua sung panin note hing ladawhin gamdang mite’ khut sungah kang pie ding a, note tungah thu kang khen ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Namsau tawh na si ding uhi; keima in Israel gamgi-ah thu kang khen ding hi. Tuale note in keima Topa ka hi lam nei thei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tami khuopi pen na beel uh hi loin no zong a sunga sa na hi sih ding uhi; keima in Israel gamgi-ah note thu kang khen ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tua ciengin ama’ thukhamte le a ngaina kipte zui loin, na kimvel vua minamte’ ngaina dan banga a gamta note in keima Topa ka hi lam nei thei ding uhi,” ei ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tua bangin thuphuon ka gen laitahin Benaiah’ tapa Pelatiah a si hi. Tua ciengin khupbawhin ka kap vapo a, “Kadei Topa ! Israel a omlai teng a that sieng ding na hi ta amah?” ka ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tua ciengin Topa’ thu keima kungah ang tung hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Mihing aw, Jerusalem-a teng mite in na tanaute, na sanggamte, na saltanpite, Israel innkuon buppi’ thu a gen vua, “ Topa kung panin amate a gamla pei zo ta uhi; eite’ luo dingin tami gam ei kipie zo hi,” ci-a a na gente khu a unpi-un tam mite ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin, “ Topa in tam bangin ci hi: minamte lahah amate gamlapi-ah hemdawhin, gam tuomtuomte lahah amate ka thezah vangin, gam tuomtuom a tunna mun zosie vuah bakhat sung amau’ mun siengtho-in ka om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin gen in: Topa in tam bangin gen in, a ci hi: mite sung panin note kang khawmtuo ding a, na kithezahna uh gam tuomtuomte panin hing sutuo-in Israel gam kang pie ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Khumnah amate a tun ciengun, a kidahhuoi na zosie le a mudahuoi na zosie a paikhie ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Keima in amate lungtang khat pie-in, amate sungah hlagau tha khat ka guong ding hi; keima in a satah panun suong lungtang lahpiehin satah lungtang ka guon ding a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />tuaci’n amate in ka thukhamte a zui ding vua, ka ngaina kipte kemcingin a mang ding uhi. Tua ciengin amate keima’ mi hi ding a, kei amau’ Pasien ka hi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ahi vangin amau’ lungtang in amau’ sil kidahhuoite le amau’ sil mudahuoite a lunggul vua ahile, keima in amau’ lu tungah a gamtatnate uh ka tusah ding hi, Topa Pasien in ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tua ciengin cherub-te in a kung vua om lengkangte tawh a hla a zahto vua, a tung vuah Israel Pasien’ minthanna vang a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tuale khuopi laikim panin Topa’ minthanna vang kato a, khuopi nisuona lam muol tungah a khawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Hlagau in Pasien’ mangmunate sungah keima ei domto-in Chaldea gam saltangte kungah ei peipi hi. Tua ciengin ka mangmuna in keima ei nuasie ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tuale Topa in ei musah zosie saltangte kungah ka gen hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa’ thu ka kungah ang tung hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Mihing aw, mu nading mit nei napi khuo a mu lo, nang pen zah nading bil nei napi khuo a za lo, a ledo innkuon lahah a teng na hi hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />bangzieh ahei cile amate pen a ledo innkuon ahi uhi. Tua ahi ziehin, mihing aw, galtai dingin puonlom ziel inlen suntangpi-in amate muna-ah galtai dingin pei in; na opna mun panin mundang khatah galtai ding bangin amau’ muna-ah na pei ding hi. A ledo innkuon ahi vangun a thu thei kha sam ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Galtai dingte bangin sunlai-in amate muna-ah na puonlom na puo ding hi; galtai dingte bangin nitahin zong amate muna-ah na puo ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Amate muna-ah kul tovang inlen khum panin na puonlomte puo in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Amate mitmu-in tua puonlomte na liengko-ah na khang ding a, miel lahah na puo ding hi; leitang na mu lo nadingin na maitang na tuom ding hi; azieh pen Israel innkuonte adingin lim khatin nang kang bawlzo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Kei zong thu ei kipieh bangin ka bawl hi. Galtai dingte bangin sun lai-in ka puonlom guongin nitahin ka khut tawh kul ka tovang hi; khuomiel ciengin ka vante ka la a, a mitmu-un tuate ka liengko-ah ka puo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Zingmawng ciengin Topa’ thu ka kungah ang tung hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Mihing aw, a ledo innkuon ahi Israel innkuon in na kungah, “Bang bawl na hei,” ang ci sih uh amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Amate kungah, “ Topa Pasien in tam bangin a gen hi: Tami thuphuon pen Jerusalem khuo-a ulienpa le tua sunga om Israel innkuon vannuoi tawh kisai ahi hi,” ci in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />“Note adingin kei lim khat ka hi hi: keima in ka bawlsa bangin amate tungah kibawl ding hi; amate galtai le saltangin a pei ding uhi,” ci in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuale amate lahah ulienpa khat, miel lahah a puonlom a liengko tungah khangin a peikhie ding hi; ama in kul tovangin khum panin a puo ding hi; ama in a mit tawh leitang a mu lo nadingin a mai tuom ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ama tungah ka ngenthang ka zah ding a, ka thangah ama a awh ding hi; tuale Chaldea gam Babylon ah ama ka zawpi ding a, hinanle tua khuopi a mu sih ding hi; tuale ama tua munah a si ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Keima in ama panpi dinga ama’ kimvela om zosie, a galkap zosie, muncin tengah ka thezah ding hi; tuale keima in namsau dawsa-in amate ka nuadel ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tuale minamte lahah amate thethangin gam tuomtuom ah ka thezah ciengin amate in keima Topa ka hi lam ei thei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ahi vangin minamte lahah a pei peina vuah a mudahuoi a gamtatna zosie uh a gen thei nadingun namsau, kielpi le natpi panin amate tawmno khat ka suohtasah ding hi; tua ciengin amate in keima Topa ka hi lam ei thei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Topa’ thu ka kungah ang tung hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Mihing aw, a citun pumin na an ne inlen, zauna le linna tawh na tui dawn in;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />tuale gam sung mite kungah thu gen inlen, Israel gam sunga om Jerusalem-a tengte tawh kisai-in Topa in tam bangin gen hi: Amate in zauna tawh an a ne ding vua, lungkham kawmin tui a dawn ding uhi, bangzieh ahei cile khum sunga tengte zosie’ tatsietna ziehin a gam sunga om mi zosie kitomgam ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Mi tenna khuopite hawmsuohin a gam uh gamkhing a suoh ding hi; tuale amate in kei pen Topa ka hi lam ei thei ta ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Topa’ thu ka tungah ang tung hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Mihing aw, “Hun le nite kisawtsah-sah, mangmuna zosie lah bangma hi sih,” ci-a Israel gam sunga na zah uh paunah pen bang hi mawh ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin amate kungah, “ Topa in tam bangin gen hi: Tam paunah ka tawpsah ta ding a, amate in Israel gam sungah paunahin a zang nawn sih ding uhi,” ci-in gen in. Ahi vangin amate kungah, “Hun le nite ang nai ta a, mangmuna zosie a tangtun nading zong ang nai ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Azieh pen Israel innkuon sungah mangmuna zuou ahi sihle aisanna zuou om nawn lo ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Ahi vangin keima Topa in ka thugen ding ka gen ding a, kiheh nawn loin ang tangtung ding hi; ahi vangin no a ledo innkuonte aw, keima in ka thugente na hin sungun kang tangtungsah ding hi, Topa in ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Topa’ thu ka tungah ang tung hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Mihing aw, Israel innkuonte in, “A mangmuna uh mailam kum tampi ading hi a, a thu genkholte uzong hun sawtpi ading ahi hi,” ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin amate kungah, “ Topa in tam bangin gen hi: Ka thugen khat zong a kihehsah nawn sih ding a, ka thugente a tangtung ding hi, Topa Pasien in ei ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa’ thu ka kungah ang tung hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Mihing aw, Israel kamsangte langkhatah thu phuong in; amau’ ngaisutna banga thuphuon mawh gente kungah tam bangin gen in: “ Topa’ thugen ngai un!” ci in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Topa Pasien in tam bangin a gen hi: Bangma mu kei lopi amau’ lungsim banga a mot gamtat kamsangte in gimna a thuoh ding uhi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Israel aw, na kamsangte uh pen inn kisie lahah a om si-alte a bang sieng ta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Topa’ ni-a gal kisimna-ah Israel innkuonte in a nan zawh nadingun, amate adingin kulpi vangte ah na kato sih vua, kul zong na bawlpha sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Amate in zuou mang mu-in zuou ai a san vua, Topa in a sawl lo vangin, “ Topa in gen hi,” ci-in a thugente uh a tangtung ding bang kehin a ngah kenkon uhi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Note in ka gen khah lo mawh vangin, “ Topa in gen hi,” na ci ciengun zuou mang mu-in zuou aisan hi lo na hi uh amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin Topa Pasien in tam bangin gen hi: A manlo-a na thugente ule na zuou mangmunate uh ziehin note kang langpang hi, Topa in ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ka khut in mangmuna zuou a mu le aisanna zuou a gen kamsangte ka langpang ding hi; ka mite thu vaihawmna-ah amate kihal lo ding a, Israel innkuon laibu sungah zong a min uh kikhum loin, Israel gamah a lut thei sih ding uhi; tuale note in keima Topa ka hi lam nei thei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />A tahtahin kilemna om lopi amate in, “Kilemna om hi,” ci-in ka mite a puikhiel uhi; azieh pen mipi in kulpi a cien ciengun tam kamsangte in a tungah leikang a zutpieh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />A tunga leikang zutte kungah kulbang cim ding hi, ci-in gen in. Um le beela buoh bangin guo ang zu ding a, gielpite ang kie-in huipi in a mutmang ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Kulpi a cip ciengin, “A tunga na zut uh leikangte hei-ah a om sieng ta e?” ang kici lo ding amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin Topa Pasien in tam bangin gen hi: Ka thangpaina tawh huipi ka langsah ding a, ka lungthahna ziehin guopi zusahin ka thangpaina ziehin gielpi in tua kulpi ka susiesah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />A khuombul a daw sieng nadingin note in leikang tawh na zut uh tua kulpi tuolah ka matsah ding hi; tua kul ang cip ciengin a sungah na sigam ding uhi; tuale note in keima Topa ka hi lam nei thei ta ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tua bangin kulpi tung le leikang zutte tungah ka thangpaina ka tungsah ding hi; tuale keima in amate kungah kulpi om nawn lo a, a zutte zong om nawn lo hi, ka ci ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Jerusalem tawh kisai thu phuongin kilemna om lopi kilemna om hi, ci-a mang a mu Israel kamsangte om nawn lo hi, Topa Pasien in ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Mihing aw, nang na hi leh amau’ ngaisutna banga thu a phuong na mite’ tanute lam nga in; amate langkhatah thu phuong inlen
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Topa in tam bangin gen hi, ci in: Mihingte’ hinna a mat nadingun a khuttawng vua a bul ding uh dawi-ai a khuipieh, mihingte zosie’ lutunga a khip ding uh lukhu a bawlpieh numeite in gimna a thuoh ding uhi! Note in ka mite’ hinna thapiehin noma’ hinna hu ding na hi uh amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Zuouthu a um ka mite, mangbuham le moh themkhat nga thei nadingin na zuouthu utawh a si lawm lote sisahin a hing lawm lote na hinsah ziehun note in ka mite lahah nei minsiesah uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin Topa in tam bangin gen hi: Na mihingte matna uh ahi na dawi-aite uh ka langpang hi; na ban panun tuate ka botsat ding a, vasa banga na mat uh mihingte ka suohtasah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Na lukhu khuite uzong ka botkeh ding a, na khut sung panun ka mite ka hundam ding hi; note’ khut sungah gamsa kiman bangin amate a om nawn sih ding uhi; tuale keima Topa ka hi lam note in nei thei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Keima in amate ka lungkiehsah sih vangin note in a manlopi-in mi dihte na lungkiesah vua, migilote a gitlo gamtatna panun kihei loin a hinna uh a hutdam lo nadingun na hantawh zawsop uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />tua ahi ziehin note in mangmuna zuou na mu nawn sih ding vua, aisanna zong na bawl nawn sih ding uhi; keima in na khut sung panun ka mite ka hundam ding hi. Tua ciengin note in keima Topa ka hi lam nei thei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Keima kungah Israel upa pawlkhat ang pei-in ka mai-ah ang to uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tuale Topa’ thu ka kungah ang tung hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Mihing aw, tam mite in a lungsim sung vuah a milimte a bie ta vua, a kipal nadingun a masang vuah amau’ khielna a koi uhi; amate thu ka kimopsah talawm ding amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin nang in amate hopi inlen, Topa Pasien in tam bangin gen hi, ci-in amate kungah gen in: A lungsim vuah milimte bie-in a mai vuah a kipalpua nadingun amau’ khielna a koi vua, ahi vangin a milim honpite utawh kamsangpa kunga ang pei Israel innkuonte lahah a koimapo keima Topa in ka dawng ding a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />a milimte uh ziehin kei tawh a kigamla Israel innkuonte’ lungsim a unpi-in ka mat zawh nadingin ka bawl ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin Topa Pasien in tam bangin gen hi, ci-in Israel innkuonte tungah gen in: Kisia unlen, na milimte ule na sil kidahhuoi zosie uh hing nua ngat unlen hing kihei un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile Israel-te ahi sihle Israel-te lahah a teng pemta khatpo kei tawh a kikhenkhiet nop a, a lungtang ah a milimte bie-in a mai-ah kipal nading gitlona a koi a, tuaci’n kei thu dong dinga kamsangpa kunga a pei leh, Topa ahi kei mama in amate ka dawng ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Amate ka lang-et ding a, lim le thu gentena-in bawlin ka mite lah panin amate ka hemkhie ding hi; tuale keima Topa ka hi lam note in nei thei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Kamsang khat kisolin zuouthu kamteng khat a gen leh keima Topa in tua kamsangpa ka na solsa ahi a, keima in ama langkhatah ka khut zahin ka mi Israel-te lah panin ama ka susie ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuale amate tunga dan kipiehna amate ma in a thuoh ding vua, thudong pa’ dan thuohna le kamsangpa’ dan thuohna kibang ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuaci’n ka kung panin Israel innkuonte a vahmang nawn sih ding vua, a khielna vannuoi utawh amau le amau a kibuasah nawn sih ding uhi. Tua ciengin amate keima’ mi ahi ding vua, keima amau’ Pasien ka hi ding hi, Topa Pasien in ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Topa’ thu ka kungah ang tung hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Mihing aw, gam khat in keima langkhatah thuman lo tahin ka tungah mawna ang bawl ciengin keima in ama langkhatah ka khut ka zah a, tuale a an pienna uh sutanin a tung vuah kielpi tungsahin tua gam panin mihing le ganhing ka thatgam a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />amate sungah Noah, Daniel, le Jacob tam mihing thumte nangawn om nan uleh amau’ dihna tawh amau’ hinna beh a hu zo ding uhi, Topa Pasien in ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Gamkhing a suo nadingin gamsung tengah a susie ding gamsate hla leng, gamsate ziehin tua gam nawhin koima a pei sih ding hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />keima a nungta ka hi ma bangin, tam mihing thumte nangawn tua gamah a om bang uh hileh zong, amate in a tanute ule a tapate uh a hundam zo tuon sih ding uhi; amate beh a kihundam zo ding vua, ahi vangin khum gam pen koima ten lona gamkhing suoh veve ding hi, ci-in a hing zing Topa Pasien ka kiciem hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ahi sihle keima in tua gam sungah namsau sawlin, “Gam sung tengah namsau pei kawikawi heh,” ci-in tua gam sung panin mihingte le ganhingte ka suhmang leh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />keima a nungta ka hi ma bangin tam mihing thumte tua gam sungah om zong nan uleh amate in a tanute le a tapate uh a hun zo tuom sih ding vua, hizongle amate beh ma a kihundam zo ding uhi, Topa Pasien in ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ahi sihle tua gam sungah pul natna tungsahin ka thangpai ziehin amate tungah sisan luongsahin, tua gam sung panin mihing le ganhingte sumaimangin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />keima a nungta ka hi ma bangin Noah, Daniel le Job-te a sungah a om uh hinan lezong, a tanute le a tapate uh a hundam zo tuom sih ding vua, amau’ dihna tawh amau’ hinna beh ma a hundam zo beh ding uhi, ci-in a hing zing Topa Pasien ka kiciem hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin Topa Pasien in tam bangin gen hi: Keima in mihing te le ganhingte a sumaimang dingin Jerusalem tungah a zauhuoi thukhen nasepna nam lite ahi namsau, kielpi, gamsate, le pulnatna ka tunsah ciengin tua sangin hamsa zaw lai ding hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Hizongle tanute le tapate peipi dingin a suohta pawlkhat tua khuo sungah kinuasie ding hi; na kung vuah amate ang pei ding uhi. Amau’ gamtat luheh na mu ciengin Jerusalem tunga a sie ka tunsah zosie ziehin na lung a dam mai ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Amau’ gamtat luheh na mu ciengin amate in nang ang henem ding uhi; tuale nangma in khuopi sunga ka sil bawl zosie a mawhna ka bawl ahi lo lam na thei ding hi, Topa Pasien in ei ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa’ thu ka kungah ang tung hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Mihing aw, gammang singte lahah lenggui ba le lenggui sing in sing dangte zosie bang a ci phah zo ding ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Bang khat popo bawl nadingin a sing a kila ngai amah? Mi khat in vankhaina-a zah ding singzum khet dingin a la uh amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tua pen meitawna dinga kikoi ahi a, mei in a mong tuoh a kahvam ciengin a laikim meihol a suoh hi. Tua khu bangin a kimang ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />A kah masangin zong bangma-in a kizang thei sih hi; mei in katum a, meihol a suo ciengin a zahna bangza-in tawmzaw lai ding a, banga kimang thei bep ding ahei!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin Topa Pasien in tam bangin gen hi: Meitawna sing dinga ka pieh gammang singkungte lahah lenggui singte bangin, Jerusalem-a tengte zong tuaci’n ka pie ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Keima in amate ka lang-et ding hi; meikuong panin suohta nan ule mei in a katum veve ding uhi; tuale amate ka lang-et ciengin keima Topa ka hi lam amate in ei thei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Muonhuoi lo tahin amate a gamtat ziehun, tua gam koima’ ten lona gamkhing ka suohsah ding hi, Topa Pasien in ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa’ thu ka kungah ang tung hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Mihing aw, Jerusalem tungah a mudahuoi a gamtatna teng theisah inlen,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />tuale Topa Pasien in Jerusalem tungah tam bangin gen hi, ci-in: Na kipatna le na pienna Canaan-te’ gam ahi hi; na pa Amor-te ahi a, na nu Hit-te ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Na piendan ahile na suo ni-in na laigui ki-attan loin tui tawh ang kisil sieng sih a, ci tawh zong ang kizut loin puon tawh zong ang kitun sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Koima’ mit in ang khuotuo sih a, lainatna tam teng ang bawlpieh ding koima a om sih hi; ahi vangin gamlaha ang kipaithang hi, azieh pen na suo ni panin mite in ang nang ang kidah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Na kungah kang suoh kha a, sisan naisan lahah na kipehpeh kang mu hi. Sisan naisan lahah na kipawi kang mu ziehin na kungah, “Hing in!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Lozau-a sing bangin khang in ,” kang ci leh nangma nang khanglien a, na tun ang sangin ngahnu picing khat nang hi ta hi; na nawite ang baw a, na mul zong ang po ta hi; hinanle puon sil loin na guoh tangin na om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Na kungah hing suohkia-in nang ma kang en hi; zawl dei-in lawm ngai na cing ta hi. Keima in ka puon mong zahin na zumsel teng kang khupieh hi. Keima in nangma kang kamciem a, nangma tawh thuciemna khat bawlin, tuale nang pen keima-a’ na hi ta hi, Topa Pasien in ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tua ciengin kang pumsil a, na tunga a baang site sawp siengin sathau kang nu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />A kiphan puon hoite kang silsah a, savun hoi tawh a kibawl kedap kang bunsah hi; pat puon hoite tawh kang khu a, puon kigan hoite tawh kang tuom hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Keima in kizepna manphate tawh nang kang zem hi: na banah tau hing bunsah a, na ngawngah khi kang awsah hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />na nahkuo-ah nahba kang vawpieh a, na bil ah bilbate hing basahin na lu ah a etlawm kumpi lukhu kang khusah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ngun le kham tawh ang kizem a, na puonsilte pat puon hoite, puon kigan hoite le puon kiphan hoite vive ahi hi. Na neh ding zong annel tuipen, khuoizu le sathau ahi hi. Na mel ang hoi mama a, kumpinu dingin zong nang kilawm ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Na mel hoina ziehin minam cinteng lahah na minthanna a kizel hi, azieh pen nangma tunga kang pieh keima’ thupina in na mel hoina a bukimsah hi, Topa Pasien in ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ahi vangin nang in na mel hoina na muong a, na minthanna ziehin numei pahtat bangin na om ta hi. Na kunga ang vahle khat popo tawh kiphaltahin na lumton hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Na puon pawlkhat na ladawh a, nangma adingin a hoi mama biehbuhnote bawlin tuate tungah khatvei zong a pieng ngai nai lo mai lamah zong a pieng ngai nawn lo ding ahi pahtatna na gamta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Nangma kang piehsa ka ngun le ka kham tawh a kibawl kizepnate la-in, nangma adingin pasal limin na bawl a, tuate tawh na lumton hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />tuate khu nadingin a kiphan na puonte na la a, a mai vuah ka sathau le ka gimnamtuite na koi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Na an dinga kang pieh- annel tuipen, sathau le khuoizute zong - tuate mai-ah gimnamtui biehna-in na lui hi; tua bang dan teng ahi hi, Topa Pasien in ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Keima tawh na hinsa na tanute le na tapate na ladawh a, tua milimte nehtum dingin kithoina-in tuate na nei hi. Na pahtatnate kicing sa nai lo bangin na om hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ka tate na that a, amate tungah biehna dingin na pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tuale a mudahuoi na gamtatna zosie le na pahtatnate ziehin, na neu lai-a na sisan lahah na kipawina le puon sil loin na guohtanga na op lai na phawh kha nawn sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Na gitlona zosie teng zaw ciengin (gimna, gimna na thuoh ding hi! Topa Pasien in ci a,)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />nangma adingin dawsang khat na lam a, mun-awng cintengah nangma adingin bosang khat na bawl hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />lamkabawm cintengah munsang lamin na mel hoina pahtatna-in na nei a, mi vahle zosie tungah na pumpi pie-in na pahtatna na khangsah semsem hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />A huasan na innveng Egypt-te tawh na pahtat a, na pahtatna na khansah semsem ziehin kei nei lungthahsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin nangma langkhatah ka khut zahin na an satanh ka khiem ding a, na thanghuoi gamtatna ang zumpi Philistia-te’ tanute ahi na galte’ dei bang bangin kang piedawh ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Na lungkim zo nai lo ziehin Assyria-te tawh zong na pahtat hi; amate tawh na pahtat a, na lungkim nai tuom sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Sumbawl Chaldea-te tawh tamveipi na pahtat a, tuate nangawn tawh zong na lungkim nai vaset sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Zum zie thei lo-a na pahtatnate ziehin tam teng zosiepi na bawl khu na lungsim gina maw sam e izaw, Topa Pasien in ci hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />lamkabawm cintengah na dawsang na lam a, mun-awng cintengah na bosang ding na bawl hi! Hinanle numei pahtat tawh na kibang sih hi, azieh pen nang in pahtat man sum na sang sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />A pasal tanga khuolmite lamdawn numei angkawm nu!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Numei pahtatte zosie tungah letsongte kipie hi; hinanle na kingaipi mi zosie tungah na letsongte na pie a, na luppi dingin mun cinteng panin amate ang pei nadingun guhgol na pie zawsop hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Tuaci’n na pahtat dante numei dangte tawh na kibang sih hi: Koima in a pahtat dingin ang zawl sih a, sum tawh zong ang kiguoi loin nangma in sum na lepieh hi; nang pen mi tuompi khat na hi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin mi pahtat nu aw, Topa’ thugen ngai in:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Topa Pasien in tam bangin gen hi: Na huasan seng ziehin na kingaipite tawh lumtonin guohtanga na opna puon na khu lo zieh le, a mudahuoi na milim zosie le amate tunga na pieh na tate’ sisan ziehin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />keima in na kingai-a na nopsahpi zosie, na itte le na mudate zosie a unpi-in ka kaikhawm ding hi; nangma ang do dingin na kimvel panin amate kaikhawmin, a mai vuah na puonte kang suopieh ding a, tuaci’n na guohtanga na opna amate in ang mu ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Keima in numei angkawmte le tuol thatte bangin thu kang khen ding a, nangma tungah thangpaina le thangsietna sisan ka tungsah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Amau’ khut sungah kang pie ding a, amate in dawsang phelkhe-in na bosangte a susie ding uhi; amate in na puonsil hing sutpiehin na van hoite ang lahpieh ding vua, puon sil loin na guohtangin ang nuasie ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Amate in note do dingin mi honpi hing zawpi-in suong tawh ang sep ding vua, namsau tawh ang semnen ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Na innte mei tawh halin numei tampi’ mitmu-in na tungah thu a khen ding uhi; keima in na pahtatna kang tawpsah ding a, sum tawh mi na guoi nawn sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Tuaci’n keima in na tungah ka sinsona ka damsah ding a, ka thangsietna na kung panin a kihei ding hi; ham loin ka om ta ding a, ka lungthah nawn sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Na neu lai hunte na phaw nawn lo ziehin tam bang zosie teng tawh kei nei lungthahsah hi; tua ahi ziehin na gamtatna teng kang lukhuhsahkia hi, Topa Pasien in ci hi. A mudahuoi na gamtatnate banah a thanghuoi-in gamta hi lo na mah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />En in, paunah zang mi zosie in nang tungtang ah “A tanu in a nu sun,” ci paunah a zang ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />A pasal le a tate a muda nu’ tanu na hi a, a pasalte ule a tate a muda sanggam numeite’ sanggam nu na hi hi; na nu Hit-te ahi a, na pa Amor-te ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Na unu pen Samaria ahi a, na opna leilu lamah a tanute tawh a teng hi; tuale na naunu pen Sodom ahi a, na opna leitaw lamah a tanute tawh a teng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Amau’ opdan bang beh na zui sih a, amau’ gamtat mudahuoite bangin na gamta hi; bakhat sungin na opdan zosie vuah amate sangin na gamtat siezaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Nang le na tanute bawl bangin na sanggam nu Sodom le a tanute in a bawl sih uhi, keima a nungta ka hi ma bangin, Topa Pasien in ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Na sanggam nu Sodom’ khielna tami ahi hi: Ama le a tanute a kiphasah vua, amate in an khamval nei-in nuomsa tahin a om uhi, ahi vangin mizawng le mi cimawte a panpi sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Amate a kihisah mama vua, ka mai-ah a mudahuoi nate a bawl uhi; tua ahi ziehin amate ka mu ciengin ka hemkhie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />Samaria in nang mawna alang zong a bawl sih hi; nang in amate sangin sil mudahuoite na bawlzaw a, tua na sil mudahuoi bawl teng zosie in na sanggam numeite midih danin kimusah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" />Nang in zong na sanggam numeite a dih bangsah na hi ziehin mindaina kithuoh ta’n; amate sangin a mudahuoi zaw-in na gamtat ziehin nang sangin amate a dih tazaw uhi. Tuaci’n nang zong maizum inlen, na mindaina kipuoh in, azieh pen nangma in na sanggam numeite a dih danin na kimusah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" />Zakona na thuohzawh nading le na sepsa zosie tungah maizumin amate adingin henepna na hi nadingin keima in Sodom le a tanute, Samaria le a tanute vangphatna ka piekia ding a, amau-a’ bangin nang zong vangphatna kang piekia ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" />Na sanggam numeite, Sodom le a tanute ahi ule a op ngai bangun a omkia ding vua, nangma le na tanute zong na op ngai bangun na omkia ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" />Na gitlona ang kipholah masang, na kiphatsah hun lai-in na sanggam nu Sodom na kam tawh thusie gentena-in nei hi lo na mah? Tu-in nang pen Aram’ tanute le a innveng zosie ule Philistia-te’ tanute, le na kimvela a om ang muda mi zosie’ simmaw ehnehin na om ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" />Na thangtatna le na mudahuoi gamtatna teng ziehin gawtna na thuoh kul hi, Topa in ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" />Ahi hi, Topa Pasien in tam bangin gen hi: Kiciemna thuse loin thuciemna palsat zo na hi ziehin na gamtat bangin na tungah ka gamta ding hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" />hinanle na neu lai-a nang tawh i thuciemna ka ciemte ding a, nang tawh kumtawn adingin thuciemna ka bawl ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" />Tua ciengin na gamtat dante nang phawhkia ding a, nangma tawh ka bawl keima’ thuciem zieh hi loin, keima in na sanggam numeite, na unu le na nau nu a nipi-in ladawhin na tanute ahi dingin na kungah kang pieh hun ciengin na mai a zum ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" />Nangma tawh thuciemna ka bawl ding a, nangma in keima Topa ka hi lam nei thei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" />Na sil bawl zosie kang ngaidam ciengin na gamtatnasate na phawh ding a, ci nading mel thei loin omin na mai a zum sengin na kam na kehkia ngai nawn sih ding hi, Topa Pasien in ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa’ thu ka kungah ang tung hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Mihing aw, Israel innkuonte tungah thu hahsa khat phuong inlen, thugentena khat gen in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Topa Pasien in tam bangci hi, ci-in gen in: A hla a gol dedu, a hlakui a sau petput, a mul zong a pawl bielbuol muvanlai golpi khat, Lebanon ah va tu ta hi. Ama in taamtah dawn khat taw-in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />a dawnngeh khat hliehtawng hi. Sum bawlna gamah puo a, sumbawlte’ khuopi khat sungah va koi ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tua ciengin tua gam panin khaici la-in tua khaici leihoina-ah a koi hi; ama in gielheh bameng bangin tui tamna munah singkung khat a suon hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Khum singkung ang khanglienin lenggui bazam niem khat ang suoh hi; a bate ama lam nga-in zamsuh a, a zungte a opna-ah om den hi. Tuaci’n lenggui khat ang suoh hi; a bate ang mengin a nate ang om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A pum a gol, a hla a gol le a mul a pha mama muvanlai adang khat ang om hi. Tuale en vawi! Ama zieha tui a nga thei nadingin, ama lamah zunghla-in a bate a zamsah hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A ba tampi mengin a gate ga a, lenggui hoi khat a suo nadingin, tui nienna mun leihoina ah lenggui kisuon phakia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Topa Pasien in tam bangin ci hi, ci-in gen in: Tua lenggui a khang zo ding amah? A gawptum nadingin phungbaw-in, muvanlai in a gate muotsahin gawptumsah ding a, a bameng thate zong vulsah lo ding amah? Tua lenggui phungbaw nadingin mi banhat ahi sihle galkap thahat kisam lo ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />A kisuon phat ciengin a hing zo ding amah? Nisuolam huipi in ang mut gawp ciengin a unpi-in vulnang gawpin, a pona le ang khandawhna ah vulnang gawp lo ding amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tua ciengin Topa’ thu ka tungah ang tung hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tu-in a ledo innkuonte kungah gen in: Tamte bang a cina ahei ci na thei sih uh amah? Amate kungah gen in: Babylon kumpipa Jerusalem ah ang pei-in, a kumpipa le a kumpi uliente manin, Babylon-a ama kungah a peipikia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ama in kumpi’ suonlehlahte khat zawpi a, ama tawh thuciemna khat bawlin a kiciemsah hi. (ama in gamsung uliente a kaimang sieng hi.)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tuaci’n a kumpi gam kikhesuhin ama thu-in pongzo nawn lo a, tua khu ama’ thuciemna zuina tawh a hin zawh nading uh ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ahi vangin amate in sakolte le galkap tampite a pieh thei nadingin Egypt gamah palai sawlin ama a ledo hi. Ama a lawcing diei mah? Tua banga a sem mi pa a suohta zo diei mah? Thuciemna palsat napi suohta veve ding amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Keima a nungta ka hi ma bangin ama kumpi suohsah a, a kiciemna thusim loin, kumpipa tenna munah ama tawh a bawl thuciemna a palsat pa opna Babylon ah ama a si valon ding hi, Topa Pasien in ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Mitampi’ hinna a kisuhmang nadingin phung kiciengin kulpi a kibawl ciengin a thahat Pharaoh’ galkapte le mihonpite in gal sungah ama a huzo sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Azieh pen ama ciempelin thuciemna palsat a, a khut hlangin tam teng zosie sem ahi ziehin suohta vawt lo ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin Topa Pasien in tam bangin ci hi: Keima a nungta ka hi ma bangin, a thuse lo ka kiciemna le a palsat ka thuciemna ama ka lukhuhsah valon ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Keima in ama tungah ka ngenthang ka khu ding a, ka thangah ama a awh ding hi; Babylon ah ama ka zawpi ding a, khum munah keima ei langpan ziehin ama tawh thukhenna ah ka lut ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />A kiteel a galkap zosie namsau tawh a si ding vua, a suohta sun teng zong muncin tengah a kithethang ding uhi; tuale note in keima Topa in ka gensate na thei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Topa Pasien in tam bangin gen hi: Keima in taamtah sangpi panin a dawnngeh khat ka la ding hi; keima in tua khu ka suon ding hi. Keima in a dawnsang panin a ngumngeh khat ka hlieh ding hi; keimama in muolsang dawn khatah ka suon ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ang bazamin a gate ang ga a, taamtah picing khat ang suo thei nadingin, Israel muolsang dawnah ka suon ding hi. Tua sing nei-ah va namcin a om ding uhi; a ba hlim nei-ah va namcinte in bu a tom ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Gamlahah a po singkung zosie in keima Topa ka hi lam ei thei ding uhi. Keima in sing sangte niemsahin a niemte ka sangsah hi; a na hingte ka gawsah a, a gawte ka hingsah hi. Keima Topa in ka gensa ahi a, ka muolsuo ding hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa’ thu ka kungah ang tung hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Nu le pate lengga thua neh, a tate ha a za hi,” ci-in Israel gam tawh kisai-in tami paunah na gengen pen uh bang na cinopna uh ahei?”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Keima a nungta ka hi ma bangin, Israel gamah tami paunah na zang ngai nawn poma sih ding uhi, Topa Pasien in ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Hinna zosie keima-’a hi, ci thei in; a pa’ hinna bangma in a ta’ hinna zong keima-a’ ahi hi: a maw mipa beh si ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Mi khat a dih a, thuman le thutang tawh a gamtat a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />muol tung tengah an ne loin ahi sihle Israel innkuonte’ milimte enin a khuoda sih a, a vengpa’ zi suthang loin ahi sihle numei khat a nin nei laitahin a va luppi sih a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />mi koima khat zong gawt loin leibate kungah a vankhapte uh a piehkia a, mi suom loin a gilkielte an a pieh a, puon nei lote puon se-in
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />khamkholna sum a lah sih a, ahi sihle a met dingin sum leitawi pie loin khielna bawlna panin a khut a tuhzo a, thu kitu mite kikalah thumanin vaihawmin
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />ka thukhamte a zui a, ka ngaina kipte limtahin tangin muonhuoi tahin a gamtat leh, tua bang mi pen midih ahi hi; ama pen a hing valon ding hi, Topa Pasien in ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ama in a ngongtat, sisansuo tapa khat nei-in
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />tam teng khat penpen a bawl a, (a pa in tuate khat beh a sep lo vangin) muoltung tengah an ne-in a vengpa’ zi a suhthang a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />mizawng le mi tasamte gawtin mi suom a, vankhapte piekia loin milimte enin a khuoda a, mudahuoi-in gamta-in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />khamkholna sum a lah a, a met dingin sum a leitawisah leh, ama a hing ding amah? A hing sih ding hi. Ama in tam sil mudahuoi zosie a bawl zo ta hi; ama pen si valon ding a, a sisan ama luzang ma-ah tu ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ahi vangin tam mipa in a pa bawl khielna zosie a mu tapa khat nei-in, ang lungngai-in tua bang ma-in ang bawl sih a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />muoltung tengah an ne loin ahi sihle Israel innkuon’ milimte enin a khuoda sih a, a vengpa’ zi zong suthang loin
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />koima tungah khielna a bawl sih a, vankhap la loin mi suom lo a, ahi vangin gilkielte an pie-in puon nei lote puon tawh a hui a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />khielna panin a khut tuzo-in khamkholna van a lah sih a, ahi sihle a met dingin sum leitawi pie loin ka thuciem kipte a tan a, ka thukhamte a zui leh, a pa’ mawna ziehin ama si lo ding a, a hing valon ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />A pa ahile mi neisa paulah piehin, a sanggampa suom a, a mite lahah sil hoi lo a bawl ziehin ama in a khielna a silaw ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Hinanle nang in, “A pa khielna ziehin bang dingin a tapa in gimna thuoh lo ahei?” na ci hi. Thuman le thutahin a tapa gamta-in, ka thukham zosie pilvang tahin a zui ciengin ama pen a hing valon ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />A maw mipa a si ding hi. Nu le pa’ khielna a tapa in silaw lo ding a, a tapa’ khielna zong nu le pa in silaw lo ding hi; midih pa’ dihtatna pen ama-a’ hi ding a, migilo pa’ gitlona zong ama-a’ ma hi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ahi vangin migilote in a mawna bawl zosie uh panin ang kihei-in, ka thukhamte ang zui vua, thuman thutangin ang gamtat uleh, amate a hing valon ding uhi; amate a si vawt sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Amau’ suhkhiel teng khat mama zong kiciemte nawn lo ding hi; amau’ bawl dihtatna ziehin amate a hing ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Migilote sina ziehin ka lungdam sangin a gamtat hoi lona panun ang kihei-in hinna a nei na vuah lungdamzaw lo ding ka mah? Topa Pasien in ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Ahi vangin mi dihte in a dihtatna panun ang piel vua, khielna bawlin migilote bang ma-in sil mudahuoite ang bawl uh ciengin, amate a hing thei ding uh amah? Amau’ dihtatna zosie khat zong a kiphawpieh sih ding hi; azieh pen a thuman lo ziehun maw a tanna ule a bawlsa uh mawnate ziehin amate a si ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Hinanle note in, “ Topa silbawl zie a dih sih hi,” na ci uhi. Israel innkuonte aw, za un: Ka sil bawlzie a dih sih amah? A dih lo pen noma’ silbawl hizaw lo amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Midihte in a amau’ dihtatna pan kihei-in khielna a bawl ciengin tua ziehin amate a si ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Migilote a gitlona panun kihei-in thuman thutangin a gamtat ciengun, amate in amau’ hinna a hundam ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Amate ang lungngai-in a bawlsa uh khielnate panin ang kiheikia ziehun amate a hing valon ding vua, a si sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Hinanle Israel innkuonte in, “ Topa silbawl zie a dih sih hi,” a ci uhi. Israel innkuonte aw, ka silbawl zie a dih lo ma amah? A dih lo pen noma’ silbawlte hizaw lo amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin, Israel innkuonte aw, na unpi-un na gamtatna utawh kizui-in na tung vuah thu kang khen ding hi, Topa Pasien in ci hi. Kisia unlen na khielna zosie uh panin hing kinuale un; tua ahi sihle khielna ziehin na kisietlaw ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Keima nei dona vua sil suhkhiel na nei zosie uh a unpi-in paimang unlen, lungsim tha le lungtang tha puo un! No Israel innkuonte aw, bang zieha si ding na hi uh ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Azieh pen koima a si ding ka nuom sih hi, hing kilekia unlen hing un, Topa Pasien in ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Nangma na hile Israel uliente adingin
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />kaateng lo in: Humpite lahah humpi pi khu na nu ahi mawh veleh! Humpite lahah kuolin ama in a note a kem hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ama in a note lahah khat a va khang hi; ama humpi khanglai khat suoh a, tuale ama in sa mat dan ding a sin hi; ama in misa ang ne hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Minamte in ama do dingin patauna aw a gingsah uhi; amau’ dum sungah ama a awh hi. tuale amate in siakawi tawh kai-in Egypt gamah a tunpi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tua nu in a dong hi ta’ng ci mu-in, a kinepna a bei lam a thei bepin, a no dang khat la leuleu a, humpi khanglai khat suohsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ama pen humpi khanglai khat ang suoh ta a, tuale humpite lahah ama a vah kawikawi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ama in a mun muonhuoite uh balkehin a khuopite uh ten lona a suohsah hi; a hawh vapuoh ziehin a gam le a gam sunga omte a unpi-un a citun uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A kimvel mun tuomtuom panin ama do dingin mi namcin ang kuon uhi; amate in a tungah ngenthang a khu uhi; amau’ dum sungah ama kiman hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Amate in siakawi tawh a kai vua, bawng sung khatah khumin, Babylon kumpipa kungah ama a peipi uhi; Israel muoltung tengah a hawh a kizah nawn lo nadingin amate in thong sungah ama khum uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Na nu, lui gei-a kisuon tha lengga um sunga lenggui bang a, tui kicinna gamah a ba tampi zamin ga tampitah ga hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />A kung khau pen gam uhpa’ ciengkhutin a kizang a, a bazam tampite lahah ama a kitungto zehzawh a, a bazam teng tawh a san peupo ziehin a kidawh velvol hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ahi vangin lungsona ziehin kibotdawh a, tuolah kipai hi; nisuona lam hui in ama semgaw hi; a gate kizutheu sieng hi. A kung khau pen gawpdawh a, mei in a katum dawh ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tu-in gamgaw lah le tui tawmna gammang lahah a kisuontha kia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />A kung panin mei in kato a, a bate le a gate katum sieng hi, tuaci’n a kung khau om lo a, gam uhna ding ciengkhut om lo hi. Tam pen kaala khat ahi a, kaala-a kizang khat ahi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Kum sagi a cinna, a hla ngana, a ni sawm ni-in Topa thu dong dingin Israel makai pawlkhat hing pei-in ka mai-ah ang to uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tuale keima kungah Topa’ thu ang tung hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Mihing aw, Israel upate hopi inlen amate kungah, “ Topa Pasien in tam bangin ci hi, ci-in gen in: Bang dinga hing pei na hi uh ahei? Thu ei dong ding na hi uh amah? Keima a hing ka hi ma bangin, note thudawhin ka om sih ding hi, Topa Pasien in ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Amate tungah thu khen ding na mah? Mihing aw, amate tungah thu khen ding na mah? Tua ciengin a pu a pate uh’ na bawlsa sil mudahuoite amate theisah inlen,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />amate tungah tam bangin gen in: Israel ka teel ni-in, Jacob innkuon’ suonlehlahte tungah kiciemin Egypt gam sunga a om amate ka kitheisah a, amate tungah keima Topa na Pasien uh ka hi hi, ci-in ka kiciem hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Khum ni-in Egypt gam panin amate peipi-in, amate dinga ka suipiehsa khuoizu le bawngnawi luonna gam, gam zosie lahah a hoipen munah amate tunpi dingin ka kiciem hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuale amate kungah ka genna-ah, mit hla vawt loin na et uh sil kidahhuoite paidawh unlen, Egypt milimte tawh noma le noma kibuasah sih un; keima Topa na Pasien uh ka hi hi, ka ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ahi vangin amate in kei ei ledo-in ka thu a ngai sih uhi; mit tuhna a nei uh sil kidahhuoite amate in paai tuon loin Egypt milimte zong a nuasie sih uhi. Tua ciengin ka thangpaina amate tungah buosuhin, amate dona-in ka lungthahna teng Egypt gamah tungsah vang, ci-in ka ngaisun hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ahi vangin amau’ tenpi minamte mai-ah ka min a kigensiet lo nadingin ka min ka khuolna tawh na ka sem a, amate muna-ah kei mama kipholahin Egypt gam panin amate ka peipi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuaci’n Egypt panin amate ka pui a, gamlah ka tunpi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ka thukhamte amate pie-in, ka ngaina kipte ka lah a, tua teng a zui poma a hing ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tua banah keima le amate kikalah lim khat ahi dingin ka sabbath-te zong amate ka pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ahi vangin Israel innkuonte in gamlahah kei ei ledo uhi; a zui tapo a hin nading uh ahi ka thukhamte amate in zui loin ka ngaina kipte a nuol uhi; amate in ka sabbath-te a buasah gawp uhi. Tua ciengin gamlahah amate ka thagam nadingin a tung vuah ka lungthahna tungsah vang, ci-in ka ngaisun hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ahi vangin amate ka peikhietpi ei mu minamte mai-ah ka min a kigensiet lo nadingin ka min ka khuolna tawh amate bangma ka law sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tua banah amate ka piehsa gam, khuoizu le bawngnawi luonna gam, gam zosie lahah a hoipen munah peipi nawn sih vang ci-in gamlah amate tungah ka kiciem hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile amate in ka ngaina kipte nuolin ka thukhamte a zui sih vua, ka sabbath-te zong a buasah uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Hizongle amate ka hepi a, keima in gamlahah amate susie loin, zong ka thatgam sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Keima in gamlahah a tate uh kung ah, “Na pu na pate uh’ thukhamte zui loin a ngaina kipte uh zong zui sih unlen, a milimte utawh noma le noma kibuasah sih un,” ka ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Keima Topa na Pasien uh ka hi hi; keima’ thukhamte zui unlen, ka ngaina kipte limtahin tang un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />tuale keima le note kikalah lim dingin ka sabbath-te siengthosah un, tuaci’n note in keima Topa na Pasien uh ka hi lam nei thei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ahi vangin a tate un keima ei ledo uhi; amate in ka thukhamte a zui sih vua, a zui tapo hinlaw nading ahi ka ngaina kipte limtahin tang loin ka sabbath-te a buasah uhi. Tua ciengin keima in amate tungah ka thangpaina sungsuhin, amate dona-in ka lungthahna teng gamlahah tungsah vang, ci-in ka ngaisun hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ahi vangin amate ka peikhietpi ei mu minamte mai-ah ka min a kigensiet lo nadingin, ka min ka khuolna tawh ka khut ka nualahkia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tua banah gamcin teng le minam cinteng tungah amate ka thezah ding hi, ci-in gamlah amate tungah ka kiciem hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />azieh pen amate in ka ngaina kipte a zui sih vua, ka thukhamte nuolin ka sabbath-te a buasah vua, tuale a pu a pate uh’ milimte a mitsuon lenlon uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tua tham loin keima in amate tungah thukham hoi lote le a hin zawh lo nading uh ngaina kipte ka pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Amate in keima Topa ka hi lam ei thei nading ule a cimul thaw thei nadingun a tapa tapen zosie utawh a pieh uh amau’ letsongte tungtawnin amate ka buasah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin mihing aw, Israel innkuonte hopi inlen amate kungah, Topa Pasien in tam bangin ci hi, ci-in gen in: Tam sungah na pu na pate un kei tungah muonhuoi lo tahin a gam ta vua, ei gensiesie uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Azieh pen pieh dinga ka ciemsa gam sungah amate ka lutpi ciengin muolsang khatpo ahi sihle singna pha khatpo a mu uleh tua munah biehpiehnate a bawl vua, ei lungthahsah thei biehna a pie uhi; amate in khum munah gim namtuite a the vua, dawn thei biehnate zong a sung uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />(Keima in amate kungah, “Khum munsang na peina uh khu bang ahiei? ka ci hi. Tuaci’n tuni dongin khumi mun Bamah kici hi.)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin Israel innkuonte kungah, Topa Pasien in tam bangin ci hi, ci-in gen in:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Note in na letsongte uh pie-in na tapate uh mei-ah na hal uh ciengin, tuni dongin na milim zosie utawh no le no a kibuasah na hi uhi. Tuale Israel innkuonte aw, kei note’ thudawhin ka om ding amah? Keima a hing ka hi ma bangin, note’ thudawhin ka om sih ding hi, Topa in ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Na lungsim sung vua na ngaisutnate uh tung ngai lo ding hi. Na ngaisutna vuah, “Minamte le gamtuom mite bangin eite in zong sing le suong bie vai,” na ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Keima a hing ka hi ma bangin, note tungah a hat ka khut, a kizah ka banhat le a kisungsuh ka thangpaina tawh pel loin kumpi ka sem ding hi, Topa Pasien in ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Keima in a hat khut, a kizah banhat, le a kisungsuh thangpaina tawh minamte le na kithethangna uh gamte panin note kang khawmtuo ding hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />tuale keima in gamlah mite kungah kang puoh ding a, tuale khum munah note tawh keima kimaituo-in thu kang khen ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Keima in Egypt gam sung senel gamah na pu na pate uh tungah thu ka khen bangin, note tungah zong thu kang khen ding hi, Topa Pasien in ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Ka ciengkhut nei-ah kang peisah ding a, thuciemna khaukhina sungah kang peipi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Note lahah a ledo mite le ka tunga a khiel mite ka hemkhie ding hi; keima in pemta a hina uh gam panin amate ka peipi ding a, ahi vangin Israel gam sungah a lut sih ding uhi. Tua ciengin note in keima Topa ka hi lam nei thei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Israel innkuonte aw, Topa Pasien in tam bangin ci hi: Note a koimapo in tu leh mailamah ka thu na ngai sih ding vua ahile pei-in na milimte’ na sem un; ahi vangin na letsongte ule na milimte utawh note in ka min siengtho na buasah nawn sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Azieh pen khum gam sunga ka muol siengtho tung, Israel muolsang dawnah Israel innkuon zosie in a unpi-un keima’ na a sem ding uhi, Topa Pasien in ci hi; keima in khum sungah amate ka sang ding a, tuale na biehnate uh, na letsong hoi pente ule noma’ a siengtho nate zosie, khum munah kang ngen ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Na kithezahna uh gam tuomtuom panin hing kaikhawmin minamte lah panin kang lahdawh ciengin gimnamtui bangin kang sang ding a, note lahah minamte mai-ah ka sienthona kang kilangsah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Na pu na pate uh tungah pieh dinga ka ciemsa gam ahi Israel gamah note kang tunpi ciengin note in keima Topa ka hi lam nei thei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Khum sungah ang buasah na om dante ule na gamtatna uh zosie na phawh ding vua, sil hoi lo na bawl zosie ziehun no le no na kikidah ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Israel innkuonte aw, na gitlona ule na gamtatnate uh dung zui-in ka min ka khuolna tawh note tungah kang bawl ciengin note in keima Topa ka hi lam nei thei ding uhi, Topa Pasien in ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Topa’ thu ka kungah ang tung hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Mihing aw, leitaw lam mai ngat inlen, leitaw lam le Negeb gama gammang lah langkhatah thu gen in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Negeb gammang kungah, “ Topa’ thu ngai in: Na sungah mei ka hal ding a, na sunga sing hing zosie le sing gaw zosie a unpi-in katum ding hi; tua meikuong kiphel zo lo ding a, leilu le leitaw maitang zosie tua mei in a hulvam ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Mihing zosie in keima Topa’ hal ahi lam a mu ding vua, koima in a phel zo sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Tua ciengin keima in, “Ah Topa Pasien! Amate in, ‘Ama thu gentena bawlpa hi lo amah,’ ei ci uhi,” ka ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa’ thu ka kungah ang tung hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Mihing aw, Jerusalem lam nga inlen mun siengthote langkhatah thu gen in; Israel gam langkhatah thu phuong inlen,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Israel gam tungah Topa in tam bangin ci hi, ci-in gen in: Nangma langpang dingin kang pei hi, tuale keima in ka namsau a pai panin ka dawh ding a, nangma kung panin migilo le mi thumante a ni-in ka sumaimang ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Azieh pen midihte le migilote nang kung panin a ni-in a sumang ding ka hi a, tua ziehin leitaw lam panin leilu dongin mi zosie langkhatah a pai panin ka namsau ka dawh ding hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />tuale keima Topa in ka namsau a pai panin ka dawkhiet lam mi zosie in a thei ding vua, a pai-ah a kisietkia sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin mihing aw, khuisa inlen amate musietin lungsim tamkham le lung gimin khuisa in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuale amate in na kungah, “Bang dinga khuisa na hei?” ang ci ciengun nang in, “Ang tung thuthang zieh ahi hi. Lungtang zosie zungmangin khut zosie zaw ding a, hanna lungsim bei-in khup zosie tui suoh ding hi. En in, khum khu ang pei-in ang tung ding hi,” Topa Pasien in ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuale Topa’ thu ka tungah ang tung hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Mihing aw, thu va phuong ta’nlen, Topa in tam bangin ci hi, ci-in gen in: Namsau khat, namsau khat kitat hiem a, tua namsau kizutmam hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />mi tha nadingin kitat hiem a, tunphe bangin a tee lihleh hi! Bangci bangin eite kipah thanuom thei ding i hei? Nang in ciengkhut le thuhilna zosie na thuse sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Khuta tawi thei dingin namsau khat kizutmam hi; mi thatpa’ khut sunga koi dingin tua namsau kitat hiemin kizutval hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Mihing aw, tami khu ka mite dona dinga kibawl ahi ziehin kap inlen mau in; Israel gam uh zosie dona kibawl ahi hi; amate pen ka mite tawh namsau thuoh dingin amate a kipiehtha ahi ta hi. Ah! na phei beng in!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Azieh pen ngai sun in: Bang ahiei! Ciengkhut na thuse sih leh tamte pieng loin om ding amah? Topa Pasien in ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Nang mihing aw, phuongzah in; na khut beng inlen tua namsau nivei ahiei, thumvei ahiei kiesuhsah in. Khum khu mi thana namsau ahi hi; mi tampi kithana namsau- amate a imtawm namsau ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin lungtangte zungmang a, mi tampitah a puamat uhi. Amau’ tunkot zosie ah namsau a hiem lam ka pangsah hi. Ah! mi tha nadingin kinawtval a, tunphe bangin teelihleh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Na ziet na vei ah vatgawp in! A hiem lam ngatna popo ah vat in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ke’n zong ka khut ka beng ding a, ka thangpaina dam ding hi; keima Topa in ka genzo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Topa’ thu ka tungah ang tung hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Mihing aw, Babylon kumpipa’ namsau ang pei nadingin lampi ni ciemte in; tua lampi nite gel pen gam khat pana ang pei ding ahi hi. Tuale khuopi zotna lamkabawm ah melci nading khuom khat phut in;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Amor-te’ khuo Rabbah, ahi sihle kul tawh ki-im namsau ang pei nadingin Judah le Jerusalem ah lampi melci in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Azieh pen ai san dingin lampi ni kisuhtuona lamkabawm-ah Babylon kumpipa a ding hi; ama in a thaltangte a lawhlawh a, teraphim dawi thu dongin sa sin sa lung a vel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Kulpi suhkeh nadinga phawhbulte bawl nading, mi tha nadinga thupieh nading, gal sim dinga a kiko nading, tunkot suhkeh nadinga phawhbul bawl nading, lei sunvum nading le khuopi imtawm nadinga tausangte daw nadingin, Jerusalem ading a khut ziet lamah ai sanna tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ahi vangin amate adingin aisanna zuoupi tawh a kibang ding hi; amate in kiciemna thupitah a bawl uhi; ahi vangin amate sala a kimat nadingun a khielna uh a phawsahna ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin Topa Pasien in tam bangin gen hi: Note in na khielna na kitheisah ziehun tua sungah noma’ khielnate kipholah a, tuaci’n na gamtatna zosie vuah na mawnate uh kilang hi, note in na mawna na thei ziehun mi khut sungah na tung ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />A khansie, a gilo Israel gam uh pa aw, dan piehna ni nukhia pen ang tung ta a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Topa Pasien in tam bangin ci hi: Na dielkhip le na kumpi lukhu ladawh in; nate a om ngai bangin om den lo ding hi. a niemte tawisang inlen, a sangte niemsah in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Ama tunga uhna ka pieh ding pa ang tun masangsie, a kisie, a kisie - ka kisiesah gawp ding hi! (tua bang pieng ngai lo hi.)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Mihing aw, thu phuong inlen Ammon-te tawh kisai thu, le amate a kisimmawna thu tawh kisai-in Topa in tam bangin ci hi, ci-in gen in: Namsau khat, namsau khat! Mi tha nadingin dawsa-in om a, vatmai nadingin tunphe bangin a tee lihleh dingin kinawtval hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />A ni a hun ang tung a, a nukhia pen dan piehna a thuoh ding mi khansie, migilote’ ngawngah nang ang koi na dingun, nang adingin mangmuna zuou ang mupieh vua, aisanna zuou ang neipieh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Namsau a pai-ah sietkia un! Nang ang kipiensahna mun, na suona gam sungah keima in thu kang khen ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Ka lungthahna na tungah ka tungsah ding a, ka thangpaina mei bangin na tungah ka mut ding hi. Keima in mi tha dan a siem, migilote’ khut sungah nang kang pie ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Nang pen meitawna sing na hi ding a, lei sungah na sisan a tum ding hi; nang ang phawhkha ta sih ding hi, azieh pen keima Topa in ka gensa ahi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="22" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa’ thu ka kungah ang tung hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Nang mihing aw, sisan luonna khuopi tungah thu khen ding na mah, thu khen ding na mah? Tua ciengin tua khuopi kungah sil mudahuoi a bawl zosie pulah in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Topa Pasien in tam bangin ci hi, ci-in na gen ding hi: Khuopi khat! Ama sungah sisan suohsahin milimte bawl a, tuate tawh ama le ama a kibuasah khuopi, a ni ang tung ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Sisan na suosah ziehin mi mawpa na tang ta a, na milim bawlte tawh na kibuasah hi; na nite na naisah tehteh a, a kisesa na kumte ang tung ta hi. Tua ahi ziehin minamte’ simmaw bawl, gam zosie’ ciemmui nopna kang hisah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />A nai, a gamla-a a om mite in ciemmui nopna-in ang nei ding vua, nang pen a minsie le buoina tawh a kidim na hi ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Na sunga om Israel uliente in amau’ thuneina bang cietin sisan suosah ding beh tupin a nei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Nangma sungah pate le nute kisimmaw bawl hi; na sunga teng pemtate’ sum kimawhlahpieh a, na sunga a teng tagate le meigongte kibawlsie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ka na siengthote na thuse sih a, ka sabbath-te na buasah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Nangma sungah sisan suosah nadinga miholtuo pawl, muol tunga an ne pawl, le na laizang vuah a huasan mama mi pawl zong a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Nang sungah amate in a pate uh’ zi a mawpi uhi; nangma sungah amate in numeite a nin nei laitahin a buon uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Khat pa in a vengpa’ zi tawh sil mudahuoi a bawl hi; adang khat in a mo zumhuoipi-in buasah a, adang khat in a pa’ tanu, a sanggamnu a buasah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Na sungah amate in sisan suosah nadingin guhgol a la uhi; khamkholna sum le a met tawh sum na leitawisah a, na innvengte sum mawhlahpiehin na haulaw hi; tuale nang in kei nei mangngil ta hi, Topa Pasien in ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />En in, na sungah thuman lo-a na nga hauna le na sisan suosahna ziehin ka khuttum ka ziel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Nangma tunga kang thuh ding ni ciengin na hanna in thuoh zo-in, ahi sihle na khut tegel khau den zo ding amah? Keima Topa in ka gensa ahi a, ka sem ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Minamte lahah hing thezahin gam cintengah kang thethang ding a, note lahah na sientho lona uh ka hemkhie ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tuale minamte muna-ah note ziehin keima ei kibuasah ding hi; tuale kei pen Topa ka hi lam nei thei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Topa’ thu ka tungah ang tung hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Mihing aw, kei adingin Israel innkuonte sia-eh a suoh ta uhi; amate a unpi-un sia haltuina meikhuh sunga a om ngun, sumngo, langva, sia, hangeh kihal ahi a, sia-eh a suoh sieng uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin Topa Pasien in tam bangin ci hi: Note na unpi-un sia-eh suoh sieng ta na hi ziehun, Jerusalem laikimah note kang khawmtuo ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Mi khat in ngun, sumngo, sia, hangeh, le langvate haltui dingin sia haltuina meikhuh sungah kholin a zunmang nadingin a tungah meikuong tawh a zap bangin, keima in ka lungthahna le ka thangpaina tawh note kang khawmtuo ding a, khuopi sungah hing koi-in kang haltui ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Note hing khawmtuo-in na tung vuah ka thangpaina meikuong kang sem ding a, khuopi sungah na zungmang ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Sia haltuina meikhuh sungah ngun a zunmang bangin, tua khuopi sungah note na zungmang sieng ding uhi; tuale na tung vuah keima Topa in ka thangpaina kang sunsuh lam note in na thei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Topa’ thu ka tungah ang tung hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Mihing aw, ama kungah gen in: Nang pen ka thangpai ni-a ama tungah guo a zu lo, a sieng lo gam na hi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />A sunga a uliente uh pen a samat a ehbal humpi hawh tawh a kibang uhi; amate in mihing’ hinna a that zo uhi; amate in a goute ule a van manphate uh lahpiehin a sungah mi tampi a meigongsah uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Ka thuhilna tungah a siempute uh ngongtatin ka sil siengthote buasah uhi; amate in sil sieng le sil maimai khen loin, sil sieng le sil sieng lo a kilamdanna zong a hil sih uhi. Ka sabbath-te a thudon sih vua, tuaci’n amate lahah ei buasah uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />A sunga om a kumpi uliente uh pen a sa matsa a ehbal ngiehon tawh a kibang vua, sisan luongsahin thuman lo-a sum nga thei nadingin mihing hinna a that uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />A kamsangte un amate tangin kulpi leikang vui zut bangin thu a imcip vua, amate adingin a dih lo mangmuna le zuou aisannate bawlin, Topa gen lo pi-in, “ Topa in tam bangin gen hi,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Gam sung mite in mite’ na mawh lahpiehin mi’ na a gu uhi; amate in mizawngte le tasam mite bawlsie-in bangma lokia loin pemtate’ na a mawh lahpieh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tuale keima in tua gam ka suhsiet lo nadingin kulpi bawlpha ding le tua gam tangin kulpi hawm sungah ka mai-ah a ding ding mi ka sui kawikawi hi; ahi vangin mi khat zong ka mu sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin amate tungah ka thangpaina ka sungsuh hi; keima in ka thangpaina meikuong tawh amate ka haltum hi; amau’ gamtatna teng a luzang vuah ka tusahkia hi, Topa Pasien in ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="23" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa’ thu ka kungah ang tung hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Mihing aw, nu khat sunga a pieng unau numei ni a om hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />ama gel in Egypt ah pahtatna a bawl uhi; a ngahnut lai-un ama gel a pahtat uhi; khum munah a nawi uh kimehpiehin ngahnu siengtho ahina uh kithampieh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A unu’ min Oholah ahi a, a naunu’ min Oholibah ahi hi. Ama gel kei-a’ ahi a, ama gel in tanu le tapate a nei uhi. A min uh ahile, Oholah pen Samaria a cinopna ahi a, Oholibah pen Jerusalem a cinopna ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Kei-a’ ahi laipi ma-in Oholah na pahtat a, ama in a kingaipi ahi Assyria-te a na lunggul mama hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Amate ahile puondum a sil galhangte, gam uhte le galkapmangte ahi vua, a unpi-un tangval melhoi sakol tung tuon siem vive ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Amate tungah tua nu a na kipumpieh a, amate a unpi-un Assyria mi kituomtelte ahi uhi; tuale ama in a lunggul mi zosie’ milimte tawh ama le ama kibuasah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Egypt gama a oplai-a kipanin a na gamtatnasa ahi a pahtatna ama nu in a khie tuom sih hi; azieh pen a ngahnut cil lai-in pasalte in ama na luppi-in a nawi a na mepieh vua, ama nu tungah amau’ huana zosie a na bunghla uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin keima in a kingaipi a lunggul Assyria-te’ khut sungah ama nu ka pie ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tua mite in ama nu’ puon a hawmang pieh uhi; amate in a tanu le a tapate a man uhi; tuale amate in namsau tawh tua nu a that uhi. Tua nu tungah thu kikhen a, numeite lahah thu gentena khat a suoh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />A naunu Oholibah in tua khu mu napi, ama sangin a huasanna le a pahtatnate siezaw a, a unu sangin a khawhzaw sem lai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ama nu in Assyria-te, gam uhte, galkapmangte, lum le phaw tawh a kivon galhangte, sakol galkapte, sakol tuon a siemte nah lunggul mama a, amate pen a unpi-un tangval melhoi vive ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tuale keima in tua nu a bua lam ka mu hi; ama gel in lampi kibang a zui tuoh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Hizongle tua nu in a pahtatnate zomsuoh lai a, kawm tunga pasal lim kisuoite le a san tawh a kizem Chaldea-te’ limte,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />a kawnga kawnggah gahsa, a lu pan vua a diel mong uh a kaisuh, a unpi-vua uliente tawh a kibang- a pienna gam uh Chaldea ahi Babylon mite’ milim a mu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ama nu in tuate a mu bepin lunggul pailien a, Chaldea gama amate kungah kamtai a sawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ama kunga a om ki-itna lupna tungah Babylon mite a pei vua, amau’ huasanna ziehin tua nu a buasah uhi; tuale amate tawh a kibuasah zaw ciengin tua nu in amate kidahin amate kung panin a kilekia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tua nu in a pahtatna langtang tahin zom suoh a, a guohtanga a opna ang pholah ciengin ken zong a unu kidahin ka kiheisan bangin tua nu zong kidahin ka kiheisan hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Hizongnanle tua nu in a ngahnut lai-in Egypt gamah a pahtat laite ang phawhkia a, a pahtatnate a uongsah semsem a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />tuale ama nu in a neihtah uh laa-a’ cie a pha, a bawtui uh sakoltang lante-a’ za a pha khum sunga a kingaipite a nah lunggul mama hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tua hi a, nang in na neu lai-a na huasanna, Egypt-te in na awm hing tham piehin a bawcil na nawi ang kimepiehnate na hlagul lai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin Oholibah aw, Topa Pasien in tam bangin gen hi: Na kidah zieha na kiheisan na lawm ngaite nang ang do dingin ka hantawh ding a, amate hing zawpi-in muncin teng panin nang ang do ding uhi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tuate pen Babylon-te le Chaldea-te zosie, Pekod-te, Shoa-te, Koa-te le Assyria-te zosie tawh, tangval melhoite, gam uhte le galkapmang zosie, uliente le galhangte le sakol tuon a siemte zosie ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Amate in sakol leengte, vanpuo leengte le mihon tampite tawh nang ang do dingin leilu lam panin ang kuon ding uhi; nang ang do dingin muncin tengah lum le phaw le sia lukhute khusa-in amate in panmun a la ding uhi; tuale keima in amate tungah thukhenna ka ap ding a, amate in a ngaina utawh kituohin nang tungah thu ang khen ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Keima in nang tungah ka lungthahna ka tungsah ding a, amate in lungso tahin ang bawl ding uhi. Amate in na nahkuo le na bilte ang tansan ding vua, a hingsun teng zong namsau tawh a si ding uhi. Amate in na tanu na tapate uh manin a hingsun na mi teng zong mei in a katum ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Amate in na puonte hing sutpiehin a manpha na kizepnate ang lahpieh ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tuaci’n keima in Egypt pana na ken na huasanna le na pahtatnate ka tawpsah ding hi; nangma in tuate hlangai nawn loin, Egypt zong na phawhkha ngai nawn sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile Topa in tam bangin ci hi: Keima in na muda na kiheisan mite’ khut sungah nangma kang pie ding hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />tuale amate in mudana tawh hing huotbawlin, na thalawsa na zosie ang lahpieh ding vua, na guohtangin puonsil loin ang nuasie ding vua, mi tawh na luptonna na tahsa pumguoh ang kipholah ding hi. Na huasanna le na pahtatnate in
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />na tungah tam bang ang tunsah ahi hi, azieh pen minamte tawh na pahtat a, amau’ milimte tawh na kibuasah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Na sanggam nu’ lampi ma na tawn hi, tua ahi ziehin keima in na khut sungah ama’ hai kang pie ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Topa Pasien in tam bangin gen hi: A gol le a thuh na sanggam nu’ hai nangma in na dawn ding hi; ang kisimmaw-in ang kinuisan ding a, tua in tampitah taa hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Zu khamin dana tawh na kidim ding hi. Zauna le manthaina hai pen na sanggam nu Samaria’ hai ahi hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />tua hai dawnin na tawpkang ding a, hai themkehte haizanin na nawite na kuikeh ding hi. Azieh pen ka gensa ahi hi, Topa Pasien in ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin Topa Pasien in tam bangin gen hi: Bangzieh ahei cile kei ei mangngilin nei nua ngatsan ziehin na huasanna le na pahtatnate a paat thuoh na hi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Topa in ka kungah thu ang gen hi: Mihing aw, Oholah le Oholibah tungah thu na khen diei mah? Tua ciengin nangma in ama gel kungah a mudahuoi a gamtatnate uh gen in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Azieh pen ama gel in angkawmin a khut gelah sisan a baang hi; a milimte utawh angkawmin keima tawh a nei a tate nangawn uh milim pasien-te neh dingin a pie uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Tua tham loin ka tungah tam teng a bawl uhi: ama gel in tua ni ma-in ka biehinn buasahin ka sabbath-te a niehsah uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Azieh pen ama gel in a milimte adingin a tate a gaw ciengun tua ni ma-in ka biehinn ah ama gel hing pei-in a buasah uhi. Ka biehinn sungah a gamtatna uh tam bang ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Ama gel in a gamlapi panin pasalte ang pei nadingin kamtai nangawn a sawl vua, tuale amate ang pei uhi. Amate adingin nang le nang na kipumsil a, mitmul za kinu-in, kizepna manphate tawh na kizem hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />lupna hoitah tungah a to vua, tua lupna mai-ah ka gimnamtui le ka sathau kikoina sabuoi kipha hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Tua nu kimvelah mihonpi gamlum valuoi a, gamlah panin zukham mi mawhmawh tampi kipeipi hi; amate in numei gel’ khutah tau bunsahin a lutang vuah kumpi lukhu a khusah uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Tua ciengin keima in, “Kadei, a angkawmkawmna-in tua nu a paatgawp ahi ta hi, hinanle amate in a mawpi lai veve uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Azieh pen numei pahtat khat kungah mite a pei bangin tua nu kungah amate a pei uhi. Tua bangin numei huasan Oholah le Oholibah kungah amate a pei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Ahi vangin a dih thukhente in angkawmna le sisan suosahna tawh ama gel tungah thu a khen ding uhi; bang ding ahei cile ama gel angkawm ahi a, a khut vuah sisan a baang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Topa Pasien in tam bangin ci hi: Ama gel a do dingin mihonpi kuonsah in, zausisah inlen ama gel’ na lahpiehsah in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Mihonpi in ama gel suong tawh sepin, a namsau utawh vatgawp ding uhi; amate in a tanu le a tapte uh thatin a innte uh haltum ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Tam bangin gam sungah huana le lanna ka kamsah ding hi, tua khu numei zosie in thuhilkholna-in sangin nang gamtat bangin amate a huasan nawn sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Na huasanna uh dan na thuoh kia ding gel a, na mawna uh ahi na milim biehna uh ziehin note in dan na thuoh ding uhi; tuale note in keima Topa Pasien ka hi lam nei thei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="24" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />A kum kuona, a hla sawmna, a nisawmna ni-in Topa’ thu ka kungah ang tung hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Mihing aw, tuni mama-in, tuni’ min ciemte in. Babylon kumpipa in tuni mama-in Jerusalem imtawm zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuale a ledo innkuonte kungah thugentena khat gen inlen, amate kungah Topa Pasien in tam bangin ci hi, ci-in gen in: Beel khat suong in, beel suong inlen, a sungah tui zong sung in;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />tua beel sungah sabate, a pheisa le a liengsa, saba tuituoh zosie bua inlen, a gu tuituohte a dimin bua in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ganhonte lahah a tuituoh pen la inlen, beel nei-ah sing bop in; a satelte huon inlen, a sungah a gute huonmin in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin Topa Pasien in tam bangin a gen hi: Sisan a luongsah khuopi, a sunga sam-eh kaisa, a sam-ehte a kawh lo beel in gimna a thuoh ding hi! Saba teeltuom nei loin bakhat zaw ba khatin beel panin thua in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Azieh pen tua sungah ama nu’ luonsah sisan om hi; leivui in tua sisan a vua nadingin lei lahah a sung sih a, suong tungah a sung hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Phu ka lah thei nadingin ka lung a thah nadingin, tua sisan a kivuamang lo nadingin, keima in suong tungah ka koi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin Topa Pasien in tam bangin gen hi: Sisan a luongsah khuopi in gimna a thuoh ding hi! Keima in sing ka tawbe ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Singtun bopin mei phat un; sa hoitahin huonso unlen, beel sungah a namtuite hlah unlen, a gute kagepsah un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Meikam tungah beel hawm suong un. Tuaci’n beel ang sa ding a, a sumsante hing kuongin a nieh teng ang zungmang ding a, sam-ehte ang nemang ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Phattuomna om loin kei le kei ka kigimsuo hi; a sam-eh sasopi teng kawh zo loin, sam-ehte mei in kawhsah zo lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Na huasanna a nieh teng kang sawpsieng vangin, na niehna panin na sieng thei tuom sih hi; na tungah ka thangpaina ka daisah masangsie nang na siengthokia sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Keima Topa in ka gensa ahi hi; a hun ang tung ta a, ka sem ta ding hi. Ka onton sih ding a, hen zong nei loin ka lungsim ka khiem sih ding hi. Na gamtatna le na sepnate dung zui-in na tungah thu ka khen ding hi, Topa Pasien in ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Topa’ thu ka kungah ang tung hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Mihing aw, na et nop penpen mi khat na kung pan khatvei satin ka lamang ding hi; hinanle kap le mau-in na om sih ding a, na hlitui zong na luongsah sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Khuisa inlen, ahi vangin gingsah sin. Tua misi ziehin tau sin. Na diel khim inlen na kengah kedap bun in; na nephu tunglam khu sinlen a kapte’ an zong nehpieh sin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tuaci’n keima in zingmawngin mipite kungah thu ka gen a, a nitah ciengin ka zi a si hi. Tuale keima in a zingni zingmawngin ei kithupieh bangin ka bawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tua ciengin mipite in keima kungah, “Na hici gamtat pen ko adinga bang na deina ahei, ei gen lo ding na mah?” ei ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tua ciengin amate kungah ka gen hi. Topa’ thu ka tungah ang tung hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Israel innkuonte kungah Topa in tam bangin ci hi, ci-in gen in: Na lungsim vua na hlangai uh, na mit vua na et nuom uh, na kilietsahpi na hatna uh ahi ka biehinn ka buasah ding hi; tuale note in na nuasie uh na tanu le na tapate uh namsau-in a si ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Keima in ka bawlsa bangin note in zong na bawl ding uhi; note in na nephu uh a tunglam khu loin, a kapte’ an zong na ne sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Na lu tung vuah na dielkhim uh om ding a, na keng vuah na kedap uh om ding hi; note kap le mau-in na om sih ding vua, hizongle na na khielnate uh ziehin na hingkiem ding vua, khatlekhat na kitaupi ciet ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tua bangin Ezekiel pen note adingin lim khat ahi ding hi; ama’ bawl bangin no zong na bawl ding uhi. Tami thu ang tun ciengin note in keima Topa ka hi lam nei thei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Nang, mihing aw, keima in a mun muonhuoite uh, a kipahna ule a minthanna uh, a mit vua a etcim lo uh, a lungsim vua a hlagul uh a tanu a tapate uzong amate kung panin ka lah ni cieng,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />tuami ni-in a suohta mi khat na kungah hing pei-in thu ang puoh ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Khum ni ciengin na kam kihongin a suohta mipa tawh na kiho ding a, na kamsip ngai nawn sih ding hi. Tuaci’n nang pen amate adingin lim khat na hi ding hi; tuale amate in keima Topa ka hi lam ei thei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="25" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa’ thu ka kungah ang tung hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Mihing aw, Ammon-te lam kinga inlen amate langkhatah thu gen in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ammon-te kungah, Topa Pasien’ thugen za un, ci-in gen in: Topa Pasien in tam bangin gen hi: Note in ka mun siengtho kibuasahin Israel gam ten thei lona-in kikoi a, sal dingin Judah innkuonte a pei uh ciengin, “Awi sam ing ei!” na ci se uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />tua ahi ziehin keima in nisuona gam mite tungah note kang pie ding hi. Amate in note lahah giephuol satin na laikim vuah puonbuh a lam ding uhi; amate in na singga uh ne-in na bawngnawi uh zong a dawn ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Keima in Rabbah khuo pen kalaohte’ an maina mun ka suohsah ding a, Ammon, tuukhumna mun ka suohsah ding hi. Tua ciengin note in keima Topa ka hi lam nei thei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile Topa Pasien in tam bangin ci hi: Note in Israel gam langbawlin na khut na keng utawh tuol sia-in, na sung vuah thangsietna zosiepi teng tawh kipahin na dieng uhi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />tua ahi ziehin note langkhatah ka khut zahin minamte’ tomgam dingin note kang pie ding hi. Keima in minamte sung panin note kang sumaimang ding a, gam tuomtuomte panin kang susie ding hi. Tua ciengin note in keima Topa ka hi lam nei thei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Topa Pasien in tam bangin gen hi: Azieh pen Moab-te in Judah innkuonte pen minam dangte tawh kibang uhi, a ci vua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />tua ahi ziehin Moab muolpang, a gamgi dunga khuopite panin a gam a kisahtheipi munte ahi Beth-jeshimoth, Baal-meon, le Kiriathaim-te ka hawhkhie ding a, a awngin ka omsah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Nisuona lam mite’ tan dingin Ammon-te tawh ka pie ding hi. Tua bangin minamte lahah Ammon-te kiphawhkha nawn lo ding a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />tuale Moab-te tungah keima in thukhenna ka bawl ding hi. Tua ciengin amate in keima Topa ka hi lam ei thei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Topa Pasien in tam bangin gen hi: Edom in Judah innkuon tungah nasie tahin phu la a, amate tunga a phulahna ziehin nah khiel mama hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />tua ahi ziehin Topa Pasien in tam bangci hi: Edom langkhatah ka khut ka zah ding a, a mite le a ganhingte sumaimangin gamkhing suohsahin Teman khuo panin Dedan khuo cieng dong nangawnin namsau tawh amate a si ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Edom tungah ka mi Israel-te zangin phu ka la ding a, ka lungthahna le ka thangpaina tawh kituohin amate in Edom gamah a bawl ding uhi; amate in ka phulahna ahi lam a thei ding uhi, Topa in ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Topa Pasien in tam bangin gen hi: Azieh pen a tawp thei lo kigalneina ziehin Philistia-te in phu la-in thangsietna lungsim ziehin suhsiet nading phu a la uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />tua ahi ziehin Topa Pasien in tam bangin ci hi: Keima in Philistia-te langkhatah ka khut ka zah ding a, Kereth-te sumaimangin tuipi panga a omlaite ka susie ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Keima in thangpaina tawh a kidim danpiehna tawh amate tungah nahpi tahin phu ka la ding hi. Amate tungah phu ka lah ciengin amate in keima Topa ka hi lam ei thei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="26" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Kum sawm le kum khat kum, tua hla a ni masa ni-in Topa’ thu ka kungah ang tung hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Mihing aw, Tyre in Jerusalem tawh kisai-in, “Aha, mite tunkot tawngsan ta hi; kei adingin golpi tahin kihong zo hi; tu-in tua khuopi kisiegawp ta a, kei kungah mi a dimin ang teng ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin Topa Pasien in tam bangin gen hi: En in, Tyre aw, nang kang langpang hi! Tuipi in tuihuolte a naw bangin nang ang langpang dingin minamte kang not ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Amate in Tyre kulpi susie-in a tausangte satcim ding uhi. A gam panin leitang khuot dawhin suongtum beh ka dawhsah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tua khuopi pen tuipi laikima om len phona mun a suoh ding hi. Keima in ka gen zo hi, Topa Pasien in ci hi. Tua khu minamte’ tomgam khuopi suoh ding a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />namsau tawh a gam sunga a khuotate kithat ding hi. Tua ciengin amate in keima Topa ka hi lam ei thei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Azieh pen Topa Pasien in tam bangin ci hi: Keima in Tyre khuopi sim dingin leilu lam panin kumpite’ kumpi ahi Babylon Kumpipa Nebuchadnezzar, a sakolte, a sakol leengte, a lei galkapte, le a thahat galkap honpite tawh kang kuonsah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ama in gam sunga na khuotate namsau tawh that ding hi. Ama in nang langkhatah kulpi bawlin leicien a cieng ding hi. Ama in nang langkhatah innkhum bangin lum a cieng ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ama in a moltum tawh na kulte satcim ding a, a heite tawh na tausangte phuamat ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />A sakolte a tam sengin a tuol totna uh leivui in tuomcip ding hi. A kiphuvang khuopi kulpi sungah mi a lut vapual bangin, na tunkotah ama ang lut ciengin sakol galkap, lengkangte, le sakol leengte’ huging ziehin na kulte a kiling ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ama in a sakol kecinte tawh na gawldung zosie uh a tuoncil ding hi. Namsau tawh na mite a satlia ding vua, a khau mama na khuomte uzong tuolah puamat ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Amate in na neisate uh a tomgam ding vua, na sumbuh vante uzong a lamang ding uhi. Amate in na kulte uh a satkeh ding vua, na innhoite a susie ding uhi. Amate in tui sungah na suongte, na inn singte le na leisiette a pai ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Keima in a lasahna uh ahi tumgingte ka sipsah ding hi; na lyre gingte uzong kiza nawn lo ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Keima in nang suong gawta kang suohsah ding hi; nang pen len phona mun na hi ta ding hi. Keima Topa in ka gensa ahi ziehin nang ang kilamkia nawn lo ding hi, Topa Pasien in ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Topa Pasien in Tyre khuopi tungah tam bangin gen hi: Nang sungah kithana kizom suohin a liem a baite tau vangutin, amate in na puana awging a zah uh ciengin tuikul gamte kiling lo ding uh amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tua ciengin tuipi sunga gam uhte zosie a kumpi topha tung uh panin a kumsuh ding uhi; amate in a puontuolte uh sutdawhin a kizem a puonsilte uh a hawhdawh ding uhi. Amate zau-in a kithin kawmun puon a sil ding vua, tuolah a to ding uhi; a peisuh a peitona vuah nang ziehin amate a citun ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Amate in nang tungah kaateng loin tam bangin ang gen ding uhi: Aw khuopi minthang, nang le na sunga tengte, tuipi tunga a hatpen ahi ngaisa khuopi, gam thupi zosie tungah nangma’ giinhuoina a tungsah khuopi, bang a cile tuipite pana hici manthai va-ia na diei!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Nang na pua ni-in tuikul gam teng a citun uhi; nang na manthaina ziehin tuikul gam teng lungkie uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile Topa Pasien in tam bangin gen hi: Ten lo gie lona khuopite bangin a daidam khuopi kang suohsah ding a, na tungah tui thuhpi hing sawlin tui huolpite in ang tuom ciengin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />nidanglai-in Hankhuh sunga a kumsuh mite tawh kang sawnhla suh ding a, tangtawnga sietna a thuoh Hankhuh sunga a kumsuh mite kung leinei-ah kang tengsah ding hi. Tuaci’n mihingte tenna leitangah ang kitengsah sih ding a, tenna ding mun zong na nga sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />A lipkhap huoi-in kang maimangsah ding a, na om nawn sih ding hi; ang kisui vangin ang kimukia ngai ta sih ding hi, Topa Pasien in ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="27" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa’ thu ka kungah ang tung hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tu-in nang mihing aw, Tyre tungah kaateng lo inlen,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />tuipi lutna lamkot a om, tuikul gam mun tampi pana sumbawl mite kisuhtuona muna a teng Tyre tungah Topa Pasien in tam bangin ci hi, ci-in gen in: Tyre khuopi aw, nang in “Hoina ah ka bucing hi,” ci-in na gen zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Na gamgi teng tuipite laikimah a om uhi; nang ang lamte in na hoina bukimsah uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Amate in na singpeh zosie Senir taasingte tawh a bawl uhi; amate in na dielkhaina khuom dingin Lebanon taamtah sing a la uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Amate in Bashan gangpi singte panin nangma ang kihawna ding a bawl uhi; Cyprus gam tuikulte pana a kila taasante tawh na tuong a pha vua, saihapah tawh a zem uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Egypt pana puon hoi kizem khu na puonkhai ahi a, tua khu na landiel dingin kizang hi; Elisha tuikulte pana a kinga a dum le a dupsan puonte pen na tungkhu ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Sidon le Arvad gama tengte khu nangma ang hotte ahi vua, nangma sunga a teng Zemer khut siemte khu nangma ang hawlte ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Na sungah Gebal gam upate le a khut siemte in na tembaw vangte a phawbih uhi. Na vante a lei dingin tuipi tunga a om tembaw zosie, tembaw nasemte tawh nangma sungah a om uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Paras, Lud le Put-te in na galkap na a sem vua, na galhangte ahi uhi; amate in na sungah lum le sia lukhu khai-in nang ang thupise uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Na kul kimvelah Arvad le Helech-te a om uhi; na tausang vuah Gamad mite a om uhi. Amate in na kul kimvelah a thalbawmte a khai uhi; amate in na hoina a bukimsah uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Na neisa van a tam ziehin Tarshish-te in nang tawh summet a bawlton uhi; amate in na vante, ngun, sia, langva, le hangehte tawh a hleng uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Javan, Tubal, le Meshech mite in nang tawh summet a bawlton vua, mihingte le sumngno beelte tawh na sumbuh vante a hleng uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Beth-togarmah gam mite in na vanzuate sakol, sakol galkapte, le laate tawh a hleng uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Rhod mite in nang tawh summet a bawlton uhi; tuikul gam tampite nangma’ aituom vanzuana ahi uhi; amate in na lei dingin saiha le ning singte ang puo uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Nang in van na hau ziehin Edom-te in nang tawh summet a bawlton uhi; amate in na vanzuate turquoise suong manpha, puon dupsan, puon kizem, saihadiel puonhoite, suongkhiba le ruby suongmanpha-te tawh a hleng uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Judah le Israel gamte in nang tawh summet a bawlton uhi; Minnith pana a pieng mangbu, taang, khuoizu, sathau, le zatuite tawh na sumbuh vante a hleng uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Nang in na tampi na nei zieh le hauna namkim-Helbon pana zu le tuumul kang namkimte- na nei ziehin Damascus in nang tawh summet a bawlton hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Uzal khuo panin Vedan gam le Javan gam mite in na vanzuate tawh summet a bawlton uhi; amate in na sumbuh vante sia huonsa, thahsing le phaite tawh a hleng uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Dedan mite in tuon nading sakol topha puonte nang tawh sumbawlna-in a nei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Arabia gam le Kedar ulien zosie pen tuuno, tuutang, le keelte tawh summet na bawlpi a na patah mama mite ahi uhi; tamte tawh amate in nang tawh sum a bawlton uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Sheba le Raamah sumbuhte in nang tawh sum bawlton uhi; amate in na vanzuate a hoi penpen sing namtui nam zosie, suong manpha zosie, le kham tawh a hleng uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Haran, Canneh, Eden, Sheba sumbuhte, Asshur, le Chilmad-te in nang tawh sum a bawlton uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />A kituomteel puonsilte, a dum le a kizem hoi puonsilte, inn sunga a kipha a kizem a pawlte, le lim taha kiheh khauhuolte ahi a, tam bang teng in nang tawh sum a bawl uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Nangma dinga summet bawl dingin Tarshish tembawte khuol a zin uhi. Tuaci’n nang pen tuipi laikimah vangihpi tawh na kidim hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Ang hotte in tuipi thuh sungah ang tut vua, tuipi laikimah nisuona lam hui in ang tummangsah ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Nang na kisiet ni ciengin na haunate, na vanzuate, na sumbuh vante, na tembaw nasemte le na tembaw hawlte, na tembaw phawbihte le na sumbuh van leite, na kisiet ni ciengin na optonpi na galhang zosie, na unpi-un tuipi laizangah na tummang ta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Na tembaw hawlte kikona awging in gamcin teng kithingsah a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />a hotte zosie a unpi-un a tembaw panin a kumsuh uhi. Tembaw nasemte le tembaw hawl zosie, tuipi pieu ah a ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Nang ziehin amate a gingin mau-in lainatna tawh a awng uhi. A lutung vuah leivui a kibuoh vua, vutvai lahah a kilawmlia uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />nang ziehin a lu uh heukieu-in la-ip puon a sil uhi. Lungsim na sa luo-in ang kaa vua, nahpi tahin a thum uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />A hlasiet ziehun nang adingin kaateng loin, tam bangin ang kaa uhi: “Tyre khuopi banga tuipi laizangah a kisusie koi a om ngai ta ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Na vanzuate tuipi tung pan ang tun ciengin mi tampi na lungkimsah hi; na hau sengna le na sumbuh vante in leitung kumpite na hausah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Tu-in tuipi sungah kisie gawpin tuipi thuh sungah na om ta hi; na sumbuh vante le na nasem zosie nang tawh tuipi sungah a tummang ta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Tuikul gama teng mi zosie in cimulthaw huoi a sa uhi; a kumpite uh a zau sengun a mai uh a kikhuleh sieng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Mipite lahah sum bawlte in ang ehneh ho uhi; zauhuoi tahin na mangthai ta a, na omkia nawn sih ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="28" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa’ thu ka kungah ang tung hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Mihing aw, Tyre kumpipa kungah Topa Pasien in tam bangin ci hi, ci-in gen in: Na lungsim a kilietsah ziehin, “Kei pasien ka hi hi; pasien-te’ tona tuipi laikimah ka to hi,” na ci hi. Hinanle nangma’ lungsim le pasien’ lungsim na tekah vangin, nang pen pasien na hi sih a, mi maimai na hi bo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Daniel sangin na pilzaw sam a, nang kung panin phuolsel kici bangma om lo hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />na pilna le na theitelna tawh neisa na kikhol a, na sum koina ah kham le ngun na kholvum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Summet bawl na siem ziehin na neisa na pungsah a, tua na neisate ziehin na lungsim a kiliensah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin Topa Pasien in tam bangin ci hi: Nang in na lungsim le Pasien’ lungsim na tekah ziehin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />minamte lahah nang ang do dingin a giinhuoi pen gamdang mite kang sawl ding hi; amate in a etlawm na pilna do dingin namsau a dawh ding vua, na thupina a suthang ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Amate in Hankhuh sungah ang sawnsuh ding vua, note, tuipite laikimah sisie-in na si ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Nang ang sat liemte’ khut sungah nang pen pasien hi loin mi maimai khat na hi vangin, “Kei pasien ka hi hi,” na ci lai lai diei mah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Nang pen gamdang mite’ khut tawh tep kitan lote si bangin na si ding hi; bangzieh ahei cile keima Topa Pasien in ka gensa ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tua banah Topa’ thu ka kungah ang tung hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Mihing aw, Tyre kumpipa adingin kaateng lo inlen Topa Pasien in tam bang ci hi, ci-in ama kungah gen in: Nang a bucing suoikaina khutsip na hi a, pilna tawh na kidim a, na hoina a bucing hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Pasien’ Eden um ah nang na om a, carnelian, chrysolite, suongkang, beryl, onyx, jasper, sapphire, turquoise, le emerald suongmanpha namcin teng khu nangma kituomna ahi hi; na kizepna le na kikhuohnate kham tawh kibawl ahi a, tuate khu nang ang kipiensah ni-a kisiemkhol ahi ta bo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Keima in nang ang cing dingin sathau kinusa cherub ka koi hi. Pasien’ muol siengtho tungah na om a, meisuongte lahah na vah kawikawi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ang kipiensah ni-a kipanin na sungah khielna a kimu cieng dong, na gamtatna paubanna om lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Na sumbawl a tam ziehin tatsietna tawh na kidim a, mawna na bawl hi; tuaci’n a bua na khat bangin Pasien’ muol panin kang paimang ta a, tuale nang ang cing cherub in meisuongte lah panin ang notdawh ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Na mel a hoi ziehin na lungsim a kiliensah hi; na minthan ding na deina lamin na pilna na susie gawp hi. Keima in tuol sena-in kang nei a, kumpite in munop ang sah dingun a mai vuah kang pholah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />A thuman lo sum na bawlna ziehin, na khielna a tam seng ta a, nangma in munsieng zosie na buasah ta hi. Tuaci’n na sung panin mei ka kuongsah hi; tua mei in nang hing katumin ang mu mi zosie mai lei lahah vut kang suohsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Mite lahah nang ang thei mite a ciza sieng gawp ding uhi; a zauhuoi-in na mangthai ta a, na omkia ngai nawn sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Topa’ thu ka kungah ang tung hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Mihing aw, Sidon lam kinga-in ama langkhatah thu phuong inlen,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Topa in tam bangci hi, ci-in gen in: Sidon khuopi aw, nang kang langpan ding a, keima in note lahah minthanna ka nga ding hi. Ama sungah ka siengthona lahin a sungah thu ka khen ciengin, keima Topa ka hi lam amate in ei thei ding uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />azieh pen a sungah pul natna ka tungsah ding a, a lampi tengah sisan ka luongsah ding hi; muncin tengah namsau tawh ang kido-in, na khuo laizangah mite pua-in a si ding uhi. Tuale amate in keima Topa ka hi lam ei thei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Israel innkuonte in a innvengte lahah amate a simmaw bawl, ling le khau banga a sun thei koima a mu nawn sih ding uhi. Tuale amate in keima Topa Pasien ka hi lam ei thei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Topa Pasien in tam bangin ci hi: Minamte lahah a kithetangna panun Israel innkuonte ka kaikhop ciengin minamte muna ah ka siengthona ka talang ding hi, tua ciengin ka nasem Jacob tunga ka piehsa amau’ leitangah a teng ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tua sungah amate lungmuong tahin a teng ding vua, amate in inn lamin lengga umte a bawl ding uhi. Amate a simmaw bawl a vengte zosie tungah thu ka khen ciengin amate lungmuong tahin a teng ding vua, keima Topa a Pasien uh ka hi lam ei thei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="29" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />A kum sawmna, a hla sawmna, a ni sawm le ni ni-in Topa’ thu ka kungah ang tung hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Mihing aw, Egypt kumpipa Pharaoh lam nga inlen, ama le Egypt-te zosie langkhatah thu phuong in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ama hopi inlen Topa Pasien in tam bangin ci hi, ci-in gen in: Egypt kumpipa Pharaoh aw, gun laikima a kuol gulhiempi na hi a, nangma kang langpang hi. Nang in, “Nile gunpi kei-a’ ahi hi; kei dinga ka bawl ahi hi,” na ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Na khadangah ngakuoi sietin, na gun sunga nga zosie na lip kahah ka behsah ding hi. Na lip kahah a beh nga zosie, na gun sunga nga zosie tawh kang kaito sieng ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Nang le na gun sunga nga zosie, gamlahah kang pai ding hi; Lopang lahah na kie ding a, khop lo le vui loin na om ding uhi. Leitunga gamsate le vana vate’ an dinga kang piehsa na hi ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tua ciengin Egypt-a teng zosie in keima Topa ka hi lam ei thei ding uhi. Israel innkuonte adingin nang pen pumpeng ciengkhut na hi hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />a khut utawh ang tuh ciengun na kuoi tawng a, amau’ liengko gu zosie na kilawisah hi; nangma tungah ang kingap ciengun nang in na kuoi tawng a, a keng uh na hehsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin Topa Pasien in tam bangin ci hi: Na tungah namsau kang lengsah ding a, na kung panin ganhingte le na mihingte ka sumaimang ding hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />tuale Egypt pen a kinuasie gamkhing a suoh ding hi. Tua ciengin amate in keima Topa ka hi lam ei thei ding uhi. Nang in, “Nile gunpi kei-a’ ahi a, keima bawlsa ahi hi,” na ci ziehin
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />keima in nangma le na gunte ka langpang hi. Egypt gam sung, Migdol panin Syene cieng dong le Ethiopia gamgi dongin, a kinuasie gamkhing ka suohsah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Mihingte le ganhingte in lamhlahna-in tua gam a nei sih ding uhi; kum sawmli sung koima a teng sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Gamkhingte lahah Egypt gam pen gamkhing khat ka suohsah ding ahi; tuale a khuopite uzong a kinuasiesa khuopite lahah kum sawmli sung gamkhing a suoh ding uhi. Keima in minamte lahah Egypt mite ka thethang ding a, gam tuomtuomte lahah ka thezah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tua banah Topa Pasien in tam bangin gen hi: Keima in kum sawmli a cin zaw ciengin a kithethangna uh minamte lah panin Egypt mite ka kaikhawmkia ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Keima in Egypt’ vangphatnate ka piekia ding a, a pienna gam uh Pathros gamah amate ka peipikia ding hi; khum munah kumpi gam ginalo khatin amate a om ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Kumpi gamte lahah a ginalo pen a suoh ding vua, minamte tungah a kikhai zo ngai nawn sih ding uhi; minamte tungah vai a hawm zo ngai nawn lo dingin amate ka neukhen ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Amate pen Egypt mite, Israel innkuonte’ muon le suon ahi ngai ta sih ding uhi; amate in panpina ngenin amate lam a kihei uh ciengin a khielnate uh a phawhkia ding uhi. Tua ciengin amate in keima Topa Pasien ka hi lam ei thei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Kum sawmni le kum sagi kum, a hla masa, a ni masa ni-in Topa’ thu ka kungah ang tung hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Mihing aw, Babylon Kumpipa Nebuchadnezzar in Tyre do nadingin a galkapte nahpi-in hanciemsah hi; mi zosie a samte uh pulmangin a liengkote uh a paat sieng hi; hinanle ama in ahi a, a galkapte in ahi zongin Tyre dona-a a kizang a gim thaman uh bangma a lemlaw sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin Topa Pasien in tam bangin ci hi: Babylon Kumpi Nebuchadnezzar tungah Egypt gam ka pie ding hi; tuale ama in a neisate uh puomang ding a, a gam uh susie-in a tomgam ding hi; tua khu a galkapte’ hlasum ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />A nasep a thaman dingin Egypt gam ama ka pie hi, azieh pen amate in keima adingin a sem uhi, Topa Pasien in ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Khum ni ciengin keima in Israel innkuonte adingin kii khat ka momsah ding a, amate lahah na kam ka hong ding hi. Tua ciengin amate in keima Topa ka hi lam ei thei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="30" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa’ thu ka kungah ang tung hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Mihing aw, thu phuong inlen, Topa Pasien in tam bangin ci hi, ci-in gen in: “Alah, khum ni khu!” ci-in kapin mau in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Azieh pen a ni nai ta a, Topa’ ni nai ta hi; khum ni khu meiikai ni hi ding a, minamte manthai hun hi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Egypt tungah namsau khat tu ding a, Ethiopia ah lunggimna om ding hi. Egypt ah a kithatte pua-in a si ciengin a neisate uh kipuomang ding a, a bulpite uh kiphuapai ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ethiopia, Put, Lud, Arabia, Libya, le a kipawlpi gam mite namsau tawh puaton ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Topa in tam bangin ci hi: Egypt panpite a pua ding vua, a kisahtheipi uh a hatna uzong kiemsuh ta ding hi. Migdol pan Syene dongin tua gam sunga mite namsau tawh si ding uhi, Topa Pasien in ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Gamkhingte lahah amate gamkhing khat a suoh ding vua, khuopi kisiete lahah a khuopite uh kihal ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tua ciengin keima in Egypt haltumin ama a panpi zosie a kisuhgam ciengin, keima Topa ka hi lam amate in ei thei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Khum ni ciengin bangma awlmaw a nei lo Ethiopia mite a zausisah dingin ka kung panin tembaw tawh ka kamtaite a pei ding uhi; Egypt a manthai ni-in amate tungah lunggimna a tung ding hi; azieh pen khum hun ang tung ta hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Topa Pasien in tam bangin ci hi: Babylon Kumpipa Nebuchadnezzar’ khut tawh Egypt mihonpite ka sumaimang ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Khum gam a susie dingin ama le a omtonpi a mite ahi, minamte lahah a giinhuoi pente kikuonsah ding hi; amate in Egypt gam langkhatah a namsau a dawh ding vua, gam sung teng misi tawh kidim ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Guntuite ka kangsah ding a, migilote’ khutah khum gam ka zuamang ding hi. Khum gam le a sunga om zosie gamdang mite’ khut tawh ka mangthaisah ding hi, keima Topa in ka genzo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Topa Pasien in tam bangin ci hi: Memphis khuopi-a om milimte ka maimangsah ding hi; Egypt gamah a uh ding koima om nawn lo ding hi; tuaci’n keima in Egypt gamah zauna ka tungsah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Pathros gam khu gamkhing suohsahin, Zoan khuopi mei-in ka hal ding a, keima in Thebes khuopi tungah thu ka khen ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Egypt mun muonhuoi, Pelusium khuopi tungah ka thangpaina ka tungsah ding a, Thebes mihonpite ka sumaimang ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Keima in mei tawh Egypt ka hal ding hi; Pelsium khuopi in gim genthei a thuoh ding hi. Thebes kulpi kehgawp ding a, suntang lai-in a galte tawh Memphis a kimu ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />On khuo le Pibeseth khuo tangvalte, namsau tawh a si ding vua, a khuopite uh amau le amau saltangin a pei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Khum munah Egypt’ uhna ka suhsiet ciengin, sun lai-in Tehaphnehes ah mutzin tung ding a, a kilietsahna mang ding hi; meeilum in Khuopi khu ding a, amau’ khuotate saltangin pei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tuaci’n keima in Egypt tungah thu ka khen ding a, tua ciengin Topa ka hi lam amate in ei thei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />A kum sawm le khatna, a hla masa, tua hla a ni sagina ni-in Topa’ thu ka kungah ang tung hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Mihing aw, Egypt kumpipa Pharaoh’ ban ka tawngsah ta hi; ama a thahatin namsau a lap zokia nading, a dam sieng nadingin kitunpieh lo a, zong kituompieh lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin Topa Pasien in tam bangin ci hi: Keima in Egypt kumpipa Pharaoh ka langpang hi. A banhat pen le a tawngsa pen tawh a ni-in ka hliehtawng ding hi; tuale a khut panin namsau ka kiesah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Minamte lahah Egypt-te ka thethang ding a, gamcin tengah ka thezah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Babylon kumpipa’ bantha ka khausah ding a, ama khutah ka namsau ka koi ding hi; ahi vangin Pharaoh’ ban ka hliehtawng ding a, a liem a si ding mite tau bangin Babylon kumpipa mai-ah a tau ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Babylon kumpipa’ bante ka khausah ding a, ahi vangin Pharaoh’ bante a kiesuh ding hi. Keima in Babylon kumpipa’ khutah ka namsau ka koi ciengin amate in keima Topa ka hi lam ei thei ding uhi. Ama in Egypt gam langkhatah namsau leh ding a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />minamte lahah Egypt-te thethangin gamcin tengah zong ka thezah ding hi. Tua ciengin keima Topa ka hi lam amate in ei thei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="31" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />A kum sawm le khatna, a hla thumna, a ni masa ni-in Topa’ thu ka kungah ang tung hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Mihing aw, Egypt kumpipa Pharaoh le a mihonte kungah tam bangin gen in: Na liet dan koi pen tawh na kibang bep ei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Assyria ngaisun in, ama pen a bazam hoi-in, a hlim in gamsung teng dielsah a, a kung sang mama-in meiilum lahah a dawn a kidawh to, Lebanon taamtah sing ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tui in ama tapnom dildel a, a thuhna sunga om tui in ama a sangsah hi. A pona mun kimvelah a guntui kiluongsah a, gamlah singkung zosie ah a luituite a luongsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuaci’n gamlah sing zosie sangin tua khu ang sangzaw a, a phungzungah tui a tam ziehin a bate ang golin ang sau hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Vana leng vate in a ba lahah bu tomin a bazam nei-ah gamsate a nosang vua, ama’ hlim nei-ah minam lien zosie a teng uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A huite in tui tamna munah zung hlasuh ahi ziehin a kung golin bazau a, a etlawm mama hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Pasien’ um sunga tamtaahte in ama demzo loin, taasingte in zong ama a demzo sih hi. A bate tawh tekah dingin thei kungte bangma ahi sih hi; Pasien’ um sunga singpote tawh zong a hoina a kibang sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />A bazam tampitah tawh a melhoi dinga ka bawl ahi a, Pasien’ um sung, Eden-a singpo zosie in tua khu a eng uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin Topa Pasien in tam bangin ci hi: Tua pen sang tahin kitungdawh a, a dawn in meiilum banto-in, a sanna ziehin a lungsim zong ang kiliensah pai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Minamte’ uhpa khut sungah ama ka pie hi; tua pa in a gitlona tawh kituohin a bawlsie hi. Ama pen ka paimangsa ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Gamdang mi, minamte lahah a giinhuoi pente in tua sing phua-in a nuasie uhi. Muoltung teng le kuomcin tengah a bate kie a, gam sunga tui pulna cintengah a nabawh teng a tawngsa-in a kiemang hi; tuale leitung mi zosie in a hlim nei panin hing pei-in a peisan ta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tua a pua sing tungah vana leng va zosie tuong a, tua a ba kawmte lahah gamsa namcin a gieh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tam teng zosie pen tui gei-a a po singkungte khat beh in khanpha-in tua tanin a san lo nading, ahi sihle a dawnte in meilum a bat zo lo nading, le tui a kham singkung khat beh tuate tana a san lo nading ahi hi. Bangzieh ahei cile amate, a unpi-un mihingte zosie tawh, leinei gam le Hankhuh sunga kumsuhte tawh a kipieton ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Topa Pasien in tam bangin gen hi: Misikhuo ah a kumsuh ni-in, ama tunga a om tua a thuhna mun pen khahin ka tuom hi; keima in a guntuite luongsah nawn loin a tuihuolte ka khahtan hi. Khuomiel in Lebanon gam ka khusah a, tua ziehin gamlahah a po sing zosie a vul sieng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Hankhuh sunga a peisuhte tawh ama Misikhuo ah ka khiehsuh ciengin, ama’ puana ging ziehin keima in minamte ka kilingsah hi; Eden-a a po sing zosie, Lebanon-a a hoipen kiteelte, tui a kicing taha a nga zosiete leinei ah nuomtahin a om ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Minamte lahah ama’ hlim nei-a a teng a kipawlpite namsau-a a kithatte tawh Misikhuo ah a kumsuh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Na thupi dan le na liet dan Eden um sunga singkungte lahah bang singkung tawh na kisun ei? Tu-in nang pen Eden singkungte tawh leinei ah ang kikhiesuh ding hi; nang pen namsau tawh a kithat tep kitan lo mite lahah na lum ding hi. Tam pen Pharaoh le ama’ mihonte ahi hi, Topa Pasien in ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="32" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />A kum sawm le nina, a hla sawm le ni, a ni masa ni-in Topa’ thu ka kungah ang tung hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Mihing aw, Egypt kumpipa Pharaoh tungah kaateng lo inlen tam bangin ci in: Minamte lahah nang le nang humpi-in na kingaisun a, ahi vangin nang pen tuipite sunga gulhiempi tawh na kibang lel hi; nang in na luidung teng na tawhnawi a, na keng tawh tui lawhgawpin luidung teng na niehsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Topa Pasien in tam bangin ci hi: Mihon tampite tawh na tungah ka len ka khu ding hi; keima in ka len sungah nangma kang kainal ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Keima in nang tuol sena-in hing nei-in, gamlahah kang pai ding a, na tungah vana leng vate hing khawlsahin, leitunga gamsa zosie in a kham tahun kang nesah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Muoltung tengah na sa ka thethang ding a, kuom sung teng na siluong tawh ka kidimsah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Keima in na sisan luongte tawh gamlah le muoltung dong ka pahsah ding a, tui pulna teng zong na sisan tawh kidim ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Nang kang phietmai cieng in vante lia-in aasite ka mielsah ding hi; meii in ni ka liesah ding a, hla zong tang lo ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Vantunga khuovah tang zosie na tungah ka mielsah ding a, na gam sungah mutzin ka tungsah ding hi, Topa Pasien in ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Na thei ngai nai lo gama minamte lahah sal dinga kang kai ciengin, mi tampite’ lungsim ka buoisah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Nangma ziehin mi tampi in lamdang ka sasah ding hi; amate mai-ah ka namsau ka vih ciengin nang ziehin kumpite zau-in citun ding uhi. Nang na pua ni ciengin a hin nading uh ngaisunin, a tatna popo vuah amate zau-in a citun ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile Topa Pasien in tam bangin ci hi: Nangma ang do dingin Babylon kumpipa’ namsau ang kuon hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Minamte lahah amate zosie in a giin pen uh ahi mi thahatte’ namsau tawh na mihonte ka thatsah ding hi. Egypt’ kisahtheipi teng amate in a kisiesah ding vua, a mihon zosie uzong a sigam sieng ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Keima in tui nienna gei-a om a ganhonte uh ka susie ding a, mihing’ keng le ganhing’ kecin in tua tui a niehsah ngai ta sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tua ciengin amau’ tui ka cimsah ding a, sathau bangin a luidungte uh ka luongsah ding hi, Topa Pasien in ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Keima in Egypt gam khu gamkhing ka suohsah ding a, a sunga om zosie hawhkhie-in tua sunga teng zosie ka thagam ciengin, amate in keima Topa ka hi lam ei thei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tami khu kaala ahi a, kaateng a kilo ding ahi hi. Minamte’ numeite in kaatengin a lo ding uhi. Egypt tung le a mihonte tungah tam bangin kaateng kilo ding hi, Topa Pasien in ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />A kum sawm le nina, a hla masa , a ni sawm le nga ni-in Topa’ thu ka kungah ang tung hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Mihing aw, Egypt mihonte adingin kap inlen, Hankhuh sunga a peisuh Egypt mite le minam thupite’ tanute tawh leinei gamah amate sawlsuh ta’n.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />“Melhoina lamah koi na khupzo uh ahei? Kumsuh un! Tep kitan lote tawh kivui ton ta un!” ci in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Namsau-a kithatte lahah amate a si ding uhi. Namsau-a si dingin Egypt kipie zo hi; ama le a mihonte a ni-un kaiphit un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Misikhuo laikim panin a thahat uliente in a kithuopi teng utawh amate thu a gen ding uhi: “Amate ang peisuh zo ta vua, namsau-a kithat tep kitan lote tawh a lumton lai uhi,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Namsau-a kithat misi zosie a opna khum munah Assyria le a kithuopi zosie a om vua, a kimvel vuah a hankhuhte uzong a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />A hante uh Leihawm thuhpi sungah a om hi. A han kimvel vuah a kithuopite uh a om a, amate a unpi-un namsau-a kisatlia ahi uhi. Amate in gam sunga a hinglaite a patausah uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Khum mun a han kimvela a om mihon zosie tawh Elam a om hi; amate a unpi-un namsau-a site ahi vua, tep zong kitan loin leinei gamah peisuhin gam sunga a hinglaite a patausah uhi. Leihawm sunga peisuhte tawh amate a maizum ton uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />A mihon zosie utawh a kithat tonte lahah amate in Elam ading lupna khat a bawl vua, a kimvel vuah a amau’ hante omin, amate pen a unpi-un tep tan lo namsau-a a site ahi uhi; azieh pen amate in a hingte’ gamah patauna omsahin Leihawm sunga a peisuhte tawh zumna a thuohton uhi; a kithat mite lahah amate kikoi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Khum munah Meshech, Tubal, le a mihonte a om vua, a kimvel vuah a hankhuhte uh omin, amate a unpi-un tep tan lo namsau-a kithatte vive ahi uhi; azieh pen amate in a hingte’ gam a patausah uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Amate pen Misikhuo ah a galvante utawh a peisa, a namsau uh a kitangkhapsah, a gute uh tunga a lumte uh a kikoipieh, tanglai-a a sisa galhangte tawh a kivui ton sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tuaci’n nang ang kisat guoi ding a, tep kitan lote le namsau-a kithatte lahah ang kivui ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Edom zong a thahat ziehin namsau-a kithat a kumpite le a gam uhte tawh khum munah kivui ton a, Leihawm sunga a peisa tep kitan lote tawh a lumton uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tua sungah leilu lam ulien zosie le Sidon mite zosie a om vua, a kithatte tawh maizum thuohin a peiton uhi, azieh pen a thahat ziehun amate in tam bang patauna zosie a piengsah uhi; tep kitan lo namsau-a kithatte tawh amate kivui tonin Leihawm sunga a peisuhte tawh zumna a thuoh ton uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Pharaoh in amate a mu ciengin ama le a mihonte- Pharaoh le a galkap zosie- a kihenem zo tuom ding uhi, Topa Pasien in ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile ama in a hingte gamah patauna a piengsah hi; tua ahi ziehin Pharaoh le a mihon zosie, namsau-a kithatte tawh tep kitan lo mite lahah kivui ton ding uhi, Topa Pasien in ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="33" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa’ thu ka kungah ang tung hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Mihing aw, na mite hopi inlen amate kungah tam bangin gen in. Keima in gam khatah namsau ka kuonsah a, tua gam mite in amate lah panin a galvil dingun mi khat se uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />tuale galvil pa in gam sunga ang tung namsau mu-in pengkul mutin mite kungah a hilkhol a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />tua ciengin mi khatpo in pengkul ging za napi-in hilkholna a thudon sih a, tuale namsau hing kuonin amate a thagam sieng leh, amau’ sisan amau’ lu tungah tu ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Amate in pengkul ging za napi-in tua hilkholna a thudon sih uhi; amau’ sisan amate tungah a tu ding hi. Ahi vangin amate in tua hilkholna a thudon vua ahile a hinna uh a hundam zo ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ahi vangin galvil pa in namsau ang kuon mu napi pengkul mut loin mite a hilkhol sih a, tuale namsau hing kuonin amate lahah mi khatpo a tha leh, amau’ khielna zieha si ahi vua, hizongle keima in galvil pa tungah amau’ sisan ka phul ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuaci’n mihing aw, keima in Israel innkuonte’ galvil pa dingin nang kang koi zo hi; ka kam sung panin thu na zah popo ciengin, kei kung pana pataukonate amate na hilsawn ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Keima in migilote kungah, “Migilote aw, na si valon ding uhi,” ka ci a, tuale a lampi panun migilote ang kihei nadingin amate na galgih sih leh, amau’ khielna sungah migilote si ding a, ahi vangin nang kungah amau’ sisan kang phul ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ahi vangin nang in a lampi panun migilote ang kiheikia nadingin na hilkhol a, tuale a lampi panun amate ang kihei nop sih uleh, a khielna sung vuah migilote si ding a, ahi vangin nang na hileh na hinna na hundam zo ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Mihing aw, tu-in Israel innkuonte kungah note in tam bangin na genzo uhi, ci-in gen in: “Eite in i tatkhielnate ule i mawnate uh i puola vua, amate ziehin i tha zawngkhal uhi; tua ahile eite bang i ci hinzo ding uh ahei?” na ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Amate kungah tam bangin gen in, Topa Pasien in ci hi. Kei a hing ka hi ma bangin, migilote’ sina ah ka kipah sih hi, tua sangin a gitlona panun migilote hing kinuale-in a hin ding uh ka deizaw hi; na gitlonate panun hing kinuale un, hing kinuale un; Israel innkuonte aw, bang dinga si ding na hi uh ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuale nang mihing aw, na mite kungah tam bangin gen in: Midihte in khielna a bawl uleh amau’ dihna in amate hundam lo ding hi; migilote a gitlona panun a kinuale uleh amau’ gitlona in amate puasah lo ding hi; tuale midihte a maw ciengin zong a amau’ dihna in amate a hingsah sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Midihte kungah pel loin na hing ding uhi, ka ci vangin amate in a dihna uh muongin khielna a bawl uleh a dih amau’ gamtatna khat zong kiphawpieh lo ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tua banah keima in migilote kungah, “Note na si valon ding uhi,” ka ci vangin a mawna uh panin kinuale-in thuman thutangin a gamtat vua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />migilote in vankhap lekia-in, a guhsa uh vante piekia-in hinna a pie thukhamte a zui vua, khielna a bawl nawn sih uleh, amate a hing valon ding a, a si sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Amate’ bawlsa mawnate khat zong amau’ siet nadingin kiphawkhah pieh nawn lo ding hi; amate thuman thutang tawh a gamta ahi vua, amate a hing valon ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Hinanle na mite in amau’ gamtat dan a man lo ciengin, “ Topa’ gamtat dan man lo hi,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Midihte amau’ dihna panin kinuale-in khielna a bawl uleh, khumi ziehin amate a si ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Migilote in a gitlona panun kinuale-in thuman le thutanga a gamtat uleh, khumi ziehin amate a hing ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Hizongle note in, “ Topa gamtat dan a man sih hi,” na ci uhi. Israel innkuonte aw, note zosie tungah na gamtatna uh tawh kituohin thu kang khen ding hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ka saltan sung uh kum sawm le ni kum, a hla sawmna, a ni nga ni-in Jerusalem pana ang suohta mi khat ka kungah ang pei a, “Khuopi pua ta,” ei ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tua galtai pa ang tun masang a nitahin ka tungah Topa’ khut ang om hi; hinanle zingmawngin ka kungah tua galtai pa ang tun hun tahin ama in ka kam ei honpieh zo ta hi; tuaci’n ka kam ang kihongin ham thei loin ka om nawn sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Topa’ thu ka kungah ang tung hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Mihing aw, Israel gam sunga tenna lo-a a kinuasie tam mun tenga a teng mite in, “Abraham mi khat beh hi napi-in ama in tam gambup na luo hi; eite tampi i hizaw vua, tami gam i luo ding vua ei kipie tahtah ahi hi,” a ci den uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin amate kungah Topa Pasien in tam bangin ci hi, ci-in gen in: Note in a si pumin sa na ne vua, na milimte uh ento-in sisan na luongsah uhi; tua ahile tam bangpi ma tawh gam na luo thei ding uh amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Note in na namsaute uh na suong vua, micin in na innvengte ciet uh’ zi na buasah uhi; tua ahile tam bangpi-in gam luo thei ding na hi uh amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Amate kungah Topa Pasien in tam bangin ci hi, ci-in tami thu gen in: Keima a hing ka hi ma bangin, koima’ tenna lo-a a kinuasie mun tenga om mite namsau-in a si valon ding uhi; tuale gamlahah a omte gamsate neh dingin ka pie ding a, mun muonhuoite le suonghawm sunga omte pen pulnatna tawh a si ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tua gam pen a kinuasie gamkhing ka suohsah ding a, ama’ kisahtheipi a thahatna a tawp sieng ding hi; Israel muolte gamdai luo ahi ziehin koima in a nawh kha nawn sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tua ciengin keima in a gam uh tenna lo gamkhing ka suosah ciengin a sil mudahuoi bawl zosie ziehun amate in keima Topa ka hi lam ei thei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Mihing aw, kawm gei le inn kotkhah tengah nang tungtang thu na gam mite khatlekhat a kiholim vua, a innvengte ciet uh kungah, “Hing pei unlen, Topa kung pana ang tung thu ngai va vui,” a kici uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Mite pei bangin amate zong ang pei-in ka mite bangin na mai-ah ang to uhi. Tuale na thute a ngai vua, ahi vangin amate in a mang sih ding uhi. Azieh pen a kampi utawh mi a pawh vua, ahi vangin a lungsim sung vuah amau’ nga nading beh a ngaisun uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Amate dingin nang pen a awngai mama, tumging khat hoitahin tumin zawllate a mau hiuhiau mipa khat tawh na kibang hi; amate in na thugente a zah bangun a zui tuom sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Tami thu ang tangtun ciengin- tuale ang tangtung ding hi! -tuaci’n amate in note lahah kamsang khat a om zo ahi lam ang thei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="34" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa’ thu ka kungah ang tung hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Mihing aw, Israel’ tuucingte langkhatah thu phuong in: Thu phuong inlen amate kungah-tuucingte kungah Topa Pasien in tam bangin ci hi, ci-in gen in: Noma le noma a kivah Israel tuucingte aw, gimna na thuoh ding uhi! Tuucingte in a tuute uh a vah ding hizaw lo amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Note in a thaute na ne vua, tuumul puonte silin a no thaute na go uhi; ahi vangin note in tuute lah na vah tuom sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Note in a thahat lote na hatsah sih vua, a cinate zong damsah loin, a liemte’ hima puonin na tunpieh sih vua, a lampielte hawikia loin, a mangte na sui sih vua, pauhat thawthu le thagum hatna tawh na uh zawsop uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuaci’n tuucing a op lo ziehin amate a kithethang sieng uhi; tuale a kithetang vua, gamsa zosiete’ an a suoh ta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ka tuute a kithethang sieng vua, muol le tangcin tengah a vahthap uhi; lei maitang mun zosie ah ka tuute kithethangin amate a sui ding le a hawi ding koima a om sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin no tuucingte aw, Topa’ thugen za un:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Keima a hing ka hi ma bangin, ka tuucingte in ka tuute a sui tah zawh sangin ka tuucingte amau le amau a kiva vua, ka tuute a va lo ziehun tuucing a om ta sih hi; tua ahi ziehin gamsate in ka tuute manin gamsa zosie’ an a suoh ta uhi, Topa Pasien in ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin no tuucingte aw, Topa’ kammal za un:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Topa Pasien in tam bangin ci hi: Keima tuucingte langkhatah ka pang ding hi; ka tuute amau’ khut sung panin ngenin a tuu a vahna uh panin amate ka khawlsah ding hi; tuucingte amau le amau a kivah nawn sih ding vua, amau’ an a suo lo nadingin a kam sung panun ka tuute ka hunkhie ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile Topa Pasien in tam bangin gen hi: Kei mama in ka tuute ka sui ding a, amate ka mukhie ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuucingte in a kithethang tuute lahah a tuuhonte a sui uh bangin, keima in ka tuute ka sui ding hi. Meiilum kai ni le khuomiel ni ciengin a kithezahna uh mun zosie panin amate ka hunkhie ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Mite lah panin amate ka ladawh ding a, gam tuomtuomte panin kaikhawmin amau’ gamah ka puoh ding hi. Keima in Israel muoltung, tui pulna gei le amau’ gam sunga mi tenna mun zosie ah amate ka vah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Lohing hoite tawh amate ka vah ding a, Israel muolsang cinteng pen amau’ an maina mun ahi ding hi; an maina mun hoi khatah amate lum ding a, Israel muolsang cinteng lohing tamna munah an a mai ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Kei mama ka tuute a cing pa ka hi ding a, amate ka lumsah ding hi, Topa Pasien in ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Keima in a mangte sui-in lampielte ka nuakai ding a, a liemte a hima ka tunpieh ding hi; keima in a thahat lote ka thahatsah ding a, ahi vangin a thaute le a thahatte ka susie ding hi. Keima in thutang tawh amate ka vah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />No ka tuute aw, Topa Pasien in note tawh kisai-in tam bangin ci hi: Keima in tuu le tuu kikal, tuutang le keeltangte kikalah thu ka khen ding hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Note lohing hoite tawh ang kiva a, hizongle a omlai na lohingte uh na keng utawh na totcil uh pen no adingin pha zo ta hi lo amah? Tuiciim na dawn uh ciengin a omlai teng na keng utawh niehsah hi lo na hi uh amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ka tuute in na keng utawh na totcilsate uh ne-in na keng utawh na totniehsa uh tuite dawn ding uh amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin Topa Pasien in amate kungah tam bangin gen hi: Kei mama in ka tuu thaute le ka tuu gawngte kikalah thu ka khen ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile note in na pang ule na liengko utawh a hatmaw ganta teng zosie sawnnawpin muncin tengah na thethang sieng masangun na ki utawh na pih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Keima in ka tuute ka hundam ding a, amate kibawlsie nawn lo ding hi. Keima in tuu le tuu kikalah thu ka khen ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Amate tungah a uh dingin tuucing khat, ka nasem pa David ka koi ding a, ama in amate a vah ding hi: Ama in amate vah ding a, amau’ tuucing pa hi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Keima Topa pen amau’ Pasien ka hi ding a, ka nasem pa David pen amate lahah a uhpa hi ding hi, keima, Topa in ka gensa ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Sing nei gam muolah amate tengin lungmuong taha a lup thei nadingun amate tawh kilemna thuciemna khat ka bawl ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Amate le ka muol kimvela muoltung gam teng thupha ngana ka hisah ding hi; tuale keima in a hun zui-in guotui ka zusah ding a, tuate pen thupha guotui hi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Lozau-a singkungte a ga a ga ding a, leitang in an tampitah piengsahin leitang tungah amate lungmuong tahin a om ding uhi. Keima in a kolnamte uh ka sattawng ding a, sala a khawite khut sung panin amate ka hutdam ciengin amate in keima Topa ka hi lam ei thei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Amate pen minamte in tomgamin amate a om nawn sih ding vua, tua gama ganhingte in amate a ne nawn sih ding hi; amate koima in zausah nawn loin hlamuong tahin a teng ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />A gam sung vuah amate a kielsi nawn lo nadingun amate adingin keima in um thupi khat ka bawlpieh ding a, minamte’ simmaw a thuoh nawn sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Amate in keima Topa a Pasien uh, amate tawh a omton ka hi lam ei thei ding vua, Israel innkuonte keima’ mi ahi uhi, Topa Pasien in ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />No ka tuute, ka lonona-a ka tuute na hi vua, kei pen na Pasien uh ka hi hi, Topa Pasien in ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="35" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa’ thu ka kungah ang tung hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Mihing aw, Sier Muol lam nga inlen ama langkhatah thu phuong in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Topa Pasien in tam bangin ci hi, ci-in ama kungah gen in: Sier Muol aw, nang kang langpang hi; a kinuasie gamkhing na suo nadingin nang langkhatah ka khut ka zah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Keima in na khuopite ka siesah ding hi; nang gamkhing na suoh ding a, tuale nangma in keima Topa ka hi lam nei thei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile nang in tanglai kigalneina na pom a, Israel mite in a nukhia pen dan a thuoh hun ule a tuosiet hun lai-un a thahat namsau-a tha dingin amate na pie hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />tua ahi ziehin Topa Pasien in a cina-ah, keima a hing ka hi ma bangin na sisan ka luongsah ding a, tua sisan in nang ang sulzui ding hi; nang in sisan luonsahna na muda lo ziehin sisan luonna in nang ang sulzui ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Keima in Seir Muol pen a kinuasie gamkhing ka suohsah ding a, khum sunga vaitung vaikuon zosie ka sumaimang ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Keima in a muoltung teng misi luong tawh ka dimsah ding hi; na muol na kuom le na tui pulna cintengah namsau-a kithatte a puamat ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Nang pen gamkhingin kang bawl peisuoh ding a, na khuopite ah mi teng ngai nawn lo ding hi. Tua ciengin keima Topa ka hi lam nei thei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile khum munah Topa a op nangawnin nang in, “Tami minam ni le tami gam ni tegel kei ading ahi a, tuate i luo dingin i la ding hi,” na ci a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />tua ahi ziehin keima a hing ka hi ma bangin, amate langkhatah na muda zieha na lah lungthahna le hazatna tawh kituohin keima in nangma tungah kang bawl ding hi, Topa Pasien in ci hi. Keima in na tungah thu kang khen ciengin note lahah kei le kei kang kitheisah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Nangma in, “Amate gamkhing a suoh ta vua, i nawmval dinga ei kipie ahi ta hi,” ci-in Israel muolte langkhatah simmawna kammal na gen zosiete, keima Topa in ka zah zo lam na thei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Nangma in keima langkhatah na kammalte na khan semsem a, keima langkhatah na thu na pop gen semsem hi; keima in tuate ka za zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Topa Pasien in tam bangin ci hi: Leitung bup a kipah ziehun keima in nang gamkhing kang suohsah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Israel innkuon’ gouluo gamkhing a kisuosahna tungah na lungdam ziehin, tua bangma-in nang tungah kang bawl ding hi; nangma le Seir Muol le Edom gam zosie na unpi-un gamkhing na suoh ding uhi. Tua ciengin keima Topa ka hi lam amate in ei thei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="36" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Nang mihing aw, Israel muol teng kungah thu phuong inlen tam bangin gen in: Israel muolte aw, Topa’ kammal za un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Topa Pasien in tam bangin ci hi: Na galte un note tungah, “Hiei lah! “Tanglai-a munsangte khu eite luo ding hi ta hi,” a ci vua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />tua ahi ziehin thu phuong inlen tam bangin gen in: Topa Pasien in tam bangin gen hi: A omlai minamte’ neisa na suo thei nadingun amate in note gamkhing ang suohsah vua, na ziet na vei vuah ang netcip ziehun, minamte lahah holim nopna le gensietin na om ta uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />tua ahi ziehin Israel muolte aw, Topa Pasien’ thugen za un: Topa Pasien in muol le tangte, tui pulnate le hawhguomte, a kinuasie gamkhingte, na kimvela minam omlai teng in bulu-in ciemmui nopna-a a neite uh tungah tam bangin a gen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin Topa Pasien in tam bangin ci hi: A lohing ziehin ka gam bulu-in kipah lungdamna le nahpi tahin simmawna tawh amau’ luo dingin a lah ziehun, keima in ka thangsiet luotna tawh a omlai minamte le Edom-te zosie tungah langpanna thu ka gen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin Israel gam tawh kisai-in thu phuong inlen, muol le tangte, tui pulnate le hawhguomte kungah Topa Pasien in tam bangin ci hi, ci-in gen in: Minamte’ hosiet thuoh zo na hi ziehun engsiet thangpaina tawh thu ka gen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin Topa Pasien in tam bangin ci hi: Na kimvel zosie vua om minamte in amau le amau in zakona a thuoh ding uhi, ci-in ka kiciem hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ahi vangin Israel muolte aw, no ka mi Israel adingin na bate uh zamin na ga ding uhi; azieh pen amate in inn ang zuon bai ta ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tu-in en un, no lamah kei ka pang hi; mite in nang pen loin kang hlosah ding a, khaici tuna-in kang neisah ding hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />tuale na mimal phaza uh kang pungsah ding a, Israel innkuon buppi a unpi-un ka pungsah ding hi; khuopite ah mi teng ding a, a kinuasiesa mun teng zong kilamkia ding hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />tuale note sungah a mihing a ganhingin kang pungsah ding hi. Amate pungin a cipha ding uhi; nidang lai bangma-in mi ten thei nadingin kang bawl ding a, na tung vuah nidang sangin sil hoi kang bawlzaw lai ding hi. Tua ciengin keima Topa ka hi lam note in nei thei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Note tungah ka mi Israel-te ka vahsah ding a, amate in note hing nei-in amau’ gou na hi ding uhi. Ta le nau nei loin amate na omsah nawn sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Topa Pasien in tam bangin ci hi: A zieh pen amate in na kungah, “Mite na nekhawng a, na mite ta le nau nei loin na koi ta hi,” ang ci vua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />tua ahi ziehin mi na nekhawng nawn sih ding a, na mite zong ta le nau nei loin na koi nawn sih ding hi, Topa Pasien in ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Minamte’ hosietnate kang zasah nawn sih ding a, mite’ simmaw nuoisie hing thuohsah loin na mite ka puasah nawn sih ding hi, Topa Pasien in ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Topa’ thu ka kungah ang tung hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Mihing aw, amau’ leitanga a ten lai-un Israel innkuonte in a gamtat a silbawlte utawh a gam uh a buasah uhi; keima muna-ah amau’ gamtatna pen a nin nei huna numei khat’ sientho lona tawh kibang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tuaci’n amate in gam sungah sisan a luonsahna ule milimte tawh a gam uh a buasah ziehun amate tungah ka thangpaina ka sunghla ding hi
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Minamte lahah amate ka thethang ding a, gamcin tengah a kithezah ding uhi; amau’ gamtatna le a silbawlte utawh kituohin amate tungah thu ka khen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Hizongle amate, minamte kungah a pei ciengun a peina popo vuah ka min siengtho a buasah vua, “Tamte Topa’ mite ahi vua, hinanle ama gam panin amate a peikhie uhi,” ci-in kigen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Hinanle Israel innkuonte in a tunna uh minamte lahah a buasah uh ka min siengtho ka lunghimawpi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin Israel innkuonte kungah Topa Pasien in tam bangin ci hi, ci-in gen in: Israel innkuonte aw, ka sil bawl ding pen note zieh hi loin, minamte kunga nang pei cieng vua na buasah uh ka min siengtho zieh ahi zaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Keima in minamte lahah na buasahsa uh a lien ka min ka siensuo ding a, note tungtawnin amate mai-ah ka sienthona ka lah ciengin, minamte in keima Topa ka hi lam ei thei ding uhi, Topa Pasien in ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Keima in minamte lahah note hing ladawhin gamcin teng panin kang kaikhawm ding a, na gam vuah kang peipi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Note tungah tuisieng kang the ding a, na buanate uh, na sientho lona zosie ule na milim zosie uh panin note na siengtho ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Keima in note lungtang tha kang pie ding a, note sungah hlagau tha kang guong ding hi; keima in na pum tung panun suong lungtang ladawhin tahsa lungtang kang pie ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Note sungah ka hlagau ka guong ding a, ka thukhamte hing zuisahin ka ngaina kipte pilvang tahin kang tangsah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tua ciengin na pu na pate uh kunga ka piehsa gam sungah na teng ding uhi; tuale note keima’ mi na hi ding vua, keima zong noma’ Pasien ka hi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Keima in na buana zosie uh panin hing hunin an le tuite thuta-in a kiningcingin kang omsah ding a, na tung vuah kiel ka tungsah sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Minamte lahah gilkiel mindaina na thuoh nawn lo nadingun singkungte ka gasah ding a, na lo vuah an ka niengsah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tua ciengin note in na gamtat hoi lote ule na silbawl uh a hoi lote na phawhkia ding uhi; tuale na khielna ule na sil mudahuoi bawlnate uh ziehin no le no na kikidah ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tami ka bawlna pen note zieh ahi lo lam kithei ta un, Topa Pasien in ci hi. Israel innkuonte aw, na gamtatnate ziehun maizum unlen patau un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Topa Pasien in tam bangin ci hi: Na khielna zosie uh panin kang siensuo ni ciengin na khuopite vuah mi tengkia-in a kinuasiesa munte kilampha ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />A nawhkha mi zosie’ muna-ah gamkhing ahi ngai vangin tua gamkhing loin kihlo ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Amate in, “Tami gamkhing Eden um tawh kibang ta hi; tu-in a kinuasiesa gamkhing le a kisiesa khuopite tenna-in kinei-in kulpite tawh ki-im ta hi,” ci ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Tua ciengin na kimvel vua a kinuasie minamte in, keima Topa in a kisiesa khuopi lamphakia-in gamkhingte a hlosahkia pa ka hi lam a thei ding uhi. Keima, Topa in ka gensa ahi a, ka sem ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Topa Pasien in tam bangin ci hi: A mimal uh tuuhon banga a pun nadingin, amate adinga tami zong ka bawlpieh nadingin Israel innkuonte in keima kungah ka ngensah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />A kisiesa khuopite ahile biehpiehna dinga a kitawi tuuhonte bang le a kisesa pawi hun cienga Jerusalem-a a kipie tuuhonte bangin mihonpi tawh kidim ding hi. Tua ciengin amate in keima Topa ka hi lam ei thei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="37" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa’ khut ka tungah ang om a, Topa’ hlagau tawh ama in ei peipi-in kuom laikimah ei tutsuh hi; tua kuom pen misi gute tawh kidim hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ama in tua kimvel tengah ei peipi kawikawi hi; tua kuom sungah gu le tang tampitah om leulo a, tua gute gawta thei mama hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ama in keima kungah, “Mihing aw, tami gute a hing thei diei mah? ei ci hi. Keima in, “ Topa Pasien aw, nangma in na thei hi,” ci-in ka dawng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tua ciengin ama in keima kungah, “Tami gute tungah thu phuong inlen amate kungah, “A gawta gute aw, Topa’ kammal za un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Topa Pasien in tami gute kungah tam bangin a gen hi: Note sungah naahu hing lutsahin note na hing ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Note tungah thagui koi-in na tung vuah tel le vo kang omsah ding a, vun in kang tuomsah ding hi. Note sungah naahu koi-in na hing ding uhi; tuaci’n keima Topa ka hi lam note in nei thei ding uhi,” ei ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuaci’n kei in zong ei kisawl bangin thu ka phuong hi; ka thu phuon ka gen hun sungin sil kigawi valuoi ging khat ka za a, tuale husa khat thakhatin ang omin, tuale gute in amau’ gu ciet ang zuon uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Keima in ka en leh amate tungah thagui ang om a, satel ang omkia-in vun in tuate ang tuom hi; hizongle amau’ sungah naahu om nai lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tua ciengin ama in keima kungah, “Mihing aw, naahu tungah thu phuong in, thu phuong inlen naahu kungah tam bangin gen in: Topa Pasien in tam bangin ci hi: Naahu aw, hui ningli panin hing pei-inlen amate a hin thei nadingin tam mi kithatte tungah na hu sang in,” ei ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ama’ ei sawl bangin thu ka phuong a, amate sungah naahu lutin ang hing vua, a keng utawh ang din ciengun a hon tampitah ang pha uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tua ciengin ama in keima kungah, “Mihing aw, tami gute pen Israel innkuon buppi ahi uhi. Amate in, ‘Ka gute uh a gawta sieng ta a, ka kinepna uh om nawn loin ei kisumaimang ta hi,’ a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin nang in thu phuong inlen, Topa Pasien in tam bangin ci hi, ci-in amate kungah gen in: Ka mite aw, na hankhuhte uh hongin na hankhuh panun note kang lakhie to ding hi; tuale keima in note Israel gamah kang peipikia ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ka mite aw, na hankhuhte uh hongin na hankhuhte panun note kang lahkhiet to ciengin note in keima Topa ka hi lam nei thei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Note sungah ka hlagau guongin na hing ding vua, keima in na leitang vuah note kang koikia ding hi; tua ciengin ka gensa ahi a, ka bawl ding hi, a ci keima Topa ka hi lam note in nei thei ding uhi,” Topa in ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Topa’ thu ka kungah ang tung hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Mihing aw, cieng khat la inlen tua tungah, “Judah le a kipawlpi Israel-te ading,” ci-in giel in; tua ciengin cieng adang khat la leuleu inlen tua tungah, “Joseph (Ephraim’ cieng) le a kipawlpi Israel innkuon zosie ading,” ci-in giel in;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />na khut sungah tua tegel cieng khat a suo thei nadingin cieng khat tungah a khat zom in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tuale na mite in na kungah, “Tamte bang na cinopna ahei, kote ei gen lo ding na mah?” ang ci ciengun,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />nangma in amate kungah Topa Pasien in tam bangin ci hi, ci-in gen in: Keima in Joseph’ cieng (Ephraim khut sunga om) le a kipawlpi Israel minamte’ cieng ka la ding a, ka khut sungah ama gel khat a suo thei nadingin tua tungah Judah cieng ka koi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Amate muna-ah a tunga lai na giel ciengte na khut sungah ang op ciengin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />amate kungah Topa Pasien in tam bangin ci hi, ci-in gen in: Keima in amate peina minamte lahah Israel mite ladawhin ka peipi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Keima in gamsung Israel muoltung tengah amate minam khatin ka bawl ding hi; tuale amate zosie tungah kumpi khat in a uh ding hi. Amate minam ni ahi ngai nawn sih ding vua, kumpi gam ni-in zong a kikhen ngai nawn sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />A milimte ule a sil mudahuoite utawh ahi a, a tatkhielnate utawh ahi zongin amate kibuasah ngai nawn lo ding hi. Amate a nuatolna ziehun amau’ puana panin keima in hundamin ka siensuo ding hi. Tua ciengin amate keima’ mite hi ding a, kei, amau’ Pasien ka hi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Amate tungah ka nasempa David in kumpi sem ding hi; tuale amate in a unpi-un tuucing khat nei ding uhi. Amate in ka ngaina kipte zui-in ka thukhamte zong limtahin a tang ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Keima in ka nasempa Jacob ka piehsa na pu na pate uh’ tenna gamah amate a teng ding uhi; khum munah amate le a tate ule a tute uh a teng zing ta ding uhi; tuale ka nasempa David in amate a uh zing ta ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Keima in amate tawh kilemna thuciemna ka bawl ding hi; tua pen amate tawh ka bawl kumtawn thuciemna hi ding hi. Keima in amate thupha pie-in ka pungsah ding a, amate lahah kumtawnin ka mun siengtho ka koi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Amate tawh ka tenna mun a omton ding hi; kei amau’ Pasien ka hi ding a, amate keima’ mi ahi ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tua ciengin amate lahah kumtawnin ka mun siengtho a op ciengin keima Israel a siensuo Topa ka hi lam amate in ei thei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="38" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa’ thu ka kungah ang tung hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Mihing aw, Magog gam sunga Meshech le Tubal uhpipa Gog lam nga inlen ama langkhatah thu phuong in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Topa Pasien in tam bangin ci hi, ci-in gen in: Meshech le Tubal’ uhpipa Gog aw, nang kang langpang hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />keima in na khagu ah siakawi bulin kang lehei ding a, a unpi-un galvan a sil na galkapte zosie, na sakolte, sakol tung tuong siemte, a unpi-un lum le phaw le namsau tawi mi honpite tawh kang peipi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Amate tawh Persia, Ethiopia, le Put-te a kipawl vua, a unpi-un lum le phaw tawh ahi uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Gomer le a galkap zosie, a gamla pen leilu lama a om Beth-togarmah le a galkapte zosiete tawh mi tampite in nang ang pawl uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Nangma le na kimvela ang ki khawm mihonpi zosie, kiging unlen a baisa-in om unlen amate cingin pang in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ni tampi zaw ciengin note ang kikhawmkia ding hi; sawt veipi lai-a gamkhing a suohsa, Israel muolte tunga om minamte pana kikaikhawm, gal sunga a suohtate’ gam khat kum tampi zaw ciengin na va sim ta ding hi; a mite pen minamte pana kipeipi ahi a, tu-in amate a unpi-un lungmuong tahin a teng uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Huipi lang bangin na kuon ding a, nangma le na galkap zosie, le nangma tawh a omton mi tampite, gam sung a tuom meii tawh na kibang ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Topa Pasien in tam bangin gen hi: Khum ni ciengin na lungsim ah ngaisutna khat ang suoh ding a, a hoi lo gelna khat na sawm ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Nangma in, “Kulpi a nei lo khuote opna gam khat sim dingin ka kuonto ding hi; lungmuong taha a om hit hiet, a unpi-un kulpi, tunkotgol le tunkot a nei lo mite tungah ka tusuh ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A nei a lamte uh tomgamin ka puomang ding hi; tu-in mite tenna ahi a kinuasiesa munte, le minam tuomtuomte tung pan kaikhawmin ganhing le neisa a hau leitung laikimah a tengte ka sim ding hi,” na ci ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Sheba, Dedan, Tarshish sumbawlte le tangval galhangte zosie in nangma kungah, “Van lahpieh dinga ang kuon na hi uh amah? Vante puo ding le ngun le kham puomang ding, ganhonte le vante puo ding, van a tampitah tomgam dingin na mihonte na khawmtuo zo ta amah?” ang ci ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin mihing aw, thu phuong inlen Gog kungah Topa Pasien in tam bangin ci hi, ci-in gen in: Khum ni ciengin ka mi Israel-te lungmuong tahin a ten ciengun nang le nang na kisatsuo ding a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />leilu lam a gamla pen na opna mun panin nang le mi tampite, a unpi-un sakol tunga tuong a thahat galkap hon tampite tawh na kuon ding hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />tuale meiipi in leitung a tuom bangin ka mi Israel-te sim dingin nang kuonto ding hi. Hun nukhia lam ciengin ka gamsung sim dingin kang peipi ding a, tuaci’n Gog aw, minamte in nang tungtawnin kei ei thei uh ciengin amate muna-ah ka sienthona ka lah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Topa Pasien in tam bangin gen hi. Nidang lai pana ka nasem Israel kamsangte kungah ka gensa, amate do dingin kang sawl ding hi, ci-in nidang lai kum tampi sung ka na phuongzahsah pa khu nang na hi amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Khum ni ciengin Israel gam sim dingin Gog ang kuon ciengin ka thangpaina a kuong ding hi, Topa Pasien in ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Azieh pen ka thangsiet zieh le ka sin a so ziehin tam bangin ka genzah ding hi: Khum ni ciengin Israel gam sungah zil nahpi tahin ling ding hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />tuipi sunga ngate, vana leng vate, gamlaha ganhingte, tuola a kithol ganhingte, le leitunga a om mi zosie ka mai-ah a citun ding vua, muol sangte pua-in kentawngte cim ding a, kul zosie tuol ah a puamat ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Keima in muolsang zosie sungah Gog tawh a kido dingin namsau ka ko ding hi, Topa Pasien in ci hi; tuale mi zosie’ namsau in amau’ kithuopite a do ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Keima in pulnatna le sisan luonna tawh ama tungah thukhenna ka nei ding hi; ama le a galkapte tung le ama tawh a omton mi tampite tungah guopi gielpite le kaat le meikuongte ka zusah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tuaci’n keima in ka lietna le ka sienthona ka lah ding a, minam tampite’ mitmu-in keima le keima ka kilah ding hi. Tua ciengin amate in keima Topa ka hi lam ei thei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="39" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuale mihing aw, Gog langkhat ah thu phuong inlen, Topa Pasien in tam bangin ci hi, ci-in gen in: Meshech le Tubal’ uhpipa Gog aw, nang kang langpan hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Keima in nang hing kiheisahin mailam nawhin kang notmang ding a, leilu lam gammong pen panin hing peipito-in Israel muolte do dingin kang pui ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Na veilam khuta na tawi na thalpi kang behpieh ding a, na zietlam khuta na tawi na thaltangte ka kiesah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Israel muoltung tengah nangma le na galkapte zosie le nangma tawh ang omton na mite a puamat sieng ding uhi; keima in sasiel ne va namcin le gamsate nehtum dingin nang kang pie ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Gamlahah note na puamat ding uhi; azieh pen ka gensa ahi hi, Topa Pasien in ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Keima in Magog le tuipi gei-a lungmuong taha a tengte tungah meikuong ka sawl ding a, tuaci’n amate in keima Topa ka hi lam ei thei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Keima’ mi Israel-te lahah ka min siengtho ka kitheisah ding a, ka min siengtho ka buasah ngai nawn sih ding hi; tuale minamte in Israel sunga a Siengtho Topa , ka hi lam ei thei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tua hun ang tung ta hi! Tua hun ang pieng ta hi, Topa Pasien in ci hi. Ka gensa khu tami ni ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tua ciengin Israel khuopite sunga a tengte kuonkhie ding a, a galvante uh- lum le phawte, thal le thaltangte, cienghiemte le teipite - kum sagi sung mei-ah vangin a haltum ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Gamlah ah singtom kul loin gammang lahah sing phua ding zong a kisam sih ding uhi, azieh pen amate in a galvante uh mei-in a taw ding uhi; amate a susiete susie-in, amau’ na a lahpiehte’ na a lahpieh ding uhi, Topa Pasien in ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Khum ni ciengin Israel gam sung tuipi nisuona lama Khuolzinte Kuom a kici munah Gog a kivui nading mun ka pie ding hi; tua in khuolzinte lampi khahtan ding hi, azieh pen khumnah Gog le a mihonte zosie kivui ding hi; khum mun pen Hamon-gog Kuom kici ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Israel innkuonte in a gamsung uh a siensuo nadingun hla sagi sung amate vui ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Gam sunga a om mi zosie in amate vui ding uhi; keima in ka minthanna ka lah ni ciengin amate in tua ziehin patawina a nga ding uhi, Topa Pasien in ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Amate in gamsung tenga a vah kawikawi ding mi a tuomkoi ding vua, gamsung a siengtho nadingin leitang tunga a omlai gamkeh mite’ luong khat popo a vui ding uhi; amate in hla sagi sung a sui ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Misuite a gam sungah vah kawikawi-in khat penpen in misi gu khat a mu leh mi sivuite in Hamon-gog Kuomah a vui masangin a gei-ah ciemtena khat a phut ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />(Khum munah Hamonah khuopi zong a om hi.) Khum bangin amate in a gam sung uh a siensuo ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Mihing aw, nangma tawh kisai-in Topa Pasien in tam bangin gen hi: Va namcin le gamsa zosie kungah tam bangin gen in: Hing kikhawm unlen hing pei un. Israel muolte tungah note adinga ka bawl biehpiehna pawi lienpi sim dingin na kimvel zosie panun ang kisutuo-in note in a sa ne-in a si na dawn ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Note in mi thahatte’ sa na ne ding vua, leitung gam uhte’ sisan- tuutangte, tuunote, keelte le bawngtangte’ sisan na dawn ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Note dinga kang bawlpieh kithoina pawi ah na gilva dongun a thaute na ne ding vua, na kham masangsie-un sisante na dawn ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tuale note in ka sabuoi tungah sakolte le sakol tung tuong siemte, galhangte le galkap namcinte tawh khamtahin na ne ding uhi, Topa Pasien in ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Keima in minamte lahah ka vang lietna ka kilangsah ding hi; minamte zosie in amate tungah ka khut ngamin ka thukhenna a mu ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Khum ni-a kipanin Israel innkuonte in keima Topa Pasien ka hi lam ei thei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Israel innkuonte in keima tungah muonhuoi lo tahin ei bawl zieh ule amau’ khielna ziehin minamte in amate sala kikai ahi lam a thei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Keima in amau’ sientho lona le a khielnate utawh kituohin amate ka thuohsah a, amate kung panin ka mai ka phuol hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin Topa Pasien in tam bangin gen hi: Tu-in keima in Jacob’ vangphatnate ka piekia ding a, Israel innkuon zosie hepi-in ka min siengtho adingin ka laina ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />A gam sung vuah lungmuong tahin tengin koima in amate a zausah nawn lo hun ciengin keima ei do nadinga amau’ gamtatnate ahi keima ei lebawlna zosie ule amau’ maizumnate a mangngil ta ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Minamte lah panin amate ka peipikia a, a galte uh’ gam panin ka kaikhop lai-in keima in amau’ tungtawnin minam tampite mai-ah ka sienthona ka kilangsah zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tua ciengin minamte lahah saltang dingin amate ka sawl zieh le, tua ciengin amau’ gamah ka khoptuokia ziehin keima Topa Pasien ka hi lam amate in ei thei ding uhi. Keima in amate khat beh ka nuasie sih ding hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />tuale keima in Israel innkuon tungah ka hlagau ka buohsuh ciengin amate kung panin ka mai ka phuol ngai nawn sih ding hi, Topa Pasien in ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="40" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Khuopi a kisuhsiet zaw a kum sawm le lina kum, ka saltan zaw uh a kum sawmni le ngana kum kipat cil tua hla a ni sawmni, khum ni lien ma-in keima tungah Topa’ khut ang om a, ama in khum sungah keima ei peipi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ama in Pasien’ mangmuna ziehin Israel gam ei tutin muolsang mama tung khatah ei koi hi. Khum muolsang’ leitaw lamah khuopi tawh kibang khat a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ama in khum sungah ei tut ciengin a mel puohdan sumngo-a kisiem tawh a kibang pasal khat na om a, ama in a khut sungah pikhau khat le picieng khat a tawi hi; tuale tunkot lutna lampi-ah ama na ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tua pa in keima kungah, “Mihing aw, hoi tahin enin limtahin ngai inlen, keima in kang lah ding zosie na lungsim sungah koi in, azieh pen tami thu nangma kunga kang lah thei nadinga tam sunga kang peipi ahi hi,” ei ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Biehinnpi huong a pulam kimvel zosie ah kulpi a om hi. Tua mi pa’ khuta a tawi picieng pen tong guh sau a, a tena khat ta pen tong khat le zabeh sau hi; tuaci’n ama in kulpi te a, kulpi a sana picieng tan khat pha a, picieng khat ma sang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tua ciengin nisuona lam a kinga tunkot lutna lampi ah lutin a kaleite ah kato a, tunkot lutna a te leh picieng tan khat a pha hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuanah inndante om a, inndan khat a vailam picieng khat cie pha a, a dunglam zong picieng khat cie ma pha hi; inndante kikal tong nga kihal hi; tuale a sungtawng talaap gei-a a om tunkot vang pen picieng khat cie pha hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tua ciengin ama in tunkot lutna talaap a sung lam a te leh tong khat pha hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tua ciengin ama in tunkot lutna talaap te a, tong giet pha-in a khuomte tong ni sa hi; tuale tunkot talaap pen a sung tawng lamah a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Nisuona lam tunkot pang tuohah inndan thum tuoh om hi; a thumin a golna kikimin a kikala khuomte zong a golna kibang ciet hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tua ciengin lutna tunkot a vang laitah a te leh tong sawm pha hi; tuale tunkot vailam pen tong sawm le thum pha hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Inndante’ mai ah thaw kikai a, alang ni-in tong khat tuoh ahi hi; alangni-a inndante zong tong guh ciet pha hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tua ciengin ama in inndan nualam panin adang inndan nualam dongin tunkot a te leh a kawm khat panin a kawm khat dong a golna tong sawmni le nga pha hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ama in talaap zong te a, tong sawmni a pha hi; tuale ama in inntuol pang zosie-a om tunkot khuompi bana tunkot zong a te hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tunkot lutna mai panin a sunglam tunkot talaap sungnung dong tong sawmnga ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Inndante le a khuomte in tawlette nei a, tunkot lutna lampi in a sung lam kimvelah a vang neute nei hi; tuale talaapte in zong a sunglam kimvel zosie ah tawlette nei a, khuomte tungah lutu kung lim kizem hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tua ciengin ama in leituol pulam ah ei peipi hi; tua sungah inndante le leituol kimvelah suongpha na om hi; tuale inndan sawmthumte in tua suongpha tung lam a kinga uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tua suongpha pen tunkot pang tengah tunkot dung tantan a kipha ahi a, tam pen suongpha neinung pen ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tua ciengin tunkot neinung a sunglam mai panin leituol sungnung pulam mai dong a gamlatna a te leh tong zakhat a pha hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tua ciengin ama in leilu lam kinga a pulam leituol peina tunkot adung avai te hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />A pang tuohah inndan thum tuoh om a, a khuomte le a talaap a gol dan pen amasa tunkot tawh kikim hi; adung tong sawmnga pha a, avai tong sawmni le nga pha hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />A tawlette, a talaap, le a lutu kungte a gol dan pen nisuona lam kinga tunkotte tawh kikim hi. Tua tunkot kato nadingin ciel sagi a nei kalei khat kidaw a, a sungah a talaap a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Nisuona lama ma bangin, leilu lama tunkot tawh kigalsai-ah leituol sungnung lutna tunkot a om hi; ama in tunkot khatlekhat kikal a te leh tong zakhat pha hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tua ciengin ama in leitaw lam manaw-in ei peipi a, leitaw lamah tunkot khat na om hi; ama in a khuomte le a talaap a te leh a gol dan pen tunkot dangte tawh kikim hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Adangte ah tawlet a op ma bangin a sung kimvel le a talaap sung lamah tawlette om hi; adung tong sawmnga pha a, avai tong sawmni le nga pha hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tua tunkot kato nadingin ciel sagi a nei kalei khat kidaw a, a sungah a talaap a om hi. A langkhat tuohah lutu kunga kizem khuom khat tuoh a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Leituol sungnung leitaw lamah tunkot khat om hi; tunkotte kikal a te leh tong zakhat pha hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tua ciengin ama in leitaw lam tunkot gei-a om leituol sungnung lamah ei peipi a, leitaw lam tunkot a te hi; a gol dan pen adangte ma tawh kikim hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />A inndante, a khuomte, le a talaapte pen adangte tawh a golna kikim hi; tuale a sung kimvel le a talaap sungah tawlette a om hi; adung tong sawmnga pha a, avai tong sawmni le nga pha hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />A kimvelah talaapte om a, adung tong sawmni le nga pha a, avai tong nga pha hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />A talaap pen leituol pulam kinga a, a khuomte tungah lutu kungte omin a kalei in ciel giet nei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tua ciengin ama in nisuona lam panga a om leituol sungnung lamah ei peipi a, tunkot a te hi; a gol dan pen adangte ma tawh kikim hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />A inndante, a khuomte, le a talaapte a gol dan a dangte ma bang ahi hi; a sung kimvel le a talaap sungah tawlette a om hi; adung tong sawmnga pha a, avai tong sawmni le nga pha hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />A talaap pen leituol pulam kinga a, alang tuoha a om khuom khat tuohah lutu kung tawh kizem a, a kalei in ciel giet nei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Tua ciengin ama in leilu lam tunkotah ei peipi a, tuale ama in te hi; a gol dan pen adangte tawh kikim hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />A inndante, a khuomte, le a talaap pen a gol dan adangte ma tawh kikim hi; a kimvelah tawlette om hi. Adung tong sawmnga hi a, avai tong sawmni le nga ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />A talaap pen tunkot pulam kinga a, alang tuohah khuom khat tuoh om hi; tuate lutu kung limin kizem hi. A kalei in ciel giet nei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Tunkot talaap ah kot nei inndan khat om a, khum mun pen meihal biehnate a kisawpsiengna mun ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Tunkot talaap sunga a pang tuohah sabuoi ni tuoh om a, tuate tungah meihal biehna, mawna zieha biehna, le khielna zieha biehna ding ganhingte kigo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Leilu lam tunkot lutna talaap pulamah sabuoi ni om hi; talaap tunkot langkhatah zong sabuoi ni ma om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Tunkot sung lamah sabuoi li om a, tunkot pang a pulamah zong sabuoi li ma omin a unpi-in giet ahi a, tamte tungah biehpiehna dingte kigo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Meihal biehna lui nadingin suong kisui sabuoi li om a, tuate adung avai tong khat le alang tuoh ahi a, a sanna tong khat ahi hi. Khumte tungah meihal biehna le biehpiehnate a kigaw cienga zah ding vanzahte kikoi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />A sung kimvel zosie-ah zabeh cie a sau siakawite kibul a, sabuoite tungah biehna ding sa kikoi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Tunkot sunglam lutna lampi tung leituol sungnungah lasate ading inndante om a, khat pen leitaw lam kinga leilu lam tunkot pangah om a, adang khat pen leilu lam kinga nisuona lam tunkot pangah a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Ama in ka kungah, “Leitaw lam kinga tami inndan pen biehinn sunga nasem siempute ading ahi a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />tuale leilu lam kinga inndan pen maitam tunga na a sem siempute ading ahi hi; tam teng pen Zadok’ suonlehlahte ahi vua, Levi suonlehlahte lahah amate beh in ama’ na a sem dingin Topa kung a nai thei uhi,” ei ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Ama in leituol te a, adung tong zakhat pha a, avai zong tong zakhat ma pha a, a kikim ningli a nei hi; tuale biehinnpi mai lamah maitam a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Tua ciengin ama in biehinnpi talaap lamah ei peipi a, talaap’ khuom te a te leh a pang tuoh tong nga pha a, tunkot avai tong sawm le li hi a, tunkot pang tuoha kawm kigette a lang ni-in tong thum tuoh pha hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Talaap adung tong sawmni pha a, avai tong sawm le ni pha hi; tua tunga kato nadingin kalei ciel sawm kidaw hi; a pang tuoha tunkot khuomte kikalah khuomte kiphut hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="41" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tua ciengin ama in biehinn laikimah ei peipi a, a khuomte a te hi; a pang tuoh gela khuomte a vailam tong guh tuoh a pha hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A lutna avai tong sawm ahi hi; a lutna pang tuoha om kawmte tong nga ahi hi. Ama in biehinn laikim a te leh adung tong sawmli pha a, avai tong sawmni pha hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tua ciengin inndan sungnungah ama lutin a lutna khuomte te a, tong ni pha hi; tuale a lutna avai tong sagi pha hi; tuale a pang tuoha om kawmte tong sagi a pha hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ama in a inndan te a, biehinn laikim teng kihal loin, adung avai tong sawmni tuoh a pha hi. Tuale ama in keima kungah tami siengtho pen mun ahi hi, ei ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tua ciengin ama in biehinnpi kawm te a, tong guh sa hi; tuale biehinnpi kimvela om a panga inndante avai tong li pha hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />A panga innkhante dawl thum pha a, khat tungah khat kikhangin dawl khatah innkhan neu sawmthum om hi. Biehinnpi kawm ah tua inndante a kingap lo nadingin biehinnpi kawm kimvel tengah a nanna zawlte om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A panga inndan peina lampi pen dawl khat zaw dawl khat zai tehteh hi; bangzieh ahei cile tua inn pen biehinnpi kimvel tengah kalei kidawpieh ahi hi. Tami zieha dawl khat zaw dawl khat gol tehteh ahi hi. A dawl neinung pen panin a dawl tungnung pen dongah a laita pen dawl panin kikato hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Biehinnpi in a kimvel tengah mun kidawsang a nei ka mu hi; a panga inndante’ zungpi a te leh tong guh a sau cieng tan khat a pha hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />A panga inndan kawm a sana tong nga pha hi; tuale inndante a pulam kawm pen tong nga sa hi; tuale biehinnpi’ inndante kikal mun-awng om a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />tuale biehinnpi kimvela a pang zosie-a om leituol inndante kikala a om mun-awng pen avai tong sawmni a pha hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />A panga inndante adingin mun-awng a tung zawnah peina lampi kihong a, khat leilu lam, khat leitaw lam kinga hi; a kimvela mun-awng teng avai tong nga pha hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Nitumna lam panga biehinnpi huong lam a kinga innpi pen avai tong sawm sagi pha hi; tua innpi kimvela innpi kawm tong nga sa a, adung tong sawmkuo sau hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tua ciengin ama in biehinnpi a te leh tong zakhat sau a, a innpi kawm pumin a innhuong sung tong zakhat ma sau hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />nisuona lam panga biehinnpi le a huong zong avai tong zakhat a pha hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tua ciengin ama in nitumna lama tuol lam a kinga innpi pen adung lam te a, a pang tuoha a lamneu pumin tong zakhat pha hi. Biehinnpi laikim inndan sungnung le talaap pulam teng
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />singpeh tawh kidap a, a kimvelah tawlet neu thum a om hi. Sangkil lam mai ngatin biehinnpi kimvelin tuong panin tawlet dongin (tu-in tawlette a kituom ahi hi) singpeh tawh kidap a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />kotpi tunga mun-awng dong, inndan sungnung le a pulam dong nangawnin kidap hi. Tuale inndan sung kimvela kawm zosie tung le tua sunga biehinn laikimte zong kizem ciet hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tua pen Cherub-te le lutu kung lim tawh kikheng a, cherub khatlekhat kikalah lutu kung khat ki-omsah hi. Cherub khat in maitang ni nei hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Lang khat a mihing’ maitang pen lutu kung lam kinga a, alang khatah humpi a no’ maitang pen lutu kung lam ma kinga hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tuong tung panin a kot tungnung munte dongin kawm tungah cherub-te le lutu kungte kikheng suoh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Biehinn laikima a om kotkhuomte in ning li nei uhi. Mun siengtho mai-ah
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />sing maitam tawh a kibang pien khat om a, a sanna tong thum, adung tong ni, avai tong ni pha hi. A ningte, a tunnate, le a kawmte sing tawh kibawl hi. Ama in keima kungah, “Tam pen Topa mai-a kipha sabuoi ahi hi,” ei ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Biehinn laikim teng le mun siengtho in kotkhah thuop ni tuoh nei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Kotpite singpeh ni kisutuo hi a, kotpi khatah a kivei thei singpeh ni ta kithuo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Kawm tung tengah cherub-te le lutu kungte a kikhuoh bangin a kawmte tungah zong kikhuoh hi; tuale a pulam talaap mai-ah sing tawh a kibawl a tungkhu khat a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tuale talaap kawmpangte tungah tawlet neute le lutu kungte a om hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="42" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tua ciengin ama in leilu lam zuonin leituol pulamah ei pui a, biehinnpi tuol le leilu lam panga a om inn tawh a kigalsai inndante sungah ei peipi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Leilu lam pang innpi adung pen tong zakhat hi a, avai tong sawmnga ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Leituol a sungnung pen tong sawmni pha a, a pulam leituol pen suongpha lam kinga hi. Lamneu khat tunga lamneu khatah inndante kitawito-in dawl thum a pha hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tua inndante mai-ah innsung lam zotna lampi khat om a, tong sawm golin tong zakhat thuh a, a lutnate leilu lamah om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tu-in inndan tungnungte kuocih zawdeu hi, azieh pen lamneute in inn sungah inndan neita le inndan laita-te sangin mun tam lazaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile tuate dawl thum tah ahi a, leituol pulam khuomte bangin khuom a nei sih uhi; tam ziehin a inndan tungta pen, inndan neita pen, le inndan laita pen sangin tuol panin kikhawzang zawdeu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Inndante tawh kitangin leituol pulam kinga a, inndante tawh a kigalsai a pulam kawm khat om a, tong sawmnga sau hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Leituol pulama inndante tong sawmnga sau a, biehinnpi tawh a kigalsaite tong zakhat sau hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Leituol pulam panin tami inndante nei-a nisuona lamah mihing lut nadingin lutna khat a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Khum lampi avai pen leituol’ kawm sana zaza ahi hi. Leitaw lamah zong mun-awng teng le innpi tawh a kigalsai-in inndante om a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />a mai-ah lampi khat om hi; tuate leilu lama inndante tawh kibang a, adung avai kikim cietin pusuonate, a kiguoldante le a kotpite zong kibang ciet hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuaci’n leitaw lam inndeite pen kotkhahte tawh kibang hi. Pusuona lampi bulah nisuona lam pang kawm pei pen tawh a kibangin kotkhah khat om a, tua panin inndeite ah kilut hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tua ciengin ama in ka kungah, “Mun-awng tawh a kigalsai leilu lam inndante le leitaw lam inndante pen inndan siengtho ahi a, tua sungah Topa kung a nai siempute in a siengtho pen biehnate ne ding uhi; amate in tua sungah an tawh biehnate, mawna zieha biehnate, le khielna zieha biehnate a khol ding uhi, azieh pen tua mun a siengtho hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Siengtho munah siempute a lut ciengun a nasep puonsilte uh koi loin leituol pulamah pusuoh lo ding uhi, bangzieh ahei cile a puonsilte uh sieng tho hi; mipite op nading munah a pei masangun amate in puon adang sil ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ama in biehinnpi sunglam teng a te zaw ciengin nisuona lam a kinga tunkotah ei peipi a, biehinnpi a kimvel zosie a te hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ama in nisuona lam pang a te leh piciengin tong zanga pha hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tua ciengin kihei-in leitaw lam pang a te leh piciengin tong zanga ma a pha hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tua ciengin kihei-in leitaw lam a te leh piciengin tong zanga ma a pha hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tua ciengin kihei-in nitumna a te leh piciengin tong zanga a pha hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ama in a pang li teng te hi. A kimvelin kawm kiget a, adunglam tong zanga pha a, avai lam tong zanga ma a pha hi. Tam kawm in mun siengtho le mipi opna a tuomin a khen hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="43" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tua ciengin ama in nisuona lam a kinga tunkot ah ei peipi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Khum munah nisuona lam panin Israel Pasien’ minthanna vang ang pei hi; a awging pen tuipi ging tawh kibang a, leitung zong ama’ minthanna vang in a tanvah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ka mu mangmuna pen ama khuopi susie dinga ang pei lai-a ka musa mangmuna tawh kibang a, tuale Chebar gun gei-a ka mu mangmuna tawh kibang hi; kei zong ka khupbawhsuh pai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Nisuona lam a kinga tunkot lam tawnin Topa’ minthanna vang ang lut ciengin
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />hlagau in kei ei domto a, tuale leituol sungnungah ei peipi hi; tuale Topa’ minthanna vang biehinnpi sung a dim hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ka gei-ah tua mipa ang din laitahin biehinnpi panin mi khat in keima ei hopina ka za hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ama in ka kungah, “Mihing aw, tami ka kumpi tona mun le ka ketaw ngahna mun ahi hi. Tam mun pen Israel mite lahah ka ten den nading mun ahi hi. Israel innkuonte, amate le a kumpite’ pahtatnate le a sisa a kumpite’ luonghawmte in ka min siengtho a buasah nawn sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Amate in ka sangkil gei-ah amau’ sangkil a koi vua, amau’ kotpi khuomte keima’ kotpi khuom gei-ah phutin keima le amate kikalah kawm khat beh in ei hal a, amate in sil mudahuoi a bawlte uh ziehin ka min siengtho a buasah uhi; tua ahi ziehin ka lungthahna tawh amate ka susie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tu-in amate in a milim biehnate uh paimang uh hinlen, a kumpite uh’ luonghawmte kei tawh kigamlasah uheh, tua hile amate lahah kumtawnin ka teng ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Mihing aw, Israel innkuonte kung ah biehinnpi thu gen in, biehinnpi lim tesah in; tuale a khielnate uh ziehin amate maizumsah in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />A gamtatna zosie uh ziehin amate a maizum ciengun, biehinnpi a kigel dan, a kiguol dan, lutna le pusuona, a piendan zosie, a ngaina kip zosie, gelna zosie le a thukhamte zosie, amate theisah in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tami pen biehinnpi tawh kisai thukham ahi hi: Muoltung kimvel zosie-a gam buppi khu a siengtho pen hi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tamte pen tong tawh a kite maitam’ golna ahi hi: (a tena tong pen tong khat le zabeh ahi hi). A tunna pen tong khat sangin tong khat gol ding hi. A gei kimvelah khap khat a pha geiviel khat om ding hi. Tam pen maitam’ sanna hi ding hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />A kitunna tuol panin maitam kidaw a neita pen dong tong ni hi a, avai tong khat ahi hi; maitam kidaw a neuzaw panin maitam kidaw a golzaw pen tong li hi a, avai tong khat ahi hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />tuale maitam tap tung teng a sanna tong li ahi hi; maitam tap tung panin ki li poto hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Maitam tap tung pen a kikim ning li nei hi ding a, adung le avai tong sawm le ni ta hi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Maitam kidawte zong a kikim ning li nei hi ding a, adung avai tong sawm le li ta hi ding hi. A geiviel kimvel pen avai tong lang hi a, a kitunna a kimvel tong khat hi ding hi. A kalei nisuo lam kinga ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tua ciengin ama in keima kungah tam bangin ei gen hi: Mihing aw, Topa Pasien in tam bangin ci hi, ci-in gen in: Tam teng pen maitam ading ngaina kip ahi hi: Meihal biehna lui nading le sisan the nadinga tua maitam a kidaw ni ciengin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />ka nasem dinga ka kung ei nai Zadok’ suonlehlah Levi siempute kungah mawna zieha biehna adingin bawngtang khat na pie ding hi, Topa Pasien in ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tuale a si themkhat na la ding a, maitam ki lite tung, maitam kidaw ning lite le a kimvela geivielte tung zosie-ah na nu ding hi; tua bangin maitam siensuo-in tua adingin thoidamna na bawl ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Mawna zieha biehna bawngtang zong na la ding a, mun siengtho pulam biehinnpi huong sunga tuami bawl nadinga a kisesa munah na hal ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />A ni ni ni ciengin mawna zieha biehna adingin nuol baang lo keeltang khat na pie ding hi. Bawngtang tawh a kisiensuo ma bangin maitam kisiensuo ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Na siensuo zaw ciengin nuol baang lo bawngtang khat le ganhon lah pana nuol baang lo tuutang khat na pie ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tua teng pen Topa mai-ah na pie ding a, siempute in a tungah ci the-in Topa tungah meihal biehna-in a pie ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Mawna zieha biehna dingin ni sagi sung nisielin keel khat na pie ding hi; ganhonte lah panin bawngtang khat le tuutang khat zong na pie ding vua, a ni-in nuol baanglo hi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Amate in maitam adingin ni sagi sung thoidamna a bawl ding vua, tua maitam siensuo-in a ap ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tua nite a cin zaw ciengin, a ni giet ni-a kipanin siempute in na meihal biehnate ule thunuoma na biehnate uh maitam tungah pie ding uhi; tuale keima in note kang sang ding hi, Topa Pasien in ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="44" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tua ciengin ama in nisuona lam a kinga mun siengtho’ tunkot pulamah ei peipikia hi; tuale tua tunkot na kikhah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Topa in keima kungah tam bangin gen hi: Tam tunkot kikhah peisuoh ding hi; tua khu kihong lo ding a, tua panin zong koima lut lo ding hi; azieh pen tua panin Israel’ Topa Pasien a lut zo hi; tua ahi ziehin tua tunkot kikhah peisuoh ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ama pen gam uhpa ahi ziehin Topa mai-ah gam uhpa beh an ne dingin to thei ding hi; ama tunkot talaap tawnin ding a, tua lampi ma-ah pusuoh ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tua ciengin ama in leilu lam tunkot tawnin biehinnpi mai-ah ei peipi hi; ka khuodah leh, en vawi! Topa’ biehinnpi sungah Topa’ minthanna vang a dim hi; tuale kei zong tuolah ka bawhsuh pai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Topa in ka kungah tam bangin ei gen hi: Mihing aw, Topa’ biehinnpi tawh kisai-in kang gen ding ngaina kip zosie le a thukhamte zosie hoitahin melci-in limtahin en inlen, hoitahin ngai in; tuale biehinnpi sunga lut thei dingte le mun siengtho pana kipuse dingte zosie hoitahin melci in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />A ledo innkuon, Israel innkuonte kungah Topa Pasien in tam bangin ci hi, ci-in gen in: Israel innkuonte aw,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />note in keima kungah ka neh ding ka an, sathau le sisan nei pieh ciengun, ka mun siengtho-a om dingin lungtang le tahsa tep a kitan lo gamdang mite na lutsahna uh tua a mudahuoi na gamtatnate zosie uh tawpsan un. Note in na sil mudahuoite utawh ka thuciemna na palsat uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ka biehna siengthote na kepcing ta sih uhi; na kepcing tah zawh sangun na sep ding tang teng uh ka mun siengtho sungah gamdang mite na semsah zawsop uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Topa Pasien in tam bangin gen hi: Ka mun siengtho sungah Israel mite lahah a om lungtang le tahsa tep a kitan lo gamdang mite koima a lut sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ahi vangin Israel mite in a pasien’ limte uh nua zui-in keima kung pana a pielmang lai-un keima kung panin gamlapi a vahthap Levi-te in zong dan a thuoh ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Amate ka mun siengtho sunga nasemte ahi vua, biehinnpi tunkotte a van ding le biehinnpi sunga nasem ding ahi uhi; amate in meihal biehna ding le mipite biehpiehna ding gante a go ding vua, amate zenin a na uh a seppieh ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Azieh pen amate in a pasien milimte uh mai-ah a na uh semin khielna sungah Israel innkuonte a puasah uhi, tua ahi ziehin amate in amau’ mawna paat a puo ding uhi, ci-in amate tawh kisai-in ka kiciem zo hi, Topa Pasien in ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Siempu nasem dingin ka nai-ah amate ang pei thei sih ding vua, ka biehna siengthote, sil siengtho pente nai-ah zong ang pei thei sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ahi vangin biehinnpi sunga sep ding a kisam zosie a sem dingin amate ka koi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ahi vangin keima kung panin Israel mite a na pielmang hun sung tengun ka mun siengtho ei na kepcing pieh ahi Zadok’ suonlehlah Levi siempute in ka na sem dingin keima nai-ah ang pei thei ding vua, keima ei zenin sathau le sisante ei pie ding uhi, Topa Pasien in ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ka mun siengtho sungah a tum thei ding pen amate ahi vua, ka sabuoi lam nehin ka na semin ei kemcing ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Leituol sungnung tunkotah amate a lut ciengun amate in saihadiel puon a sil ding uhi; leituol sungnung tunkotte le biehinn sungah na a sep laitahun amate tungah samul puon om lo ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Amate in a lu tung vuah saihadiel puon khimin a kawng vuah saihadiel bawngbi sungten a teng ding uhi; khuosa a kaisah thei ding bangma tawh amate a kigah sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Mipite opna leituol pulamah amate a peikhiet ciengun a naseppi uh puonte suodawhin inndan siengtho sungah tuate a koi ding uhi; tuale amate in amau’ puonsilte tawh mite a siensuo thei lo nadingun puondang a sil ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Amate in a sam uh heukieu loin a zangsam uzong sausah seng lo ding hi; amate in a lutung vua a samte a theu beh ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Leituol sungnungah a lut ciengun siempu koima in zu dawn thei lo ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Amate in meigong khat ahi a, numei kikhulsa khat popo ahi zongin a kinunpi thei sih ding vua, ahi vangin Israel innkuonte’ cihlah ahi ngahnu siengthote beh, ahi sihle siempu khat’ zi ahisa meigongte beh kinunpi thei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Amate in a siengtho le a siengtho lo nate kilamdanna ka mite hilin, a bua le a sieng bangci khen ding ci thu amate a lah ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Thu kiselna sungah amate in thukhen pa-in pangin keima khen dan bangin a khen ding uhi. Amate in a kisesa keima’ pawi zosie tawh kisai-in ka thukhamte le ka thukipte zui-in ka sabbath-te zong a siengtho-in a tang ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Misi luong gei-ah pei-in amau le amau a kibuasah sih ding uhi; azieh pen a nu, a pa, a tanu, a tapa, a sanggam pa, pasal nei lo a sanggamnu uh ahile kibuasah thei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Ama a sientho zaw ciengin amate in ama adingin ni sagi sung sim ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Mun siengtho sunga na sem dingin leituol sungnung mun siengtho sungah a lut ni-in ama in mawna zieha biehna a pie ding hi, Topa Pasien in ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tami khu amau’ gouluo hi ding hi: Kei amau’ gouluo ding ka hi hi; Israel gam sungah amate neisa na pie sih ding hi; kei amau’ neisa ka hi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Amate in an tawh biehna, mawna zieha biehna, khielna zieha biehna sate a ne ding uhi; tuale Israel gam sunga a ki-ap zosie amate ading ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Ga masa zosie lahah ga masa pen le na biehna uh zosie lahah biehna zosie pen siempute ading ahi hi; na innsung vuah thupha a tun thei nadingin siempute tungah na moh em masah pen uh na pie ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Siempute in va ahi a, ganhing ahi zongin, ama thu-a a si, ahi sihle gamsate’ thasa khat popo a ne sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="45" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Note in gou dingin leitang na hawmkhen ciengun, Topa adingin adung tong tul sawmni le tul nga, avai tong tul sawmni a pha leitang se khat gamkhen siengtho-in na tuomkhen ding uhi; tuami huom sung teng zosie a siengtho hi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tam sung panin adung tong zanga, avai tong zanga a pha ning li a nei leitang pen mun siengtho hi ding a, a kimvelah mun-awng tong sawmnga hi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Gamkhen siengtho sungah adung tong tul sawmni le nga le avai tong tulsawm a pha khawh khat na te ding a, tua sungah a siengtho pen mun ahi mun siengtho a om ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tua mun pen gam sungah a siengtho leitang se khat hi ding hi; tua pen a na sem dinga Topa kung a neh, mun siengtho sunga na sem siempute ading hi ding hi; tami mun pen a inn ding ule mun siengtho adingin a siengtho mun hi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Khawh dang khat adung tong tul sawmni le nga, avai tong tul sawm pen biehinnpi sunga na sem Levi-te ten nading le a luo ding uh khuopite’ mun hi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />A siengtho gamkhen dinga na tuomkhen khawh zomah khuopi mun dingin avai tong tulnga, adung tong tul sawmni le nga a pha gam khat na se ding hi; tua pen Israel innkuonte’ tanh hi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A siengtho gamkhen le khuopi mun pang tuoh tunga a om leitang, a siengtho gamkhen le khuopi mun tawh kizompe a, nisuona lam le nitumna lamah omsuohin, Israel minam khat’ tanh gam tawh adung a kibang, nitumna lam panin nisuo lama kihlungsuoh gam teng pen gam-uh ulien pa’ tanh hi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tam pen Israel gam sungah ama gam hi ding hi. Tuale ka gam-uhte in ka mite a gawt nawn sih ding uhi; tuale mahin a minam zui-in Israel innkuonte gam a neisah ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Topa Pasien in tam bangin gen hi: Israel gam-uhte aw, kicing ta! Tatsietna le bawlsietna khawlsan unlen, thuman thutangin gamta un. Ka mite na hawlkhietnate uh khawl un, Topa Pasien in ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Note in tawisuong a man, ephah a man, le bath a man na nei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ephah le bath pen a tena kibangin na zang ding vua, bath khatah homer khat’ sesawm-suo-sekhat ta a, ephah khatah homer khat’ sesawm-suo-sekhat ta hi. Tena dih pen Homer hi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Shekel khat in gerah sawmni khai ding hi. Shekel sawmni, shekel sawmni le nga, le shekel sawm le nga pen nang adingin mina khat hi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tamte pen na biehna pieh dingte uh ahi hi: Mangbu homer khat lah panin ephah seguh suo se khat, mangbuham homer khat lah pan ephah seguh suo se khat hi ding a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />sathau pieh dinga kisesa pen cor khat lah pan bath sesawm-suo-sekhat hi ding hi. (Cor kici pen homer tawh kikimin bath sawm ta hi).
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Israel-te’ lohing lah panin tuuhon zani lahah tuu khat hi ding hi. Tam pen an tawh biehna, meihal biehna, thunuoma biehnate ahi a, amate adingin thoidamna bawl nading ahi hi, Topa Pasien in ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Gam sunga mi zosie in Israel gam-uhpa pawlin tami biehna a pie ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ahi vangin pawibawl nite, hladet nite, sabbath nite le a kisesa Israel innkuonte pawi zosie-ah meihal biehnate, an tawh biehnate, le dawn thei biehnate tawh kisai teng a bawl ding pen gam-uhpa mawpuoh hi ding hi: Israel innkuonte’ thoidamna bawl nadingin ama in mawna zieha biehnate, an tawh biehnate, meihal biehnate, le thunuoma biehnate sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Topa Pasien in tam bangin gen hi: A hla masa a ni masa ni-in nuol baang lo bawngtang guol khat na kai ding a, mun siengtho na siensuo ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Siempu pa in mawna zieha biehna gan si themkhat khat la ding a, biehinnpi khuomte, maitam kidaw ning lite le leituol sungta pen’ tunkot khuomte tungah nu ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Mi khatpo in a bawlkhiel zieh le a thei lo ziehin a maw khah leh khumi hla a ni sagi ni-in khum bang ma-in na bawlkia ding uhi; tuaci’n note in biehinnpi adingin thoidamna na bawl ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />A hla masa a ni sawm le li ni-in peisan pawi na bawl ding vua, tuale ni sagi sung tol kisaw lo an kine ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Khum ni-in gam-uhpa in mawna zieha biehna dingin bawngtang guol khat ama ading le gam sunga mi zosie adingin sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />A pawi bawl uh ni sagi sungin ama in Topa tungah nisielin meihal biehna dingin nuol baang lo bawngtang guol sagi le tuutang sagi sih ding hi; tuale mawna zieha biehna dingin keeltang sagi zong sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Ama in bawngtang khatah an tawh biehna dingin ephah khat le tuutang khatah ephah khat ma, ephah khat ciengin sathau hin khat ta sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />A hla sagi a ni sawm le nga ni-in ni sagi sung pawi a bawlna dingin mawna zieha biehnate, meihal biehnate, an tawh biehnate le sathau adingin nidanga a sih za ma a pie ding hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="46" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa Pasien in tam bangin gen hi: Nisuona lam a kinga leituol sungnung tunkot pen nasep ni guh sung kikhah ding hi; ahi vangin sabbath ni le hladet ni-in kihong ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A pulam panin talaap tunkot zui-in gam-uhpa lut ding a, tunkot khuom gei-ah a ding ding hi. Siempute in ama’ meihal biehnate le thunuoma biehnate pie-in tunkot lutna ah a lukun ding uhi. Tua ciengin ama pei ding a, ahi vangin nitah dongin tunkot kikhah lo ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Sabbath-te le hladet ni ciengin tunkot lutna Topa mai-ah gam sung mite a kun ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Sabbath ni-in gam-uh pa in Topa tunga a pieh meihal biehna pen nuol baanglo tuuno guh le tuutang khat hi ding hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />tuale tuutang tawh a kipieton ding an tawh biehna pen ephah khat hi ding a, tuuno tawh a kipieton ding an tawh biehna pen ama pieh nuom zaza hi ding hi, ephah khat simin sathau hin khat tawh pieton ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hladet ni ciengin ama in nuol baang lo bawngtang guol khat, tuuno guh le tuutang khat pie ding hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />ama in bawngtang khat tawh an tawh biehna dingin ephah khat pie ding a, tuutang tawh ephah khat ma pie-in, tuuno tawh ama pieh nuom zaza pie ding hi, ephah khat simin sathau hin khat ta tawh pieton ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Gam-uhpa a lut ciengin talaap tunkot zui-in lut ding a, tua lampi ma zui-in pusuoh ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />A kisesa pawite ah Topa mai-ah gam mite a pei ciengun Pasien bie dinga leilu lam tunkota a lut poma leitaw lam tunkotah pusuoh ding uhi; leitaw lam tunkota a lut poma leilu lam tunkotah pusuoh ding uh: a lutna uh tunkot zui-in amate pusuoh lo ding a, hinanle a mailam-ah tangtahin a pusuoh ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Amate a lut ciengun, gam-uhpa zong amate tawh lut ding a, amate a pusuo ciengin ama zong pusuoh ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />A pawite ule a hun zui-a a kisesa pawite ah an tawh biehna dingin bawngtang khat le ephah khat hi ding a, tuutang tawh ephah khat ma kipie-in, tuuno tawh a piete in amate pieh nuom zaza pie ding a, ephah khat simin sathau hin khat ta tawh a pieton ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Topa tungah gam-uhpa in nop thu-a biehna dingin meihal biehna ahi a, lungnuoma biehna ahi zongin a pieh ciengin, ama adingin nisuona lam a kinga tunkot kihonpieh ding hi; tuale ama in meihal biehna ahi a, thunuoma biehnate ahi zongin a pieh ciengin sabbath ni-a bangin pie ding hi. Tua ciengin ama pusuoh ding a, ama a pusuo zaw ciengin tunkot kikhah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ama in Topa tungah meihal biehna dingin nisimin nuol baanglo kum khat a pha tuuno khat pie ding hi; ama in zingmawng sielin pie ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tuale ama in tuate tawh an tawh biehna ephah khat seguh suo se khat le anneel a tap suoh zo dingin sathau hin khat sethum-suo-sekhat zingmawng sielin pie zing ding hi; tam pen ngaina kipin kizang zing ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tua bangin tuuno, an tawh biehna le sathaute pen meihal biehna dingin zingmawng sielin kipie zing ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Topa Pasien in tam bangin gen hi: Gam-uhpa in a gouluo panin a tapate lahah khat penpen tungah letsong a pieh leh a tate in tuate a tang ding vua, amate adingin a gouluo uh hi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ahi vangin a gouluo lah panin a nasemte khat penpen tungah letsong a pieh leh, suotah kum dong cieng ama-a’ hi ding a, tua zaw ciengin gam-uhpa kungah tungkia ding hi; a tapate beh in tua letsong pen a gou dingun a kem peisuoh thei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Gam-uhpa in mite’ gou khat popo lahpieh lo ding a, a neisa uh leitang panin zong amate notmang lo ding hi; ka mite khat mama zong amau’ neisa leitang a kilahpieh lo nadingin gam-uhpa in ama’ neisa leitang panin a tapate tungah amau’ gouluo a pie ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tua ciengin ama in tunkot panga om lutna lampi zui-in, sah lama siempute dinga inndei siengtho kiguolte sungah ei peipi hi; tuale khum sung nitumna lam a mongta penah mun khat ka mu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ama in ka kungah, “Tam mun pen siempute in khielna zieha biehna le mawna zieha biehnate a huon nading uh mun le an tawh biehnate a em nading uh mun ahi a, tam pen leituol pulamah tuate peipi loin a siengtho nate tawh mite a lawsah khah lo nading uh ahi hi,” ei ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tua ciengin ama in leituol pulam ah ei peipisuoh a, tuale leituol ning li tengah ei zawpi hi; leituol ning li cietah leituol khat ciet a na om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tua leituol ning lite sungah leituol neute om a, adung tong sawmli avai tong sawmthum ahi hi; a li-un a golna uh kikim hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tua leituol neu lite sunglam kimvel cietah suong kikhengzol guol khat ciet om a, tua suong kiguolte’ a tawguol kimvelah meikhuhte kibawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tua ciengin ama in keima kungah, “Tamte pen biehinnpi sunga nasemte in mite’ biehpiehna sa a huon nading uh anhuon buh ahi hi,” ei ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="47" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tua ciengin ama in biehinnpi lutna ah ei peipi hi; khum munah biehinnpi kotpi sangkil nei panin nisuona lam manaw-in tui a luong hi (biehinnpi pen nisuona lam a kingat zieh ahi hi); tuale maitam leitaw lam, biehinnpi kotpi sangkil leitaw lam tawpna a nei panin tua tui luongsuh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tua ciengin leilu lam tunkot tawnin ei peipi a, a pulam kimvel tengah ei pui-in, nisuona lam a kinga tunkot pulam dong ei vapi kawikawi hi; tuale leitaw lam panin tui ang luong hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tua pa in a khuta a tawi khau khat tawh nisuona lam manaw-in pei a, tong tulkhat dong te-in, tua ciengin tui ei tansah hi; tuami tui pen sietmit ciengah a gei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ama in tong tulkhat ma te leuleu a, tui ei tanpi hi; tua tui khup ciengah a gei hi. Ama in tong tulkhat te be leuleu a, tui eitanpi hi; tua tui kawng ciengah a gei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ama in tong tulkhat te be leuleu a, tuale tua tui pen gunpi khat na hi a, tua tui a khan ziehin ka galkai zo ta sih hi; tua gun a thuh sengin ngap zawh ding le galkai zawh ding gun ahi sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ama in ka kungah, “Mihing aw, tam na mu zo tai mah?” ei ci hi. Tua ciengin ama in gun pangah ei peipikia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ka peikia ciengin gun pang tuoha a po singkung gol tampitah ka mu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ama in keima kungah, “Tam tui pen nisuona gam lam manaw-in luong a, Arabah gamah a lutsuh hi; a vei den tuipi sungah ang lutsuh ciengin tua tui ang cim ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tua gun luonna mun poma-ah ganhing namcin a teng ding vua, tuale khum munah tami tuite ang tun ciengin nga tampi a om ding hi. Tua pen tuicim a suoh ding hi; tua gun a luonna popo-ah ganhing vannuoi a hing ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuipi gei En-gedi panin En-eglaim dong mite dingin nga a beng ding uhi; tua mun pen len khuna mun hi ding hi; tua ngate Tuipi Lien sunga ngate bangin a nam tampitah hi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ahi vangin nawnglah le buon tuite a cim thei tuom sih ding hi; tuate pen ci suoh dinga kinuasie ding ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Gunpi pang tuohah neh thei singkung namcin a po ding hi. A nate vul loin a ga zong hut lo ding a, mun siengtho panin amate adingin tui ang luon ziehin hlasielin ga a tha ga ding uhi. A gate an-in kinei ding a, a nate damna zatui-in kizang ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Topa Pasien in tam bangin gen hi: Tamte pen Israel minam sawm le nite lahah amau’ gouluo dinga na hawmpieh gamgite ahi hi. Joseph in tanh ni nga ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Note in a kikimin na hawm ding uhi; na pu na pate uh tungah tuate pieh dinga ka kiciemsa ahi a, na gouluo dingun tam leitang na luo ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tam pen leitang kigi hi ding hi: Leilu lam pangah Tuipi Lien panin Hethlon lampi zui-in Lebo-hamath ah Zedad dong,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Berothah, Sibraim (tua pen Damascus le Hamth gamgi kikalah om), Hauran gamgi-a a om Hazer-hatticon dong ban ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tuaci’n tuipi panin Damascus leilu lam gamgi-a om Hazar-enon dongah kihlungin leilu lama om Hamath tawh kigamgi ahi hi. Tam pen leilu lam pang hi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Nisuona lam pangah Hauran le Damascus kikal hi ding hi; Jordan gun dung zuisuhin Gilead le Israel gam kikalah suoh ding hi; nisuona tuipi ah Tamar dongin kihlung ding hi. Tam pen nisuona lam pang hi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Leitaw lam pangah Tamar panin Meribath-kadesh tuite dongah kihlung ding a, khum panin Tuipi Lien dongin Egypt Lui zui ding hi. Tam pen leitaw lam pang hi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ni tumna lam pangah Tuipi Lien gamgi hi pai-in Lebo-hamath tawh kigalsai cieng lien hi ding hi. Tam pen ni tumna lam pang hi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tuaci’n Israel minam zui-in note lahah tam gam teng na hawmkhen ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tua gam pen noma’ gouluo ding le note lahah ang teng ta le nau a neisa namdangte adingin na hawm ding uhi. Note adingin amate pen Israel mi a suoh ding uhi; amate pen note tawh Israel minamte lahah gou kihawmpieh ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Koikoi nam sungah tua gamdangte om tanan ule zong, khum munah a gouluo ding uh na pie ding uhi, Topa Pasien in ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="48" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tam teng pen minamte’ min ahi hi: Leilu lam gamgi pan kipanin Hethlon lampi, Lebo-hamath panin Hazar-enon dong ah (tua pen Damascus gamgi tungah om a, leilu lamah Hamath tawh kigamgi hi) kihlung suoh hi. Tuale nisuona lam pang panin nitumna lamah kihlung suohin Dan in tanh khat a tang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Dan gamgi tawh a kimat nisuona lam pang panin nitumna lam pang dong Asher in tanh khat a tang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Asher gamgi tawh a kimat nisuona lam pang panin nitumna lam pang dong Naphtali in tanh khat a tang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Naphtali gamgi tawh a kimat nisuona lam pang panin nitumna lam pang dong Manasseh in tanh khat a tang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Manasseh gamgi tawh a kimat nisuona lam pang panin nitumna lam pang dong Ephraim in tanh khat a tang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ephraim gamgi tawh a kimat nisuona lam pang panin nitumna lam pang dong Reuben in tanh khat a tang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Reuben gamgi tawh a kimat nisuona lam pang panin nitumna lam pang dong Judah in tanh khat a tang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Judah gamgi tawh a kimat nisuona lam pang panin nitumna lam pang dong se khat pen na tuomkoi ding vua, avai tong tul sawmni le nga le adung nisuona lam pang panin nitumna lam pang dong minam khat’ tanh za tawh kikim ding a, tua gam laikim tahah mun siengtho om ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Topa adinga na tuomkhen tanh khat pen adung tong tul sawmni le nga, avai tong tul sawmni hi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tamte pen a kihawm ding tanh siengthote ahi hi: Siempute in tanh khat a nei ding vua, a golna pen leilu lam pangah tong tul sawmni nga pha ding a, nitumna lam pangah avai tong tul sawm pha-in, nisuona lam pangah avai tong tul sawm ma pha ding a, leitaw lam pangah tong tul sawmni le nga pha-in tua gam laikim tahah Topa’ mun siengtho om ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tam mun pen Israel mite a vahmang hun lai vua Levi-te banga a vahmang lo, ka na a sem Zadok’ suonlehlahte ahi a kisiensuosa siempute ading ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Gam sung leitang siengthote lah panin Levi-te tawh a kigamgi siengtho pen mun khat, amau’ aituom tanh hi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Siempute’ gamgi zomah Levi-te in adung tong tul sawmni le nga, avai tong tul sawmni a pha tanh khat nei ding uhi. Adung a unpi-in tong tul sawmni le nga hi ding a, avai tong tul sawmni hi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Amate in tuate zua thei loin na khatpo tawh zong hleh thei lo ding hi. Amate in a kituomteel tam gam’ tanh pen koima tungah piesawn thei lo ding hi, azieh pen tua khu Topa adingin a siengtho hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />A omlai leitang, avai tong tulnga le adung tong tul sawmni le nga pen khuopi adingin dei bang banga zah ding hi a, ten nading le mun-awnga om ding ahi hi. Khum laikimah khuopi a om ding hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />tuale khuopi a zaina tam bang dan hi ding hi: Leilu lam pang tong tul li le zanga, leitaw lam pang tong tul li le zanga, nisuona lam pang tong tul li le zanga, nitumna lam pang tong tul li le zanga pha kim ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Khuopi in gam-awng nei ding hi: Leilu lamah tong zani le sawmnga, leitaw lamah tong zani le sawmnga, nisuona lamah tong zani le sawmnga, nitumna lamah tong zani le sawmnga pha kim ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Mun siengtho tanh zomah a omlai teng a dung nisuona lamah tong tul sawm, nitumna lamah tong tul sawm ma hi ding a, mun siengtho tanh tawh kizom ding hi. Tam gama a piengte pen khuopi sunga nasemte’ kivana an ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Israel minam zosie lah panin khuopi sunga nasemte in tua leitang a hlo ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Na tuomkoi ding tanh buppi pen ning li kikim tong tul sawmni le nga hi ding a, khum pen khuopi neisa tawh a kisimtha a siengtho tanh ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />A siengtho tanh le khuopi neisa pang tuohah a omlai teng pen gam-uhpa ading ahi hi. Gam siengtho tanh panin nisuona lamah tong tul sawmni le nga, le nitumna lamah tong tul sawmni nga dong a kihlungsuh, minamte’ tanh tawh a kitang teng pen gam-uhpa ading ahi hi. Tuami laikimah a siengtho tanh le biehinnpi’ mun siengtho a om ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Levi-te neisa le khuopi pen gam-uhpa’ tanh ding gam laikimah a om ding hi. Gam-uhpa’ tanh pen ahile Judah le Benjamin gamgi kikal teng hi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Minamdang a omlaite ading pen: Nisuona lam pang panin nitumna lam pang dong Benjamin in tanh khat a tang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Benjamin gamgi tawh a kimat, nisuona lam pang panin nitumna lam pang dong Simeon in tanh khat a tang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Simeon gamgi tawh a kimat, nisuona lam pang panin nitumna lam pang dong Issachar in tanh khat a tang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Issachar gamgi tawh a kimat, nisuona lam pang panin nitumna lam pang dong Zebulun in tanh khat a tang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Zebulun gamgi tawh a kimat nisuona lam pang panin nitumna lam pang dong Gad in tanh khat a tang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Gad gamgi tawh a kimat leitaw lam gam teng pen Tamar panin Meribath-kadesh tuite dongin kihlungsuh ding a, khum mun panin Egypt Lui zuisuhin Tuipi Lien dong hi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tam pen Israel minamte lahah gouluo dinga na hawm ding uh gam hi a, tamte amau’ tanh dingte ahi hi, Topa Pasien in ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Khuopi pan pusuona ding tam teng hi ding hi: A kitena-ah leilu lam pangah tong tul li le zanga a pha
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />tunkot thum om ding a, Reuben tunkot, Judah tunkot, le Levi tunkotte ahi a, tua khuopi tunkotte pen Israel minamte’ min kitap ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Nisuona lam pangah tong tul li le zanga a pha tunkot thum om ding a, Joseph tunkot, Benjamin tunkot, le Dan tunkotte ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />A kitena-ah leitaw lam pangah tong tul li le zanga a pha tunkot thum om ding a, Simeon tunkot, Issachar tunkot, le Zebulun tunkotte ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Nitumna lam pangah tong tul li le zanga a pha tunkot thum om ding a, Gad tunkot, Asher tunkot, le Naphtali tunkotte ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Khuopi a kimvelin tong tul sawm le giet hi ding hi. Khum huna kipanin khuopi min pen, ‘ Topa Khumnah a om hi,’ kici ding hi,” ei ci hi.
  </para>
</usx>
